window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4401,"title":"Chapter 4401 Earn a lot (8)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli's face was filled with a troubled expression,\" But, this...\" This isn't very good, right?\"","\"What's not good about it? Miss Huang, you are definitely not disobeying the Patriarch's orders!\"","\" Yes, yes, yes. Although Patriarch Zhao Lin's orders are important, he still has to be reasonable, right?\"","Miss Huang, you don't have to worry. If something goes wrong, we definitely won't implicate you!\"","\"Miss Huang, don't you need medicinal herbs? If you need anything, just tell me! For the sake of the medicinal herbs, let us eat a little!\"","Yan Zhu recalled that Huang Yueli liked all sorts of heavenly and earthly treasures and had an idea, planning to use these herbs to lure her into taking the bait.","Huang Yueli hesitated for quite a while before she reluctantly replied: \" Alright then. I really need the medicinal ingredients so... I'll let you guys eat a little. However, you absolutely can't let Patriarch Zhao Lin know!\"","\"No, no, he definitely won't know! We will definitely be careful!\"","When the Phoenixes saw that she had relented, they quickly went home and brought over baskets of medicinal herbs.","When Huang Yueli saw this, her face was still reluctant but her heart was already all smiles.","This Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was indeed a treasure land!","It was rare to see such a naive trait in the twelve continents of the Ancient God Clans. This place was still the best!","The Phoenixes were completely unaware of Huang Yueli's inner thoughts. Not only did they not know that they had been set up by Huang Yueli, they even felt that Huang Yueli had reluctantly agreed to cook fried chicken for them under their coaxing and pestering.","Everyone felt sorry for her.","Therefore, the herbs they brought this time were even rarer and more precious. There were even many Phoenixes who took the initiative to take out their treasures.","Huang Yueli's eyes lit up and her saliva was about to flow down but she still restrained herself and rejected,\" Cough cough, that...You're too polite. This is too expensive. I can't accept it, I can't accept it...\"","\"Tsk! Hypocrite, you're too much of a hypocrite!\"","Little Wang Cai appeared out of nowhere with an expression of being unable to take it and could not help but complain.","Huang Yueli's movements froze as she grabbed Little Wang Cai's collar and pulled him behind her. She lowered her voice and gritted her teeth: \" Shut up! If you spoil my plan, I'll throw you into the frying pan! Anyway, you look very similar to the fried chicken inside!\"","\"Female Devil, quickly let go of me! I'm so handsome and suave, how do I look like an old hen?\"","Little Wang Cai kicked its short legs and struggled desperately.","Although he spoke with a firm tone, he was a little nervous in his heart.","The Female Devil was capable of doing anything. She wouldn't really lay a vicious hand on him, would she?","However, he quickly remembered that he was now in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, the headquarters of the Phoenix Clan. His confidence was immediately boosted.","\"Female Devil, I'm warning you, hurry up... Hurry up and let go of This Lord! Otherwise, I'll call for help!\"","Huang Yueli glared at him,\" What do you have to do to shut up?\"","\"I want two...No, three fried chicken legs!\"","Huang Yueli's lips twitched,\"... Alright, deal!\"","When Little Wang Cai saw her agreeing so quickly, he immediately realized that he had suffered a loss. He immediately corrected himself,\" No, no, no. I said it wrong just now. I want five fried chicken legs!\"","\".. I think I'll just throw you into the frying pan!\"","\"Darn, you're so fierce...Three is three then...\"","Under Huang Yueli's long accumulated prestige, Little Wang Cai was still a little cowardly and could only agree to her conditions."]},{"number":4402,"title":"Chapter 4402 Earn a lot (9)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli's stall reopened.","Business was booming.","The only difference was that she used to sell roast chicken, but now she sold fried chicken.","As time passed, the fragrance of fried chicken wafted out.","More and more Phoenixes came to Huang Yueli's courtyard.","In the beginning, everyone was still sneaky, feeling guilty and not daring to speak loudly.","However, as the number of people in the small courtyard increased, the Phoenixes held the mentality of not punishing the masses and had less and less scruples.","The Phoenixes thought that Huang Yueli was risking her life to cook for them and each of them was extremely touched as they took out their precious collection and baskets of medicinal herbs piled up into a small hill in the courtyard.","Furthermore, they were all rare herbs that were specified on Huang Yueli's list.","Huang Yueli saw it and she couldn't stop smiling.","\"Thank you, uncle! This is your chicken drumstick, and this chicken wing is on the house. You're welcome to come again next time!\"","Huang Yueli imitated the peddler she saw in the market back then, flattering the customers with her sweet mouth. This was the first time she realised that she had the talent to do small business.","Little Wang Cai looked on from the side with endless disdain.","\"Hmph, don't think that you can continue your business just because you deceived my clansmen! Let me tell you, you're definitely done for! When my Big Brother gets the news, he'll 08:50","definitely be furious. You're committing an additional crime! Big Brother will definitely teach you a lesson!\"","When Huang Yueli heard this, she wasn't as nervous as Little Wang Cai had imagined.","On the contrary, she was smiling sweetly.","\"I guess your Big Brother won't come. Patriarch Zhao Lin is a Patriarch with great prestige. He would definitely consider the people and understand the people's feelings. Everyone likes fried chicken so much. He won't make things difficult for everyone.\"","Little Wang Cai widened his eyes and looked at her in disbelief.","\"Female Devil, is your brain fried? How could my Big Brother be so kind! What he hates the most is when others ignore his words! You're definitely done for this time!\"","Huang Yueli swept him a glance,\" Do you want to make a bet?\"","\"Bet...What are we betting on?\"","\"Let's bet on whether your Big Brother will come and stop me?\"","\"Of course...\"","Little Wang Cai blurted out but when he saw the gentle smile on Huang Yueli's face, he quivered for no reason as he felt a chill rising from his back.","He quickly changed his words.\" Of course not! Who knows what trap you dug for me to jump into? I don't believe you!\"","\"Tsk, this child...You're really getting less and less cute as you grow up!\" Huang Yueli ridiculed disappointedly as she waved her hand,\" Alright, alright, go to one side and don't eat secretly!\"","Under the Female Devil's forced gaze, Little Wang Cai could only withdraw its small claws that were reaching for the pot of oil and hide in a corner to eat its three chicken drumsticks.","As he gnawed, he drew circles in his heart to curse Huang Yueli.","\"Just you wait, my Big Brother will definitely destroy you on behalf of justice!\"","However, Little Wang Cai waited and waited until the sky gradually darkened, but his Big Brother still did not appear.","Huang Yueli had been selling fried chicken for an entire day and earned a huge profit. Although she would occasionally take time to collect herbs in her space, but it still filled up the entire courtyard.","\"Alright, that's all for today. My husband and I are going to cultivate.\"","Huang Yueli massaged her sore waist and gave the order to send the guests off.","The Phoenixes turned back to stare at the pot of oil and left reluctantly.","Little Wang Cai's mouth opened wide as he had no choice but to accept the truth...His Big Brother really didn't appear!"]},{"number":4403,"title":"Chapter 4403 Earn a lot (10)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai could not figure it out no matter how he thought about it.","But Huang Yueli didn't have any intention to explain. After the Phoenixes left, she started to tidy up the herbs piled up in the courtyard.","Little Wang Cai looked left and right and seeing that Huang Yueli didn't have any intention to bother with him, he could only turn around and leave with a stomach full of suspicion.","But at this moment, Huang Yueli suddenly called out to him.","\"Wait, Wang Cai! Don't leave yet!\"","\"Wang...What Wang Cai! How many times have I told you? I'm not a dog. I'm a domineering and handsome ancient divine beast Phoenix...\"","\"Wang Cai, there are still a few fried chicken drumsticks here. Take them away!\"","\".. What? Wha- What was that? What did you say?\"","Little Wang Cai widened his eyes. He really felt that his cultivation had been too hard recently, causing his primordial spirit to be damaged.","Why did he keep having such hallucinations!","His Female Devil actually gave him chicken drumsticks to eat again!","Huang Yueli beamed as she said: \" You didn't hear wrongly. These last few chicken drumsticks are all for you. My husband and I don't like to eat fried things so you can help us eat them!\"","Little Wang Cai could not believe his ears!","This was already the second time!","This was the second time the Female Devil had been so kind as to give him chicken drumsticks!","If she could still talk about it the first time when she suddenly had a conscience, then this second time...It was really too frightening!","\"Female Devil, you...Could it be that something went wrong with your brain when you were cultivating...\"","\"You're the one who has a problem with your brain!\"","Huang Yueli couldn't maintain the smile on her face and her expression changed as she grabbed Little Wang Cai's collar and lifted it up,\" If you continue to be so long-winded, not only will there be no drumsticks, I will also turn you into a roasted drumstick!\"","\"Ugh, Female Devil, I was wrong, I was wrong, alright? Let me down, let me down!\"","Little Wang Cai's face twisted as he felt the boiling oil temperature rising from below his body.","He couldn't believe that the Female Devil could be so cruel!","At this moment, he couldn't care less about his face. He began to shout and beg for mercy at the top of his voice.","Huang Yueli was originally trying to scare him and seeing him cower, she gave a cold snort and placed him on the ground.","\"Alright, take your drumstick and leave quickly. My husband and I need to rest!\"","Little Wang Cai's feet landed on the ground and he was still in a state of shock. Not only was the clothes on his back completely soaked in cold sweat, but his legs were also trembling non-stop and he could not stand steadily at all.","Hearing Huang Yueli's words, he was tongue-tied.","The Female Devil was actually willing to give him the drumstick!","This... What was going on? When did she become so kind?","Did she really start to have a conscience?","He was afraid that Huang Yueli would go back on her words and hurriedly pounced over, hugging the chicken drumstick that Huang Yueli had wrapped with lotus leaves as he rushed out wildly.","He was really too excited and totally didn't realise that the instant he turned around, Huang Yueli's lips curled up into a sly smile.","Little Wang Cai carried the lotus leaf bun and quickly ran out of the courtyard. His footsteps paused for a moment.","After thinking for a while, he once again rushed into the dense forest.","He didn't know why the Female Devil was so kind, but since he got the drumstick, he had to finish it immediately!","As he thought about it, he opened the lotus leaf bag, took out the chicken drumstick, and brought it to his mouth...","Suddenly, a black shadow flashed in front of him.","The chicken drumstick in Little Wang Cai's hand disappeared once again!","He was stunned for a moment before he screamed, \"Argh! Who dares to snatch my drumstick? You're courting death! Big, big, big... Big Brother?!\""]},{"number":4404,"title":"Chapter 4404 Three Year Agreement (1)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai suddenly turned his head and was about to fly into a rage when he saw Zhao Lin's tall figure standing behind him, looking down at him.","Little Wang Cai's curses that were already at the tip of his tongue were instantly stuck in his throat.","\"What did I tell you, Zhao Hua?\" Zhao Lin looked down at him expressionlessly and asked coldly. \"I told you not to eat such greasy things anymore. It will affect your cultivation. Have you turned a deaf ear to it?\"","Little Wang Cai quivered and his face turned pale.","However, after he reacted, he immediately defended himself. You can't blame me for this alone, can you? Everyone... Everyone has eaten...\"","In order to get rid of this black pot as soon as possible, little Wang Cai decisively sold out all his clansmen.","However, for some reason, Zhao Lin's expression did not show any surprise.","He stared at Little Wang Cai for a while before snorting coldly, \"Others may have ate fried chicken, but can you eat fried chicken? No matter what others did, you made a mistake and should be punished!\"","Zhao Lin interrupted him very arbitrarily.","Little Wang Cai had a bitter expression as he cried out,\" Big Brother, you... you can't do this! I only ate a little...\"","\"A little? Then what is that in your hand? And you're still walking and eating at the same time?\"","\"I... I... This... This...\"","Little Wang Cai stuttered for a long time but could not say anything to refute.","He almost cried on the spot!","Poor little phoenix felt bitter in his heart!","The other Phoenixes in the clan had eaten several fried chickens, but he had only eaten three drumsticks from the beginning to the end.","Before he left, he was lucky enough to get the remaining fried chicken from Huang Yueli and before he could even take a bite, he was caught by his Eldest Brother!","It was the same last time. The roast chicken in his hand was confiscated by his brother before he could even feel the warmth of it.","Why was he always the one getting the short end of the stick?","Zhao Lin glanced at him coldly.\" Now, go back to your courtyard immediately. Start cultivating from now on. Before you comprehend the third level of the Phoenix Secret Manual, you are not allowed to step out of the courtyard! Don't even think about hiding in your room and slacking off. I'll go over to supervise you from time to time every day.\"","When Little Wang Cai heard this, his face was filled with despair.","He had been especially mischievous since he was young. He could not sit still at all. Every time he cultivated for two to three hours, he could not help but run out to play.","If not for this, with his talent, he would not have such little strength.","Now, Big Brother actually wanted him to cultivate in seclusion!","Before comprehending the third stage of the Phoenix Secret Manual, he was not allowed to leave the house!","Oh my gosh, this was worse than killing him!","\"Big Brother, this is too unrealistic. If I want to comprehend the third stage, at least...At least half a month...What should I eat...\" Little Wang Cai tried to act pitiful to convince Zhao Lin.","\" I've prepared a basket of grass for you,\" Zhao Lin said lightly. \" It's enough for you to eat for half a month. Hurry up and go back!\"","\"One, one, one... basket of grass?\"","Little Wang Cai's vision went black and he almost fainted.","By the time he came back to his senses, Zhao Lin had already left the forest.","Of course, he also took away the two fried chicken that had been fried until it was golden and shiny.","Little Wang Cai was extremely depressed but he did not dare to disobey his Big Brother's orders and could only return to cultivate.","However, even when he dragged his feet back to the courtyard, he still could not figure out why his brother would appear in the dense forest and snatch his fried chicken.","Why was he so unlucky!"]},{"number":4405,"title":"Chapter 4405 Three Year Agreement (2)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin really did what he said and really placed a basket of fresh tender grass in Little Wang Cai's courtyard.","Other than that, there was nothing else.","Moreover, Zhao Lin had even set up an array outside his courtyard, making it impossible for him to take a step out of the courtyard at all.","If he wanted to force his way out, he would activate the array.","If that happened, Zhao Lin would definitely rush to the scene. What would be waiting for Little Wang Cai next would be an even more inhumane drill...","Helplessly, Little Wang Cai had no other choice but to suppress his anger and cultivate hard.","When Huang Yueli heard of this grievous news, she said in a heavy tone: \" Isn't Patriarch Zhao Lin a little too strict? Although Wang Cai is already 100,000 years old, his temperament was still like a child. If we force him to cultivate like this, he won't have a childhood!\"","Li Moying swept her a glance and said in a funny tone,\" Li 'er, when you pity Wang Cai, can you not laugh so happily?\"","This was clearly gloating!","Huang Yueli threw herself into his embrace and glared at him,\" Which eye of yours saw me smile? Which eye!\"","Li Moying really wanted to say that both his eyes had seen it.","However, in the face of his fierce wife, he immediately admitted defeat.\" I saw wrong.\"","\"That's more like it!\"","Huang Yueli gave a humph and was satisfied.","But then, he felt a little regretful.\" It's a pity that such a good laborer like Wang Cai can't be used now. He can help collect debts with just two chicken drumsticks. He even knows how to shout. In the end, we can even get him to help bribe Zhao Lin and send chicken drumsticks. Where can we find such a good worker?\"","But the facts proved that Huang Yueli was overthinking.","That was because in less than three days, one evening, a dazzling golden light suddenly emitted from Little Wang Cai's courtyard. It was like a cover that enveloped the entire courtyard.","Huang Yueli curiously ran out to take a look.","She saw a large group of Phoenixes surrounding the entrance of little Wang Cai's courtyard, clicking their tongues in praise.","\"Young Master Zhao Hua is really too amazing! He actually only used three days to cultivate the Phoenix Secret Manual to the third stage!\"","\"That's right, this is simply an astonishing talent! I heard that only 300,000 years ago, when our Phoenix clan was at its peak, did such a genius appear in our clan!\"","\"Amazing! Moreover, Young Master Zhao Hua has just completed the Nirvana Ceremony not long ago. His spirit body has yet to completely adapt to his new physical body, but he actually broke through so quickly. It's simply unbelievable...\"","Hearing these discussions, Huang Yueli also understood.","\"I couldn't tell that this little guy is really a cultivation genius!\"","Thinking of this point, Huang Yueli felt proud and disappointed at the same time as she lowered her head.","Li Moying looked at her in astonishment,\" What's wrong, Li 'er? Aren't you happy?\"","Although his Li 'er often bicker with Little Wang Cai, but the relationship between them was very good.","Little Wang Cai's innate talent was shocking so Huang Yueli should be feeling very happy.","But now, her reaction made Li Moying feel a little surprised.","Huang Yueli stretched out her small hand and grabbed onto Li Moying's clothes as she said softly,\" Husband, do you feel that... Little Wang Cai followed me and was such a waste all these years because of me?\"","Li Moying's brows furrowed even tighter,\" Why do you think so? You're not a Phoenix, of course you won't know how to stimulate his potential like his clansmen.\""]},{"number":4406,"title":"Chapter 4406 Three Year Agreement (3)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli shook her head,\" You can't say that either. In the past when I was in Soaring Heavens Continent, I had already obtained the Sacred Phoenix Race's secret manual regarding raising Phoenixes and there were also some related contents recorded within. It's just that I've never been able to strictly follow the contents of the secret manual.\"","Little Wang Cai was not an ordinary child of a Phoenix.","Although he had been trapped in the Sky Phoenix Ring and had almost no contact with the outside world, hence his nature was pure and innocent, no matter if it was his appearance or character, he was no different from a three to five year old child.","However, he had indeed lived for more than 100,000 years.","In such a long period of time, Little Wang Cai had read through all sorts of books in the Sky Phoenix Ring and he actually knew a lot. Furthermore, he had become very stubborn and had a little temper.","Every time Huang Yueli restricted his diet or forced him to cultivate, Little Wang Cai would always have a way to throw a tantrum and roll around shamelessly, using all sorts of methods to express his protest.","And although Huang Yueli appeared very strong on the surface, but when facing the people she cared about, she would often be soft-hearted.","Seeing that Little Wang Cai was so disgusted, she had never forced him.","After all, Huang Yueli had always believed that by relying on her own cultivation, she would be able to obtain formidable strength and didn't need to rely on Little Wang Cai to work for her.","Now that she thought about it, she seemed to have really harmed Little Wang Cai by doing this...","Otherwise, by relying on this little thing's talent, it should also be at least equivalent to the Ancient God Clan's Dao Profound Realm strength now.","Li Moying stared at his little fox's dim little face for a while and easily guessed her thoughts.","The corners of his mouth curled up slightly.\" You, don't worry so much. This just shows that when you become a mother in the future, you will definitely dote on your child very much. I have no choice but to work harder as a father.\"","Huang Yueli's small face turned red as she couldn't help but glare at him,\" What nonsense are you spouting? Who... Who's a mother? You're dreaming! Hmph! If you want to be a father, wait another hundred years!\"","Her words were not purely out of anger.","According to the rules of the Divine Realm, the higher one's talent, the higher one's strength, and the higher one's bloodline, the lower the possibility of having offspring.","According to her and Li Moying's innate talent and cultivation speed...It was already a miracle that she could get pregnant in a hundred years!","Li Moying raised his brows,\" Am I dreaming? This is normal! I don't believe that with my ability, I need to work hard for a hundred years to bear fruit.\"","These words were too dirty.","Huang Yueli raised her head and rolled her eyes at the man.","\"Shut up. If you continue spouting nonsense, I'll ignore you!\"","After being interrupted by Li Moying, Huang Yueli seemed to have forgotten about her earlier sense of loss as she returned to her usual self.","Li Moying heaved a sigh of relief.","But Huang Yueli wasn't as heartless as she appeared on the surface.","After realizing what mistake she had made, she made a decision in her heart.","..","Days passed.","In the blink of an eye, another half a month passed.","Huang Yueli would set up a stall in her courtyard every two days to sell various dishes.","The Phoenixes were all very supportive, bringing all kinds of medicinal herbs to the door every time.","Huang Yueli received more and more medicinal herbs, making her happy every day, smiling from ear to ear.","Every time, Zhao Lin was unable to arrive at the scene \" in time.\"","But at the same time, every time Little Wang Cai brought the chicken drumstick that Huang Yueli gave him and left, he would 'coincidentally' bump into his Eldest Brother and be cut off.","Not only did he not get to eat anything delicious, but he was also miserably locked up to cultivate again."]},{"number":4407,"title":"Chapter 4407 Three Year Agreement (4)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai was so angry that he was about to cry!","He could not understand why he was so unlucky!","Why was it that the other Phoenixes were eating their drumsticks without any punishment, but he was the only one who was caught red-handed every time!","Was he really unlucky?","Although little Wang Cai was filled with resentment, Zhao Lin's restraining order was still very effective.","In this short period of time, Little Wang Cai broke through to the fourth stage of the Phoenix Secret Manual.","Such talent and cultivation speed once again shocked all the Phoenixes!","Even Zhao Lin felt gratified.","During this period of time, other than cooking and taking stock of the herbs, Huang Yueli spent the rest of her time on dual cultivation with Li Moying.","As she got married to Li Moying for a longer period of time, Huang Yueli was getting more and more used to dual cultivation with him. When faced with his incomparably handsome face, she often couldn't say a word of rejection and her head would spin as she was pounced on by the man.","By the time she came back to her senses, it would usually be the next morning.","The effect of their dual cultivation was also becoming more and more shocking.","In the past when Huang Yueli and Li Moying dual cultivated, it was almost a one-sided gain from Li Moying. Because her own cultivation was lower, so her improvement during dual cultivation was greater.","Ever since Huang Yueli broke through to the Late Heart Profound Realm, the situation had changed.","The difference in their cultivation levels was not too big now. The dual cultivation had mutually promoted each other's behavior. In addition, the concentration of Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was much denser than the outside world. Therefore, the progress of the two was also very shocking.","After staying in the canyon for a month, both of them had reached the peak of the Heart Profound Realm.","He was only a thin line away from breaking through to Dao Profound Realm.","However, breaking through this bottleneck was no longer something that could be done just by relying on simple cultivation.","Dao Profound Realm and above martial artists could already be included in the Divine Realm's top experts 'ranks. It was because going from peak Heart Profound Realm to Dao Profound Realm was a huge hurdle.","Many Divine Realm martial artists were unable to cross it in their entire lives.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying cultivated for a few more days but there wasn't any obvious improvement so they quickly realised where the problem was.","\"Looks like we should be leaving the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge...\" Huang Yueli said softly.","Li Moying lowered his head and gave her a kiss on her face,\" You're leaving just like that? That's right. If we want to break through the bottleneck, the best way is to gain insights through actual combat. The battlefield between the Protoss and the Demons is nearby, so joining the military base nearby is the best choice. However, are you willing to leave just like that?\"","Phoenix Tranquility Gorge was definitely a paradise.","The dense Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth made cultivation twice as effective. There were all kinds of rare herbs growing around the canyon, and the Phoenixes were simple, kind, and hospitable.","More importantly, this was Little Wang Cai's hometown.","Huang Yueli didn't hesitate as she nodded her head vigorously,\" Although I can't bear to leave, but when it's time to leave, I still have to leave! To me, nothing is more important than pursuing the peak of cultivation!\"","After she finished speaking, she suddenly felt that something was wrong. She paused and added,\" Except for you.\"","The gentleness in Li Moying's eyes almost overflowed as he couldn't help but grab Huang Yueli's waist as he lowered his head to kiss her lips.","..","After making up her mind, Huang Yueli didn't delay any further and went to look for Zhao Lin the next day.","Zhao Lin was obviously surprised.\" You're leaving Phoenix Tranquility Gorge? When are you leaving?\""]},{"number":4408,"title":"Chapter 4408 Three Year Agreement (5)","paragraphs":["\"My husband and I are preparing to leave tomorrow morning.\"","Before she greeted Zhao Lin, she had already made preparations in advance and packed everything she needed to take away.","She and Li Moying had already been stuck at the bottleneck of Heart Profound Realm for a few days and it was obviously not a solution to continue like this so she had already decided to leave as soon as possible.","Zhao Lin didn't know what to say.","Honestly speaking, he had been hoping for Huang Yueli and the rest to scram for a very long time!","From the day Little Wang Cai's Nirvana Grand Ceremony succeeded, he had wanted to kick Huang Yueli and Li Moying out of the house.","But because Huang Yueli was Little Wang Cai's life savior, it wasn't good to chase her away so he could only force himself to accept two Ancient God Clans wandering back and forth in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge.","Who knew that now that a month had passed, he had actually begun to get used to the fact that there were two Ancient God Clans in the gorge.","Thinking about the two of them leaving, he actually felt a little reluctant.","In the future, it would probably be very difficult to eat such delicious chicken drumsticks again...","Zhao Lin was in a daze for a while, but in the end, reason prevailed.","He nodded.\" Alright, since you already have a plan, then I have nothing to say. \"However, I have to remind you that Wang Cai can no longer leave with you. He has to stay by my side to cultivate properly. You should have already prepared for this, right?\"","Huang Yueli's eyes dimmed a little.","However, she still nodded.\" Yes, I understand. Wang... Zhao Hua should stay in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge to cultivate.\"","Although after her rebirth, she had been together with Little Wang Cai for a few years and the time she spent with Little Wang Cai was even longer than the time she spent with Li Moying.","He really couldn't bear to separate.","However, seeing Little Wang Cai's cultivation increase by leaps and bounds, she had to admit that it was much better for the little fellow to stay in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge than to follow her.","She couldn't let her selfishness affect the little guy's future.","Zhao Lin had already made preparations to use both carrot and stick to force Huang Yueli to keep his younger brother.","Who knew that before he could use any tricks, Huang Yueli had already given in.","Zhao Lin was stunned for a moment before reacting.\" Since you're so understanding, I'm relieved.\" Zhao Hua is a rare genius in our Phoenix Clan that is hard to come by even in 100,000 years, and he is also one of the only remaining members of the Imperial Clan. If anything happens to me in the future, the Phoenix Clan will still need to rely on him to lead.\"","\"However, you can rest assured that your strength has been damaged because you separated the Artifact Spirit. I will make up for this loss...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, there was the sound of footsteps coming from the corridor outside the door.","The door was knocked open from the outside.","A small figure suddenly pounced in.","Little Wang Cai did not even manage to stand properly before he panted loudly,\" Female devil, female devil! I heard that you're leaving the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. Is that true?\"","It was rare for Huang Yueli to have a serious expression as she faced him and nodded solemnly,\" That's right, my husband and I will be leaving tomorrow.\"","\"What? So fast? Why didn't you inform me earlier? I still have a lot of things to deal with! I've just started cultivating the fifth stage of the Phoenix Secret Manual. It's too rushed to leave now...\"","Little Wang Cai quickly complained.","Huang Yueli gave a slight sigh as she coughed and interrupted him,\" Wang Cai, it was me and Moying who will leave... As for you...well, it's better to stay here and cultivate by your brother's side.\""]},{"number":4409,"title":"Chapter 4409 Three Year Agreement (6)","paragraphs":["Little Wang Cai was halfway through his words when he suddenly stopped.","His eyes widened as he stared at Huang Yueli, as though he couldn't understand what she was saying.","After a long while, he finally reacted and could not help but scream,\" Female Devil, you...\" What do you mean? You want to leave me here and run away on your own? You... How could you do this?\"","Huang Yueli took a deep breath as she tried to comfort him,\" Wang Cai, let me finish first. I don't want to be separated from you either, but I'm doing this for you...\"","However, before she could finish her words, she was interrupted by Little Wang Cai's outburst.","\"You're cruel, you're heartless! You're ungrateful! A beast with a human face! You're worse than a beast!\"","Huang Yueli's lips twitched continuously.","This devilish brat, he was really going to tear the roof tiles apart if she didn't beat him up for three days!","Who did he learn this idiom from? Was it used indiscriminately like this?","Before she could fly into a rage, Zhao Lin could no longer listen to his brother's words.\" Enough, stop talking nonsense! As the only remaining member of the royal family of our Phoenix clan, can't you have some basic upbringing? Otherwise, if others see it, they will think that I, as their elder brother, didn't teach you well!\"","Little Wang Cai puffed up his cheeks, clearly unconvinced.","However, he pursed his lips and did not say anything in the end. He lowered his head.","Huang Yueli was speechless.","She finally realized that this devilish brat was a classic example of bullying the weak and fearing the strong!","When he saw her, he would throw a tantrum and roll around. Facing Li Moying and Zhao Lin, this kind of evil force, he immediately cowered...","Zhao Lin saw that Little Wang Cai was silent and spoke with a serious expression,\" Zhao Hua, Miss Huang and I have already discussed it. You will stay in the clan and continue to cultivate.\"","When Little Wang Cai heard this, he could not hold it in anymore,\" I don't want to stay in the clan. I just like to train with the Female Devil...\"","\"Shut up, don't be willful!\" Zhao Lin's tone became stern again.\" With your little strength, you're too embarrassed to say that you're from the Phoenix clan when you go out. You still want to train? Other than eating and playing, what else can you do? Could it be that he is dragging Miss Huang down?\"","\"I...\"","Little Wang Cai wanted to retort but he opened his mouth but did not know how to retort.","Because what his brother said seemed to be the truth...","Zhao Lin's tone softened a little.\" You should have felt it yourself. You're outside with Miss Huang and you can't get the resources of the clan at all. When you cultivate, there's no one to guide you, so your progress is very slow. However, your talent is very good. After returning to the clan, your strength has improved by leaps and bounds. Therefore, if you want to increase your strength, you can only stay in the family!\"","Little Wang Cai lowered his head and pursed his lips, not saying a word.","Actually, how could he possibly not know the logic that Zhao Lin said?","It was also very clear that when Huang Yueli's strength was low, it could still turn the tide of the battle at the crucial moment.","But as Huang Yueli's strength increased further, its importance in battle had weakened further, to the point that it couldn't even help anymore.","If this continued, it would soon become a mascot-like existence.","To the proud Phoenix, this was simply intolerable!","However, when it thought of leaving the Female Devil's side, it was really reluctant.","Huang Yueli could see the dilemma in Little Wang Cai's heart as she took a few steps forward and squatted down, maintaining the same height as him and looked straight into his big teary eyes.","\"Wang Cai, we'll only be separated for a while. It's not like we'll never meet again.\""]},{"number":4410,"title":"Chapter 4410 Three Year Agreement (7)","paragraphs":["\"When you grow up and have achieved success in your cultivation, you can still come to the Sacred Phoenix Continent to look for me, right? At that time, I will definitely have settled all the elders and will be able to control the entire Sacred Phoenix Continent. If you are willing, you can play around in my territory.\"","Huang Yueli was all smiles as she planned out the future scene for him.","Little Wang Cai pouted and did not buy it at all.\" Don't lie to me! Didn't you already despise me for only knowing how to eat and not being obedient? Perhaps once I leave, you'll soon find a new contracted Divine Beast and have a change of heart!\"","Huang Yueli didn't know whether to laugh or cry.","What kind of words were these!","Why did it sound like she was a heartless man and little Wang Cai was the one she had abandoned?","\"How is that possible?\" she asked patiently. Now, aren't there only these Phoenixes left in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge in the entire Divine Realm? Where can I find a new contracted Divine Beast?\"","Hearing Huang Yueli's words, Little Wang Cai not only didn't relax, but instantly raised his voice, as though he was shrieking.","\"What did you say? You don't want to find a new contracted Divine Beast because there are no other Phoenixes! You've been exposed, you've finally been exposed! If there were many Phoenixes, you would have found someone else, right?\"","Huang Yueli almost vomited blood!","This was unreasonable, right?","She now deeply understood how tragic it was for a man to have an unreasonable wife...","Li Moying really couldn't bear to listen any longer as he quickly walked over. With a frown, he shouted in a low voice,\" Alright, don't shout anymore! You have heard Li 'er's words. What she promised you, when has she not done it? Don't you believe her? Didn't you call me Young Master every day and say that you're an adult? Then you should act like an adult. Why are you crying like that?\"","Little Wang Cai, who bullied the weak and feared the strong, immediately shut up.","However, after a moment of silence, he couldn't help but speak.","\"Then...Then at least set a time to meet again, right? Otherwise, if you leave, who knows when you will return to the Sacred Phoenix Continent?\"","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance.","Then, he said,\" My husband and I plan to travel outside. At least reach late-stage Dao Profound Realm before returning to the clan. Just how long this process will take, we can't say clearly either.\"","Although her and Li Moying's innate talent was extremely shocking and they were about to break through to Dao Profound Realm, they didn't encounter any bottlenecks in the middle and everything went very smoothly.","However, it was still unknown whether he would encounter difficulties that he could not break through in the future.","Little Wang Cai had an expression as if he had expected it,\" Then you still told me to go to the Sacred Phoenix Continent to find you! You're lying to me!\"","Huang Yueli shook her head: \" I'm not lying to you. Although we won't return to the clan, but I have an agreement with my Senior Brother. Every three years, I will return to see him once...\"","\"Three years! Alright, let's agree on three years!\"","Before she could finish, Little Wang Cai jumped up excitedly,\" Don't forget what you promised me. Three years later, I'll go find you!\"","Huang Yueli was speechless.","When did she agree to meet Little Wang Cai in three years? Wasn't he talking about Liu Buyan's matter earlier?","As a Phoenix whose lifespan could easily reach tens of thousands of years, how effective could three years of cultivation be?","However, Little Wang Cai had already excitedly remembered this time."]},{"number":4411,"title":"Chapter 4411 Three Year Agreement (8)","paragraphs":["\" Sigh, alright. Three years it is. I don't have any objections.\"","Huang Yueli looked at Little Wang Cai's agitated expression and shook her head as she agreed to him.","In any case, to her, three years, six years or nine years didn't make any difference.","However, for some people, it was probably not the case.","Sure enough, Huang Yueli had just spoken when Zhao Lin's face turned black as he interrupted.","\"Zhao Hua, don't forget that for us Phoenixes, only when we cultivate the 'Phoenix Secret Manual' and break through to the ninth stage and enter the youth stage will we have the right to leave the clan and go out to train alone. Before that, no one is allowed to leave the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge!\"","Little Wang Cai was stunned,\" Ah? And... There are such clan rules?\"","\"Exactly!\" Zhao Lin snorted coldly. I told you a long time ago. Did you completely ignore my words?\"","Little Wang Cai sensed danger from his stern voice and stood up straight.","Her little head shook left and right desperately.\" No, no, of course I heard it! I just... I just forgot about it for a moment! After all, I'm going to be separated from my Female Devil. I... I was too sad and it affected my memory...\"","Zhao Lin narrowed his Phoenix eyes, his gaze coldly sweeping across his younger brother's face.","Little Wang Cai lowered his head guiltily.","But then, he raised his head again. Then I can break through to the ninth stage of the Phoenix Secret Manual within three years, and then I can go find the Female Devil!\"","Thinking of this, he became happy again. He clearly felt that he was very witty.","Zhao Lin's eyes widened in disbelief as he stared at Little Wang Cai, who was smiling foolishly in front of him. He felt like he was about to cry from his younger brother's stupidity!","\"Break through to the ninth stage of the Phoenix Secret Manual within three years! Do you know what you are saying? Even the most outstanding genius of our Phoenix clan in the past million years also took six years to break through to Tier 9! Three years...That's impossible!\"","This once-in-a-million-year genius was naturally him.","Although Little Wang Cai's talent was not inferior to the others, to cultivate to the ninth stage within three years...","It could only be said that the ignorant were fearless!","When Little Wang Cai heard this, his face was filled with unwillingness,\"Brother, you...\" You're looking down on me! So what if he was a genius that appeared once every million years? I'm...But a genius that only appears once every ten million years, I can definitely do it!","Brother, just wait and see!\"","Zhao Lin could only chuckle.","This devilish brat was now brimming with confidence. Once Huang Yueli left, when he officially started to train this little fellow, he hoped that he wouldn't cry out!","Little Wang Cai did not know what kind of tragic fate awaited him in the future.","He and Huang Yueli could be considered to have reached a consensus and gradually accepted the fact that she was about to leave.","Little Wang Cai patted his head and said,\"Oh right, Big Brother, when I ran in just now, I heard that you wanted to compensate the Female Devil...\" What are you planning to give her?\"","Zhao Lin's eyebrows twitched.","Was this his biological brother?","He was actually siding with an outsider!","Didn't she see that he had deliberately 'forgotten' about this matter and planned to fool this matter over. After sending Huang Yueli and Li Moying away, there would be no need to lose the clan's treasures!","In the end, this devilish brat actually brought it up!","Huang Yueli turned her head and saw Zhao Lin's ashen face and immediately understood a little as she said with a smile that was not a smile,\" That's right, what treasure are you prepared to give me? The Phoenix clan is an ancient clan that lives as long as the Divine Realm. They must have a lot of collections. Don't casually fool me!\""]},{"number":4412,"title":"Chapter 4412 Really seeing a ghost (1)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin's face alternated between green and white, and his heart was indescribably depressed.","But earlier it was indeed him who said that he wanted to compensate Huang Yueli.","He was not that thick-skinned. He could not swallow the words that he had said. He could only hold his breath and say,\" Miss Huang, you are thinking too much. How could I deceive you?\" You're my brother's savior!\"","Huang Yueli's lips curled up,\" That's good. With Lord Patriarch's words, I can rest assured.\"","For the sake of his face, Zhao Lin could only agree. However, he was still very unhappy in his heart and could not help but glare at the innocent Little Wang Cai.","But who knew that Little Wang Cai totally didn't pay attention to this biological brother of his as he grabbed onto Huang Yueli's clothes and kept rubbing against her side.","Moreover, her little mouth was still chattering non-stop.\" Female Devil, our Phoenix Clan has a lot of good things! I know that there is a huge treasure vault at the back of the mountain where I held the Nirvana ceremony. All the treasures that our Phoenix clan has collected for so many years are in there. None of them is not a peerless treasure that can shock the twelve continents of the Ancient God Clan! Divine Grade Pills, Heavenly Fate Artifacts, and Profound Life Realm cultivation techniques. I heard that they all have them...\"","\"Zhao Hua! Shut up!\"","The more Zhao Lin listened, the more he felt that something was wrong. The veins on his forehead were popping out.","Did this devilish brat not have a door in his mouth? He actually told Huang Yueli about the top secret of the clan!","Those things were all clan protection treasures. He could not bear to give any of them away.","Little Wang Cai only realized that he had said too much after being shouted at by his brother. He quickly covered his small mouth.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and turned towards Zhao Lin,\" Lord Patriarch, why are you so fierce towards your younger brother? Are you unwilling to give me the treasure? In fact, I understand you very well. After all, I'm just an outsider. It's not appropriate for me to take away your treasures.\"","\"As for what you said earlier, in order to thank me for saving your brother, you will repay me at all costs and even list me as an honored guest of the Phoenix clan. I will pretend not to hear these words. After all, the Phoenix clan never leaves the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. Even if they don't keep their word, outsiders won't know.\"","Huang Yueli said slowly as a smile hung on her face.","He didn't seem angry at all.","However, the more Zhao Lin listened, the more uncomfortable he felt. A wave of anger was stuck in his chest, unable to go up or down.","This little girl was clearly mocking him!","Although she kept saying that she didn't care and understood, the meaning behind her words was that she was accusing the Phoenix clan of being ungrateful and stingy. She was just short of pointing at them and scolding them!","Zhao Lin gritted his teeth and glared at her for a while.","He suddenly thought of something and his tensed jaw relaxed.","\"Since you're so interested in our Phoenix clan's treasure vault, it would be too unreasonable for me to find an excuse not to let you go. After all, you are my brother's savior. Our Phoenix clan owes you a lot. Moreover... There aren't many clansmen left. We can't use so many treasures.\"","Hearing Zhao Lin's words, Huang Yueli was dumbfounded.","She widened her eyes and looked at him in disbelief.","Did Zhao Lin take the wrong medicine?","Although she had used goading tactics just now, she had never thought that Zhao Lin would really bring her to the Phoenix clan's treasure vault."]},{"number":4413,"title":"Chapter 4413 Really seeing a ghost (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli herself was also from a large family and was very clear what the family's treasury represented.","It would be a ghost if the Sholin Association agreed to take her there!","She just wanted to squeeze Zhao Lin a little. On the one hand, Zhao Lin's rejection was too ugly and made her a little unhappy. On the other hand, if Zhao Lin felt that she was in the wrong, he would be too stingy later and would give her more good things.","However, she did not expect Zhao Lin to nod his head so easily and agree to bring her to the clan's treasure vault!","This... There was definitely something fishy about this!","\"Lord Zhao Lin, you... Are you serious?\"","Zhao Lin lifted his chin and swept her a glance expressionlessly.\" Of course it's true. Miss Huang, our Phoenix Clan has always kept our promises. We're different from your sinister and cunning Ancient God Clan Clan.\"","He did not forget to mock the ancient Ancient God Clan again.","However, Huang Yueli couldn't be bothered to refute him.","Because she was still in a daze!","It was a waste of her usual self-proclaimed intelligence. At this moment, she could not figure out what Zhao Lin was up to!","\" Alright, since you and Young Master Li are in a hurry to leave, I won't waste any more time. I'll bring you over now.\" Zhao Lin's lips revealed a meaningful smile as his gaze landed on Huang Yueli, with a hint of provocation.","\"Miss Huang, what are you standing there for? Did you change your mind and not want to go to the treasure vault?\"","Huang Yueli raised her brows,\" Who said that? How could I not want to go to the treasure vault? I want to go, of course I have to go! Let's go now! However, my husband must come with me.\"","When Zhao Lin heard this, he didn't hesitate and nodded.\" Sure.\"","He turned around and walked towards the back of the mountain.","Huang Yueli exchanged a glance with Li Moying who was beside her as she followed up.","Although he didn't know what Zhao Lin wanted to do, at least he wouldn't harm their lives just because of this request.","No matter what he was planning, he was already in front of the treasure vault. It was impossible for her not to enter.","As a martial artist, if he wanted to continuously break through and reach the peak of martial arts, he could not miss the opportunity that was presented to him.","Little Wang Cai also followed with its short legs.","Zhao Lin walked in front and led them through a dense forest to the back of the mountain.","This was the place where Little Wang Cai held the Nirvana Ceremony.","This was a piece of flat land surrounded by mountains and there were countless ancient arrays around. There were many arrays that even Huang Yueli couldn't recognise.","Complicated array patterns were carved on the mountain walls in all directions.","As the Profound Qi in the surroundings fluctuated slightly, the array patterns appeared and disappeared, filled with a mysterious aura.","Huang Yueli couldn't help but take a deep breath.","As a fire-attributed ancient martial art practitioner, not only did the aura around the array not make her uncomfortable, it even calmed her down quite a bit.","Zhao Lin stopped in front of a mountain wall. He stretched out his hand and pressed it on an array pattern, silently chanting some unknown spell.","After a few breaths, the ground suddenly shook violently.","A white fog that came out of nowhere filled his vision. His surroundings were white, and he could not see anything clearly.","Li Moying frowned slightly as he immediately held onto the young lady's slender waist, using a protective stance to protect her in his embrace.","\"Ah!\"","In the chaos, Little Wang Cai could not stand steadily and almost fell to the ground.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli's eyes and hands were quick as she grabbed onto its clothes and lifted it up."]},{"number":4414,"title":"Chapter 4414 Really seeing a ghost (3)","paragraphs":["When everything calmed down, the fog gradually dispersed.","Only then did Huang Yueli realise that the mountain wall behind them had disappeared, revealing a hidden passage behind them.","This passage was hidden in the darkness, and no one knew where it led to.","\"Come in with me,\" said Zhao Lin in a deep voice.","Huang Yueli and the rest quickened their pace and followed after.","As soon as she stepped into the passageway, her eyes revealed a hint of shock.","Although she was prepared, she didn't expect that the Phoenix Clan would use the Mystical Crystal to build the entire passage!","In the 12 continents of the Ancient God Clan, the Secret Essence Mystic Crystal was a very expensive material for crafting weapons. It was used to forge high-grade weapons and armors.","Now, they were only in the outer passage, and the walls were already made of such rare materials.","It was hard to imagine what level of treasures were hidden in the treasure vault.","Moreover, without Zhao Lin personally leading the way, it was probably absolutely impossible for outsiders to forcefully barge into the treasure vault.","The defensive power of the outer wall made of Secret Essence Mystic Crystals could be imagined.","The various defensive and concealment array patterns drawn on the wall were even more complicated and mysterious. Huang Yueli stared at it carefully for a while but still couldn't understand anything.","Zhao Lin's voice suddenly rang out.\" How is it? Stunned just like that?\"","Huang Yueli regained her senses,\" I really didn't expect...\"","Zhao Lin said coldly,\" You Ancient God Clans always call yourself the Ancient Ancient God Clans, as if you think you're the natives of the Divinity. In fact, that's not the case at all. Countless years before the appearance of the Ancient God Clans, the Ancient Divine Beasts had already appeared in the Divinity. Calling yourself 'Ancient' in front of us is simply ridiculous!\"","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and didn't say anything.","Zhao Lin's hatred for the Shen clan was very deep. At this time, it was better for her to keep her mouth shut.","Zhao Lin snorted coldly, satisfied with her attitude.","\"Back then, your Sacred Phoenix Race plotted against my race. Other than wanting to enslave my race, you also had another motive. You wanted to obtain the ancient inheritance of the Phoenix Race. However, they couldn't find the treasury, so they had to leave. Speaking of which, the two of you are the only outsiders who have entered our clan's treasury in the past 100,000 years.\"","\" However, it's still their luck that those Sacred Phoenix Race trash were unable to find this place. If they really dared to barge into the treasure vault, they probably wouldn't even know how they died!\"","Zhao Lin said as he walked forward.","Suddenly, he stopped in his tracks. She lowered her voice.","\"If I leave you two little brats of the Ancient God Clan here, no one will know. Even my clansmen will only think that you have left the canyon and returned to the territory of the Ancient God Clan...\"","Little Wang Cai quivered,\"Big...\" Big brother, what do you want?\"","Zhao Lin sneered.\" What do you think?\"","He intentionally looked towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying, wanting to see the terrified expressions on their faces.","However, the truth disappointed him.","The two young men were unusually calm, not frightened by his deliberately deep tone at all.","Huang Yueli seemed a little impatient as she looked at him and asked in puzzlement: \" Why aren't you leaving?\"","Zhao Lin was furious.","The Ancient God Clans were indeed sinister and cunning. Even a young girl who was still wet behind the ears was not easy to deceive!","He flung his sleeves and continued walking forward.","This passage clearly had a very long history. The exquisitely carved patterns on the walls had obvious traces of time."]},{"number":4415,"title":"Chapter 4415 Really seeing a ghost (4)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli and Li Moying were extremely cautious as they followed closely behind Zhao Lin, not daring to take a single wrong step.","Although Zhao Lin had no intention of killing them, this treasure vault was filled with traps and dangers lurked everywhere. If they were not careful, they would be courting death.","In comparison, Little Wang Cai was not as careful. It kept looking around curiously and even triggered a mechanism, almost falling into the poisonous water.","Fortunately, Zhao Lin scooped him up in time.\" Zhao Hua, can't you be more mature! I regret bringing you in!\"","\"I'm sorry...\" Only then did Little Wang Cai know fear and quickly followed behind them.","The passage was very long.","The few of them walked for almost two hours before they reached the end of the passageway.","Zhao Lin fiddled with a heavy door a few times, and the door slowly opened.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying's expressions were solemn as they subconsciously assumed a defensive stance and even took a few steps back.","Huang Yueli didn't forget to pull Little Wang Cai back.","However, after a few breaths, she realized that something was wrong.","The door of the treasury was wide open, but nothing unusual happened.","Huang Yueli's eyes widened as her face was filled with astonishment as she blurted out: \" This is...What's going on?\"","Just now, at the back of the mountain, he had only opened the passageway outside the treasure vault, but there had been so many phenomena of the earth shaking and the mountains shaking.","Why was the surroundings so peaceful now?","It was as if he had just casually pushed open the door of his home.","Zhao Lin stood at the door and turned to look at them. He raised his chin.\" Won't you know once you come in and take a look? Why? Don't you dare?\"","Huang Yueli frowned slightly,\" So be it.\"","Even though she said that, she was still on high alert as she mobilized all the Profound Energy in her body and slowly walked forward.","She had just taken two steps when she was pulled behind by Li Moying,\" Li 'er, don't be so anxious, just follow behind me.\"","Huang Yueli only hesitated for a moment before she nodded her head and obediently followed behind her husband.","The two of them carefully walked towards the door.","Zhao Lin stood at the gate with his arms crossed. He didn't say a word and only sneered.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying entered the treasury's main door and stopped as they looked left and right, their faces revealing a stunned expression.","Huang Yueli said in disbelief,\"This...\" Was this the treasure vault of the Phoenix clan? Are you sure?\"","Zhao Lin glanced at her.\" Don't tell me that I've been the Patriarch for a hundred thousand years, and I don't even recognize the clan's treasure vault?\"","\"But...But... This... Isn't this too shabby?\" Huang Yueli couldn't hold it in anymore.","Two hours ago, when she saw that the walkway outside was made of Secret Essence Profound Crystals, Huang Yueli was shocked and had already sketched out a magnificent scene in her heart. She imagined that the Phoenix Clan's treasure vault would definitely be filled with treasures and with a casual grab, it would be priceless treasures.","And the result?","The warehouse they were in now was indeed big enough, but wasn't it a little too old?","Looking around, he saw that there were piles of dust and spider webs everywhere. It seemed that they had not been cleaned or fixed for millions of years.","As for the so-called treasure...","He didn't even see a shadow.","In those gray corners, one could make out the outlines of some bottles, jars, and spirit weapons.","However, these things were all covered in a thick layer of dust and looked no different from discarded garbage."]},{"number":4416,"title":"Chapter 4416 Really seeing a ghost (5)","paragraphs":["Wasn't this contrast a little too great?","It was completely different from what they had imagined.","Zhao Lin looked at the changes in their expressions and gradually smiled.","\"How is it? Surprised? Don't you want the treasure of the Phoenix clan? It's all here.\"","She wanted to swindle money from him. Did she really think that he was as stupid as those silly and sweet ordinary Phoenixes?","Huang Yueli pursed her lips as she swept a glance at him without batting an eyelid and deliberately sighed deeply,\" Sigh, looks like the Phoenix Clan's inheritance has been passed down for too long and had already squandered away all the family businesses from the ancient times, not even leaving behind a single treasure. This is really too unfortunate. This is not just the loss of the Phoenix clan, this is the loss of the entire Divine Realm!\"","\"Lord Zhao Lin, since you have such difficulties, why didn't you say so earlier? My husband and I are not unreasonable people. If we had known that you were so poor, we would not have forced you to take out your treasures. Which family didn't have a time when they couldn't make a living? We understand, we really understand!\"","Zhao Lin could no longer maintain his composure. He subconsciously tightened his grip on the door frame, causing the fragile bronze door frame to crack.","\"You... What did you say? Who did you say was so poor that he couldn't even open a pot? What?\"","Huang Yueli took two steps back and covered her mouth,\" Ah! I'm sorry, I said something wrong. The foundation of the Phoenix clan's many years of inheritance is still there. Even if a few treasures are missing, it's not a big deal! Lord Zhao Lin, you don't have to be so concerned...\"","\"What do you care!\" Zhao Lin was so angry that he could not help but curse.","\"Since when did I ruin our Phoenix clan's family business? How can there be less treasures? You're the one who's blind!\"","The expression on Huang Yueli's face was extremely innocent as her voice carried a trace of grievance,\" This...Lord Zhao Lin, you can't just scold people like that! How am I blind?\"","\"Aren't all the treasures in this treasure vault placed here?\" Zhao Lin sneered. It looked old and dilapidated because this treasure vault was enveloped in a special array. Ordinary people could not see the original appearance of the treasure at all! Aren't you guys supposed to be from the god race? How come you don't even have this bit of knowledge?\"","When Huang Yueli heard that, she almost couldn't hold back her laughter as her shoulders started to tremble slightly.","Li Moying saw it clearly from the side and couldn't help but shake his head.","His little fox was really too black-bellied. How could Zhao Lin defeat her?","Wasn't it just a few words and he was played by Li 'er in circles, not even a trace of hesitation as he revealed all his secrets.","Huang Yueli had managed to trick Zhao Lin out of telling the truth but she was still unwilling to let him off. She continued: \" Lord Zhao Lin, you don't have to purposely make up such words to deceive us for the sake of your face. We are outsiders, so it's normal that we can't see the original appearance of the treasure. However, Zhao Hua is from your Phoenix Clan, and he can't see where the treasure is either. This is completely illogical! You must be lying to us!\"","Little Wang Cai was totally confused and when he heard Huang Yueli's words, he subconsciously nodded his head,\" That's right, Big Brother, I can't tell either...\"","Zhao Lin glared at the little fellow.","This stupid brother, why did he always side with outsiders? Whose side was he on?","Little Wang Cai finally realised that he had said something wrong as he hurriedly shrunk his neck and hid behind Huang Yueli.","\" Hmph!\" Zhao Lin raised his chin and snorted coldly.\" If you want to see the treasure, you don't have to rely on the bloodline of the Phoenix clan. Instead...\" Your own ability!\""]},{"number":4417,"title":"Chapter 4417 Really seeing a ghost (6)","paragraphs":["\"Your own ability?\" Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows.","She had already guessed it in her heart, but her face still looked puzzled.","Zhao Lin's face was filled with pride as he slowly said,\" All the treasures in the treasure vault have been sealed by the ancestors of our Phoenix clan with a secret technique. These natural treasures have their own spirituality. They are not something that you can use as you please.\" Rather than saying that you guys are the ones picking the treasures, it would be better to say... It's the treasure choosing its master!\"","\"The treasure chooses its owner?\" Little Wang Cai couldn't help but say,\" Big Brother, why don't I understand anything?\"","Zhao Lin glanced at him.\" You're still young, so you don't have enough knowledge. However, I believe that the two of us Divine level geniuses have more or less heard of the saying that treasures recognize their owners, right?\"","Huang Yueli was shocked as she opened her mouth,\" This...I have indeed seen it in ancient books, but...However, according to the ancient records, only treasures that have reached the god grade can possess intelligence and take the initiative to recognize its master. For example, a life bound magic artifact like the Sky Phoenix Ring...\"","Back then, Little Wang Cai had taken the initiative to acknowledge her as its master.","The treasure had taken the initiative to recognize its owner, which meant that it already had spirituality. Even if it did not have a powerful artifact spirit like little Wang Cai, it had at least condensed the embryonic form of an artifact spirit.","Even if it was just a trace of spirituality, the difficulty was unimaginable.","First of all, the treasure itself had to reach the Divine level. Moreover, it needed at least 100,000 years of nurturing in a place with rich Profound Qi in heaven and earth before it could condense a tiny bit of weak scattered Qi.","To be able to generate one's own consciousness, the requirements were even higher.","Every treasure that could recognize its owner was a product of the right time, place, and people. It was not something that could be controlled by pure human strength.","If a faction was able to obtain one or two, they would already be able to rank high in the Divine Realm.","A top power like the Sacred Phoenix Race would at most have a dozen or so items.","According to Huang Yueli's initial estimations, the treasure vault of the Phoenix Clan would definitely have more treasures of this level than the Sacred Phoenix Clan. But at most twenty to thirty pieces would already be pretty good.","However, from the meaning in Zhao Lin's words, this huge treasure vault...Could it be that they were all spiritual treasures?","Just as Huang Yueli was feeling bewildered, Zhao Lin had already taken a few steps forward and walked in front of a rusty long sword.","He pointed at the sword covered in thick dust and said in a deep voice,\"Do you see that sword?\" That's not an ordinary Spirit Tool. It's a life-bound magic tool forged by the number one expert of the Shen clan, Li Qingyu, 570,000 years ago. Li Qingyu was a powerhouse at the peak of the Profound Life Realm. There are even rumors that he actually broke through the last step.\"","Hearing Zhao Lin's words, Huang Yueli and Li Moying couldn't help but exchange a glance.","They were a little shocked.","Above the Life Profound Realm...What realm was he at?","Although the two of them had heard about it when they returned to the family, they had not seen any relevant records in the family's ancient books.","Both of them pricked up their ears, wanting to hear Zhao Lin continue.","However, Zhao Lin stopped there and changed the topic.\" Our Phoenix clan has over a hundred treasures of this level. We even have the last step of breaking through to the Profound Life Realm! As long as you have the ability to make these treasures automatically recognize you as their master, I, Zhao Lin, will not stop you. I'll give the treasures to you!\"","\"Of course, the premise is... You have the ability!\""]},{"number":4418,"title":"Chapter 4418 Really seeing a ghost (7)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin spoke unhurriedly, the corners of his mouth carrying a faint mocking expression.","It was as if they were mocking the two geniuses of the Ancient God Clan for overestimating themselves.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, the ground of the entire treasure vault suddenly shook, and the dust on the wall kept falling.","Everyone was caught off guard and their bodies swayed left and right.","Little Wang Cai retreated a few steps and almost forgot to fall to the ground.","\"This... This... What happened?\"","Huang Yueli's eyes widened in shock.","However, Zhao Lin didn't have the time to answer her.","As the tremors became more and more intense, a dazzling golden light suddenly shot out from the longsword in front of Zhao Lin.","In the beginning, it was just a ray of light, but the range of this light expanded rapidly. In just a few breaths, it illuminated the entire treasure vault.","Everyone's eyes were stung, and they subconsciously closed their eyes tightly.","After a while, the golden light gradually faded.","Huang Yueli hadn't even had the chance to open her eyes when she felt Li Moying's right hand which was tightly intertwined with hers suddenly loosen.","She jolted awake immediately.","She quickly opened her eyes and turned to look at her husband.","\" Moying, why are you...\"","Halfway through her words, Huang Yueli choked and the rest of her words were stuck in her throat, unable to make a single sound.","Her eyes widened as she stared at the spot one meter in front of Li Moying.","The shabby weapon rack that Zhao Lin had pointed out to them was now empty.","The rusty longsword was no longer in its original position.","At this moment, this long sword stopped in front of Li Moying. The entire body of the sword was transparent but it was emitting a unique glow. The energy that was emitted from its body was pure and dense, even carrying a powerful pressure, making it impossible for people to look straight at it.","Huang Yueli just stared at the long sword for a while and felt a stifling feeling in her chest as she subconsciously took a few steps back before heaving a sigh of relief.","\"This... This sword...\"","A look of amazement appeared on her face.","One had to know that with her current cultivation and strength, even if she was facing peak Dao Profound Realm powerhouses, she could cope with them. Even if she was unable to defeat the other party, she could also escape calmly. It was absolutely impossible to not even be able to withstand the Profound Energy pressure that the other party released.","However, in front of this sword, she clearly felt a sense of oppression!","Could it be that the sword's aura was no different from that of a Life Profound Realm expert?","However, what shocked her even more was that her husband's strength was clearly similar to hers and the distance between him and the sword was even closer but Li Moying's expression didn't change at all and even the Profound Energy in his body didn't have any obvious fluctuations....","\"Could it be...\" Huang Yueli's mind flashed with an idea.","Before she could say anything, Zhao Lin could not help but scream.","\"Impossible! This was impossible! I must be dreaming...Yes, it's a dream...\"","Huang Yueli turned her head towards the source of the voice and realised that Zhao Lin was staring intently at Li Moying as his face was slightly distorted and his voice had changed.","\" That's impossible. There have been so many members of the Phoenix Clan in the past. As long as they have reached the Sky realm, they will be given a chance to enter the clan's treasure vault. However, the probability of awakening the lowest level treasure within is one in ten thousand. An outsider like you, and you're only a junior at the Heart Profound Realm, how could it be...I've really seen a ghost!\"","However, no matter how much Zhao Lin could not accept it, he could not change the truth.","The long sword stopped in front of Li Moying as the blade vibrated continuously, emitting a buzzing sound."]},{"number":4419,"title":"Chapter 4419 Really seeing a ghost (8)","paragraphs":["The tip of the sword was slightly tilted upwards towards Li Moying's direction, as though it was nodding towards him.","Li Moying closed his eyes as a deep look flashed past his dark pupils.","His thin lips lifted slightly.\" Are you sure...\" Do you want to follow me?\"","\"Buzz...\"","The sound of the long sword's screeching intensified. The Profound Qi of Heaven and Earth in the surroundings was affected, and waves of energy spread out.","Li Moying's cold lips curled up slightly as he revealed a smile.","He reached out his right hand toward the longsword.","In the next second, the long sword flew towards Li Moying's direction and only stopped when it reached his palm.","Li Moying's left index finger brushed past the blade and a drop of fresh blood slowly slid down the blade.","The array patterns engraved on the sword body were clearly revealed under the contrast of the blood. After a dozen breaths, they gradually disappeared.","The Heaven and Earth Profound Qi that rampaged through the entire treasure vault also calmed down.","Huang Yueli's eyes flashed as she excitedly ran to Li Moying's side.","\"Husband, has this sword already acknowledged you as its master?\"","Li Moying nodded slightly as he said in a low voice,\" Sword name...\" Qing Jue! This sword has already been silent in the treasure vault for too long. The last time it was stained with blood was more than five hundred thousand years ago...\"","After dripping his blood on it, Li Moying was able to communicate with the Green Noble Sword's holy sense.","Although this spiritual sense was still very basic and could not be compared to a living artifact spirit like little Wang Cai, it still had its own memories and emotions.","This Green Jue Sword was not only the most top-notch life-bound magical treasure in the Divine World, but it had also once followed a true peerless expert.","Treasures were the same as people.","After having such a glorious past, facing hundreds of thousands of years of silence, other than unwillingness, there was still unwillingness!","The instant it recognized him as its master, the intense consciousness that came from the sword body rushed straight into Li Moying's primordial spirit, causing his heart to tremble uncontrollably.","\"Don't worry, I'll fulfill your wish,\" he said in a low voice.","He dominated the world and looked down on the Divine World.","Even if he didn't get this sword, he would still walk on this path.","Huang Yueli looked at her husband's deep and handsome face and her heart was filled with pride.","He couldn't help but glance at Zhao Lin from the corner of his eyes.\" Lord Zhao Lin, didn't you say that the treasures in this treasure vault all have spirituality? Even the geniuses of your Phoenix clan wouldn't recognize their masters when they came in. Do you still think that with our abilities, it's impossible for the treasure to recognize us as its owner? And now?\"","When Zhao Lin saw that the treasures in his treasury had actually fallen into Li Moying's hands, his heart was already aching terribly.","However, he had already said that as long as the treasure recognized its owner, he would let them take it away. It was not good to slap himself so quickly.","He could only force himself to hold back his anger.","Just as he was suffocating till his entire body felt uncomfortable and had yet to recover, he heard Huang Yueli's arrogant and proud laughter.","He was so angry that his face turned pale and he almost fainted on the spot.","\"You, you, you...Stop being so smug! This was just Li Moying's luck being good! This Green Jue Sword was originally a treasure left behind by a Cloudy Qilin Clan's elite warrior, and our Phoenix Clan's treasure vault is enveloped by fire attributed energy. It had long wanted to leave this place. It wasn't easy for her to meet a thunder attribute martial artist, so she could only lower her requirements and follow him!","This was clearly...A blind cat ran into a dead mouse!\"","Zhao Lin spared no effort to belittle Li Moying.","This was the only way to make him feel better.","Huang Yueli replied with an \" Oh \" but she wasn't angry. Instead, she smiled with her eyes narrowed,\" There's such a thing! Then do you still have any treasures left behind by Sacred Phoenix Race warriors? Tell me about it. I'll try it too. Maybe I'll be lucky too!\""]},{"number":4420,"title":"Chapter 4420 Really seeing a ghost (9)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Zhao Lin even felt like vomiting blood.","This stupid girl, was she going to sell all the treasures that their Phoenix clan had collected for millions of years on the spot?","He even wanted to try his luck!","Did he really think that she was amazing just because she was a god-grade genius?","The innate talent of the ancient divine beasts was much higher than that of the gods and humans. Therefore, in the history of the Phoenix clan, there had been many clansmen who had the same innate talent as the god-grade geniuses of the gods.","However, even among these geniuses, less than ten percent could awaken the treasures in the treasure vault.","Earlier on, Li Moying was able to resonate with the Green Jue Sword, this was already a huge stroke of luck!","It was already a miracle for such a good thing to happen once. Did he want to encounter it a second time?","He was simply daydreaming!","Zhao Lin looked at Huang Yueli's eager little face and couldn't help but laugh coldly: \" Miss Huang, you seem to be very confident in your innate talent? Since that's the case, it's not a problem for me to give you some pointers. Speaking of which, there are quite a number of treasures left behind by our Sacred Phoenix Race here!\"","This was definitely not a lie.","The Phoenix clan had a very long period of time that was on good terms with the Sacred Phoenix Race. Both parties had gifted quite a number of treasures to each other.","In that great battle 100,000 years ago, many Phoenixes died. But the Sacred Phoenix Race's experts who perished were even more.","The treasures that were left behind were all kept into Zhao Lin's treasury.","Huang Yueli didn't seem to be able to hear the ridicule in his words as she urged him excitedly: \" Where are you? Where? Lord Zhao Lin, you're really a good person. You're so generous and broad-minded. I can't help but admire you! Quickly bring me to see the Sacred Phoenix Race's treasures!\"","\"You...!\"","Zhao Lin didn't know what to say.","He could only fling his sleeves.\" Come with me!\"","Since this brat didn't know the immensity of heaven and earth, he would bring her to experience it. At that time, she would know how small she was!","Zhao Lin took a few steps forward with the three of them and casually pointed at a large gray mound in front of them.","\"See? Those were treasures left behind by the Sacred Phoenix Race, there were many of them! I'm not bragging, am I?\"","Little Wang Cai looked left and right with a confused expression.","\"What? What Sacred Phoenix Race treasure? Where? And... A lot?","Why didn't I see it?\"","At the place where Li Moying summoned the Green Jue Sword earlier, at least one could see the appearance of a weapon rack. But here, it was simply a pile of scrap metal buried in a pile of dirt, not even the appearance of a spirit weapon could be seen.","Zhao Lin chuckled.\" You're young and haven't cultivated for long. It's normal that you can't tell. I just said that only those with strength can see it. Some people overestimate themselves. Without the corresponding strength, how could he keep walking like that just by relying on luck...Luck...\"","Before he could finish, his eyes suddenly widened.","He saw Huang Yueli loosen her grip on Li Moying's right hand as she walked forward towards those few mounds.","At the same time, an unusually bright light blossomed in his eyes as he kept exclaiming,\"Wow, this...\" This is awesome! This was... This should be a fire attribute armor? Such a complete set had already exceeded the scope of a treasured weapon. Could it be that they were all life-bound magical weapons?","What kind of expert can refine such a full set of armor?\"","\"And this medicinal pill. I can smell the medicinal fragrance from afar. What a dense blood essence power. This is... Could it be the legendary Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill?\"","\"Wow, there's this! This is even more powerful...\"","Zhao Lin was stunned for a long while before he suddenly came back to his senses.\" You...\" You can see it?\""]},{"number":4421,"title":"Chapter 4421 Really seeing a ghost (10)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli swept a glance at him, that gaze, as though she was looking at an idiot.","\"Of course I can see it. How can it be fake? Can't you see with your eyes? Don't tell me that even you, the Patriarch, can't see the treasures in the treasury?\"","Zhao Lin choked on her words and was rendered speechless.","It was precisely because he was the Patriarch that he could see the true situation in the treasure vault through the clan's secret technique that he was so shocked!","Because the items that Huang Yueli had blurted out earlier were actually not wrong at all. They were all placed right in front of them, disguised as a pile of broken treasures by the array!","However, how was this possible?","Huang Yueli wasn't from the Phoenix Clan so of course she couldn't possibly have learnt the secret technique that he had learnt.","How could she see the real treasure?","Unless...She really had that kind of shocking talent to be able to make so many treasures acknowledge her at the same time!","This thought only lingered in Zhao Lin's mind for a breath's time before he tossed it out.","This kind of thing...It was absolutely impossible! There was definitely no such terrifying genius in the world. This... This was too ridiculous!","Zhao Lin cleared his throat.\" Alright, you're right. The armor in front of us is indeed a complete set. It's a life-bound Holy Armament left behind by a peerless expert of the Sacred Phoenix Race a million years ago. It's called the Fire God Armor. As long as you wear this armor, you'll be able to withstand the attacks of all experts below the middle stage of the Profound Life Realm.\"","He paused for a moment and then continued,\" Although I don't know what secret technique you've cultivated or what treasure you have on you that can strengthen your divine sense so that you can see the situation in the treasure vault. However, just seeing them is useless. The treasures won't recognize you as their master just because you see them.\"","\"Take the Fire God Armor as an example. Although the defensive capabilities of this armor are shockingly strong and can be said to be the strongest armor in the Divine Realm, one has to be at least in the early Profound Life Realm to wield such a treasure. Otherwise, you won't even be able to move it, let alone make it listen to your commands...\"","Zhao Lin spoke with confidence, not hiding anything as he introduced the characteristics of the treasure.","He said all this as though he saw Huang Yueli's confidence turning into disappointment.","It wasn't that he was perverted, but Huang Yueli this lass was simply too annoying.","From the first day she arrived at the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, he had not had a good time. Whether it was his younger brother or his clansmen, they had all been won over by this stupid girl. Not only had all the medicinal herbs in the clan been cheated by her, but they had also lost a priceless Sovereign Azure Sword today!","If he didn't give her a hard time, how could he vent his anger?","However, Zhao Lin had never expected that before he could finish his sentence, the earth would suddenly shake again. Red light pillars burst out from the \" mound \" in front of them, and the dazzling light shot straight into the roof.","The entire treasury began to shake, and a few tiny cracks even appeared on the wall.","As the light pillar gradually dimmed, a few crimson armor parts in the center of the light pillar slowly revealed their original shape.","Zhao Lin's mouth was agape as he stared blankly at the armor parts. He could not even make a sound.","Now, his mind was blank, and he even began to doubt life.","He... Just now... What did he see?","Huang Yueli's lips curled into a smile as she slowly walked towards the red light pillar."]},{"number":4422,"title":"Chapter 4422 Really seeing a ghost (11)","paragraphs":["Following Huang Yueli's approach, those armor components started to vibrate more and more intensely, as though they were incomparably excited.","The instant Huang Yueli stepped into the light pillar, the armor seemed to have broken free from its restraints in an instant.","Following a 'whoosh' sound, the armor parts rushed towards Huang Yueli's body.","Huang Yueli slowly opened her arms and these parts directly landed on the corresponding positions on her body, sticking tightly onto them.","Then, with another burst of red light, these parts automatically merged together, forming a complete set of armor.","Originally, these parts looked extremely thick and heavy individually but for some reason, after Huang Yueli's body was successfully pieced together, it turned into an extremely exquisite female soft armor.","The soft armor stuck to Huang Yueli's slender figure, accentuating her slim waist.","Moreover, there were no traces of connection between all the parts. It looked like a complete whole.","The red light gradually dissipated.","Huang Yueli stretched out her right hand and gently clenched it.","The armguard had turned into a pair of dark red gloves, sticking tightly to her skin.","She closed her eyes slightly and felt the energy fluctuations in this Life Source Holy Armament. Then, a smile appeared on her face.","She jogged and rushed in front of Li Moying as she asked with a smile,\" Husband, look at my new clothes. Does it look good?\"","As she said that, she even turned in a circle in front of Li Moying.","Li Moying's eyes flashed with a trace of a smile as his cold eyes instantly turned gentle,\" Very beautiful, my wife looks beautiful no matter what she wears.\"","Huang Yueli obviously enjoyed his sweet words as she proudly struck a pose. At the same time, she shook her head regretfully,\" Sigh, it's a pity that there's no mirror here. Otherwise, we would be able to see whether it looks good or not! If it doesn't look good, I can't wear it out every day...\"","Hearing this, Zhao Lin, who had been standing at the side in a daze, finally came back to his senses.","The expression on his face instantly cracked.","\"Enough! Do you know what level of treasure this is? You actually dare to despise it for not looking good?\"","Zhao Lin could not believe what he had just seen!","Today was really too strange. He had really seen a ghost!","Moreover, seeing a ghost once was not enough. He even saw it a second time!","How could such a thing happen?","Earlier, Li Moying had successfully awakened a supreme treasure and even made the Sovereign Azure Sword recognize its master. He could barely console himself that this was Li Moying's luck.","But now, even Huang Yueli had made the supreme treasure recognize her as its master!","Furthermore, the Phoenix Emperor Armor that Huang Yueli was wearing had a great background. A complete set of true treasure armor was much rarer than a true treasure weapon. Even in the Phoenix Clan's treasure vault, there was only one such unique piece!","Even Zhaolin himself had tried hard to get Feng Huanjia to acknowledge him.","He did not expect to be able to fully unleash the armor's power. At the very least, if he could unleash 50% of its power, he would be almost invincible in the Profound Life Realm.","Who knew that in the end, the master Feng Huanjia chose was actually a young lass like Huang Yueli!","Zhao Lin could not accept this at all.","However, no matter how unwilling he was, he had no other choice.","No external force could interfere with what kind of master the supreme treasure recognized.","As an ancient divine beast with a pure bloodline, he could not do anything treacherous.","Since he had personally promised Huang Yueli and the rest, he could only watch helplessly as the two of them took away the treasure!"]},{"number":4423,"title":"Chapter 4423 Really seeing a ghost (12)","paragraphs":["“Lord Zhao Lin, I really have to thank you for today. You’re really too generous!” Moreover, the treasure vault of the Phoenix clan is indeed worthy of its reputation. It’s incomparable to the treasure vault of our god clan. In the past, I was too short-sighted, so I spoke arrogantly. Please don’t take it to heart.”","When Zhao Lin heard what she said, although he was still unwilling, he felt much better.","After all, Huang Yueli had always been very arrogant and she had never had any intention of giving in to a peerless expert like him.","Now, he finally knew how to respect the elderly and the wise.","Of course, the most important thing was that Zhao Lin had also realised that for Huang Yueli and Li Moying to be able to easily make the treasure vault acknowledge them as its master, it meant that their potential and innate talent had already reached a shocking level!","Their future achievements would definitely be extraordinary. It would definitely be enough to shock the entire Divine World.","To befriend such a future powerhouse was beneficial to the Phoenix clan.","Since he could not keep these treasures, he could just give them to future experts as an investment.","Zhao Lin consoled himself and finally calmed down.","He walked forward and held Little Wang Cai’s hand. He turned around and said to the two of them,”Alright, since you’ve already obtained the treasure you want, then we should go out.” This treasure vault cannot be opened for too long, or else the energy consumption will be too great and it will also consume the Profound Energy in your bodies...”","As Zhao Lin spoke, he walked towards the entrance of the treasure vault.","However, after walking a dozen steps, he stopped.","Turning around, she looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were standing there in a daze. Frowning, she asked,” What are you guys still standing there for? Hurry up and follow me, or it’ll be easy to trigger the mechanism at the exit!”","Huang Yueli finally recovered from her dazed state as she turned her head towards Zhao Lin and revealed an apologetic smile.","“Cough cough, that... Lord Zhao Lin, I seem to feel the energy fluctuation of a supreme treasure again...”","Zhao Lin’s face was so dark that ink could drip out.","“Alright, Miss Huang, stop looking for excuses to delay time! What energy fluctuation? Impossible! Utmost treasures were mutually exclusive. Generally speaking, even a Profound Life Realm expert would find it difficult to equip two or more Utmost treasures at the same time. “Moreover, there won’t be two treasures in this treasure vault that recognize the same owner at the same time. In history, such a thing has never happened before. Don’t daydream...”","Before he could finish, he heard a buzz coming from the treasure vault. There was a loud buzzing sound.","On Huang Yueli’s right side of a mound, suddenly an intense dazzling golden light burst out, enveloping her petite and slender figure in the middle.","This scene was too familiar. Zhao Lin’s expression suddenly changed.","“No, no, no. Impossible! How could this be possible!”","Zhao Lin felt that he was definitely not awake yet. He was still dreaming!","He rubbed his eyes subconsciously.","However, when he opened his eyes again, the scene in front of him did not change at all.","After the golden light dissipated, a white porcelain bottle rose up from the mound and with a whoosh, it rushed towards Huang Yueli’s chest.","“Ten...Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill!”","Zhao Lin recognized the divine rank medicinal pill contained in this porcelain bottle at a glance.","This kind of Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill could only be refined with the heart blood of ten thousand demons at the level of Heavenly Demons.","It was sufficient to let Dao Profound Realm and above cultivators to raise their strength by 10%."]},{"number":4424,"title":"Chapter 4424 Finally sent the Female Devil away (1)","paragraphs":["Although the Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill could not increase a person's cultivation base by much, it could save a person's life.","No matter how serious the injuries were, as long as he consumed the Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill, he would be able to recover with a 99% chance.","The medicinal herbs used for such a medicinal pill were already so rare, and the difficulty of refining was even more unimaginable.","Even in the treasure vault of the Phoenix clan, there was only this one.","Moreover, it was snatched from the hands of a top demon expert hundreds of thousands of years ago!","Zhao Lin had never thought that Huang Yueli would actually summon out the Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill.","Instantly, his heart bled.","\"You... You... This... This...\"","If it was possible, he really wanted to jump up immediately and snatch the medicine bottle back from Huang Yueli's hands.","However, this was only a thought. Zhao Lin knew very well that this kind of supreme treasure had its own consciousness and would choose the person it recognized as its master.","Zhao Lin was not the person chosen by the Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill. Wanting to snatch the supreme treasure from Master was simply something impossible.","Unless...Directly kill Huang Yueli!","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and caught the bottle containing the Ten Thousand Demon Blood Pill. Turning her head around, she smiled at Zhao Lin and said \" Thank you \".","Her attitude was so good that it couldn't be any better. She was simply the most polite and good child.","However, no matter how Zhao Lin looked at her, she was an eyesore.","Huang Yueli felt that the atmosphere was a little awkward as she coughed twice, wanting to say something to ease the atmosphere.","Who knew that at this moment, something strange happened again!","Another pile of earth emitted a dazzling light, and a treasure in the shape of a jade pendant flew out from it.","This time, even Huang Yueli had not expected that her delicate little face would reveal a look of astonishment.","She caught the treasure and lowered her head to take a closer look.","However, before she could see it clearly, another light shone!","The fourth true treasure flew toward her.","Then, the fifth, sixth...","Towards the end, Huang Yueli was in a fluster and couldn't take it anymore. When she saw another pile of dirt lit up, her little face fell down.","\"Why is there more?\"","Why was there more?","Zhao Lin wanted to ask this question even more than she did!","Was this their Phoenix Clan's treasure vault or Huang Yueli this brat's private treasure vault?","He was even suspecting whether the treasures that their Phoenix clan had collected for so many years were true treasures.","Could it be that the seniors in their clan had identified it wrongly?","Could it be that these were not treasures at all, but cabbages and scrap metal picked up by the roadside?","At first, Zhao Lin was so angry that his lungs were about to explode. However, after the light in the treasure vault shone brightly one after another, he gradually became numb.","This was a dream, a dream...He must be dreaming!","However, no matter how he hypnotized himself, he would have to face reality in the end.","After the light in the treasure vault had completely disappeared, he mustered up his courage and turned towards Huang Yueli's direction.","It didn't matter when he saw this. Zhao Lin suddenly staggered and fell straight to the ground.","His back hit the hard bluestone floor with a loud crash.","Huang Yueli and the rest were stunned.","Little Wang Cai screamed and pounced over,\" Big Brother, Big Brother, you...\" What's wrong with you? Why did he faint? Wake up!\"","He pinched Zhao Lin's philtrum acupuncture point and patted his chest for a while. Finally, he saved Zhao Lin."]},{"number":4425,"title":"Chapter 4425 Finally sent the Female Devil away (2)","paragraphs":["Zhao Lin’s expression had just recovered a little when he heard Little Wang Cai mention the supreme treasure. His eyes immediately rolled back.","Fortunately, he managed to survive this time with the help of the powerful willpower contained in his ancient divine beast bloodline.","Zhao Lin desperately took a deep breath, finally stabilizing his mind.","He stared fixedly at Huang Yueli and Li Moying as he gritted his teeth,” You... You guys... What kind of evil technique did he use? Why are there so many treasures flying towards you? This...This doesn’t make sense at all!”","There were too many true treasures that had fallen just now. There were at least a dozen of them.","Furthermore, not only did they fly towards Huang Yueli, there were also a few items flying towards Li Moying’s direction.","Zhao Lin simply did not dare to think about it. This time, because he had not considered everything thoroughly, he had caused the clan’s treasure vault to lose just how much!","When Huang Yueli heard that, she looked at him innocently,” What evil technique? Lord Zhao Lin, what are you talking about? I didn’t do anything! How would I know why these treasures insist on acknowledging my husband and I as their masters?”","Zhao Lin did not believe her at all.” Do you think I’m a fool? If there were no accidents, why would such a ridiculous thing happen? I’ve been guarding this treasure vault for 100,000 years, and the history of the clan’s treasure vault has been recorded for more than a million years. Such a thing has never happened before with so many treasures actually recognizing their masters at the same time!”","The expression on Huang Yueli’s face became even more innocent.","“Then how would I know? Perhaps, it’s just because my husband and I are talented...”","Hearing this light explanation, Zhao Lin almost had the urge to faint again.","What kind of words were these? Wasn’t she asking for a beating?","But as he stared at Huang Yueli’s face for quite a while, he couldn’t say anything to refute her.","In fact, Zhao Lin knew very well that in front of so many high-level treasures, a junior with a Heart Profound Realm cultivation would not be of much use even if he cultivated a secret technique to increase the strength of his divine sense.","The only explanation was that the two of them were extremely talented. Even these top-notch true treasures thought highly of them, so they fought to recognize them as their masters.","One had to know that to ordinary people, supreme treasures were high and mighty.","However, this was not necessarily the case for true peerless geniuses.","The supreme treasure was not willing to be buried in the underground treasury all year round. It also had the urge to show itself. However, it could only appear in front of others after recognizing its master.","Of course, true treasures would not be willing to follow ordinary cultivator. Everyone wanted to follow a master with the most potential.","Therefore, once a peerless genius appeared, the supreme treasure would be able to sense it. Naturally, it would try its best to seize such an opportunity.","However, most of the supreme treasures had existed in the Divine Realm for hundreds of thousands of years. Their standards were extremely high. Even a Divine level genius was only so-so in their senses.","But now, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s appearance had made the supreme treasure so agitated...","What kind of talent was this?","Zhao Lin knew this logically, but he could not accept it emotionally.","Huang Yueli saw that he didn’t say anything and shrugged her shoulders, ignoring him.","She walked to the wall and touched it, wanting to see if she could get a few more treasures."]},{"number":4426,"title":"Chapter 4426 Finally sent the Female Devil away (3)","paragraphs":["4426 Finally sent the Female Devil away (3)","Huang Yueli's attitude was too blatant.","Zhao Lin saw this and felt a wave of frustration.","\"Enough, stop looking!\" It's useless even if you walk over. As long as you enter the treasury, all the treasures in the treasury will be able to sense your aura, regardless of distance. The remaining treasures don't recognize you as their master. Even if they don't like you, it's useless for you to stick to them.\"","Huang Yueli obviously didn't take Zhao Lin's words to heart as she held Li Moying's hand and walked around the treasure vault with him, going through every corner.","In the end, she had no choice but to admit that Zhao Lin was right this time...","Huang Yueli's fair little face was filled with disappointment.","\"Sigh, why is this happening? Why did such a genius like me have so many supreme treasures that he looked down on? How high are their standards?\"","Zhao Lin almost couldn't help but curse.","This brat actually had the face to be depressed and disappointed!","She had already swept away their Phoenix clan's assets, and he actually still dared to say such words!","Zhao Lin repeatedly reminded himself in his heart that this was his brother's savior, a friend of the Phoenix clan. He could not kill anyone casually.","Besides, if he wanted to kill someone, he couldn't do it in front of Zhao Hua.","Otherwise, wouldn't his image as an elder brother be completely ruined?","After hypnotizing himself countless times, Zhao Lin finally calmed down a little. He turned towards Huang Yueli and asked coldly: \" How is it? Have you seen enough? I didn't lie to you, did I?\"","\"No, no!\" Huang Yueli shook her head desperately,\" You are the Phoenix Clan's Patriarch, a true peerless expert, how could you lie to a junior like me who had just cultivated for a few years? Of course I believe you!\"","\"Hah!\" Zhao Lin could only sneer.","Huang Yueli also realised that she had gained a huge advantage and she couldn't continue to be arrogant.","Otherwise, she might really be beaten up!","She quickly said, \"Ahem, that...\" Lord Zhao Lin, thank you very much for your generosity. I didn't expect to be able to obtain so much from the treasure vault this time...\"","\"Cut the crap. Since we've finished exploring the treasure vault, can we go out now?\" Zhao Lin interrupted her coldly.","\"This... Yes, yes, of course! Please lead the way!\"","Huang Yueli wanted to say that she would wait and see.","However, Zhao Lin's expression was already very ugly. She judged the situation and could only go along with what he said.","If Zhao Lin knew that she had sensed some signs of aura fluctuations from a few other treasures and that she could take them away if she tried, she might not be able to leave this place alive...","Forget it, let's talk about it next time!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying followed behind Zhao Lin as they returned from the original route and left the treasury.","The tunnel at the entrance of the treasure vault slowly closed, and the back of the mountain returned to its original appearance.","Zhao Lin then turned around and glanced at the two of them.\" Alright, since you want to leave the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, I won't keep you. You can walk down the mountain from the small path in the east. Although it's a little far, you're both geniuses of the Ancient God Clans. It's nothing to walk a little, so I won't send you off! Goodbye!\"","He couldn't wait to chase her away.","He finally understood why his Younger Brother kept calling this brat a Female Devil.","This was ...How was she a Female Devil? She was simply the Devil Queen!","If she continued to stay in Phoenix Tranquility Gorge, what would be left of the Phoenix clan's many years of foundation?","She had to be chased away immediately, immediately! He couldn't delay any longer!"]},{"number":4427,"title":"Chapter 4427 Finally sent the Female Devil away (4)","paragraphs":["4427 Finally sent the Female Devil away (4)","Zhao Lin's motive for chasing them away was too obvious.","Huang Yueli was instantly speechless as she tugged at Li Moying's sleeves and grumbled in a \" soft voice \",\" Husband, why are the other clansmen of the Phoenix Clan so hospitable but Lord Patriarch is different from them? Didn't we just take a few more treasures? Could it be that only the stingy Phoenix can be the Patriarch?\"","Her voice was really too soft, so soft that even Zhao Lin could hear it clearly.","Hearing this, Zhao Lin was simply about to explode from anger and almost jumped up on the spot.","What did he mean by taking advantage of her?","This was it!","At this moment, he was deeply regretful. Why did he leave this brat in the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge for so long? She was simply a scourge!","Li Moying looked on from the side and couldn't help but laugh as he shook his head, caressing her smooth black hair,\" Alright, Li 'er, we should leave too. Didn't they agree to train together in the Divine World and strive to break through to the Life Profound Realm as soon as possible? It's not a good thing to stay here for too long.\"","\" Yes, yes, yes. Don't stay here anymore. Our small temple can't accommodate you two Bodhisattvas. Hurry up and go outside to train!\"","Zhao Lin echoed loudly, almost sweeping them out with a broom himself!","Looking at the young couple's talent, he did not doubt that they could reach the Life Profound Realm.","As long as they didn't die midway, it was only a matter of time before they broke through to the Profound Life Realm.","However, these two calamities were only at the Profound Heart realm, yet they were already so annoying. They had caused their Phoenix clan to be so miserable. If they broke through to the Profound Life realm...","Zhao Lin couldn't help but shiver.","After sending them away, he must think of a way to strengthen the concealment array around the Phoenix Tranquility Gorge. He could not let them find another chance to come back!","\"Alright, then I'll send you guys here. See you again if fate allows it! However, I don't think our fate is that deep...\"","Zhao Lin smiled insincerely.","However, at this moment, Little Wang Cai who had been following behind them in a daze suddenly reacted as he cried out in a \" wah \" and pounced towards Huang Yueli, hugging her thigh tightly.","\"Wuwuwu, Female Devil, are you really leaving? Can't you just stay? I cultivate very quickly. Give me a few years, and I'll be able to cultivate to the small success realm soon! Moreover, our Phoenix Tranquility Gorge has so much fire attribute energy. It's very suitable for you to cultivate here. Don't leave, right?\"","Zhao Lin was so angry that he almost vomited blood.","This idiotic younger brother of his was still counting money after being sold!","Why didn't he chase her out when he encountered such a scammer?","Could it be that he had a fake younger brother?","\"Zhao Hua, come back! Why was the dignified young Patriarch of the Phoenix clan crying like this? Miss Huang and Master Li are both god grade geniuses and their talents are so high. Their future prospects are limitless so of course they should be ambitious. How could they be trapped in such a small place like ours? Don't delay her!\"","Little Wang Cai actually knew this logic in his heart so after crying for a while, he sent Huang Yueli's thigh over.","\"Then...Wait for me...Female Devil, don't forget our three-year agreement!\"","\"Yes, yes, I remember!\" Huang Yueli was also a little reluctant.","Ever since she was reborn, the person who had stayed by her side the longest was Little Wang Cai. Even Li Moying didn't spend that much time with her."]},{"number":4428,"title":"Chapter 4428 Finally sent the Female Devil away (5)","paragraphs":["However, she was very clear that there was no banquet in the world that would not come to an end. On the path of pursuing the peak of martial arts, everyone had their own opportunities and their own paths.","In her previous life, she would reject Mu Chengying because of this reason.","Since they had embarked on the path of cultivation, it was impossible for them to be like ordinary young men and women who were in love and lived an ordinary married life.","Of course, after her rebirth, Li Moying’s position in her heart had already surpassed martial arts.","So for Li Moying, she could sacrifice everything, including her freedom.","She also believed that Li Moying would treat her this way.","<font < div>","However, towards little Wang Cai, she could not let this little bit of reluctance affect the little fellow’s future.","“Work hard! I’ll wait for the day you surpass me!”","Huang Yueli waved goodbye to Little Wang Cai and turned around to descend the mountain.","Li Moying strode out with his long legs and caught up to her in just a few steps. Their fingers interlocked as they walked down the mountain.","Along the way, the Phoenixes also learned that the two of them were about to leave and rushed over to send them off.","“Miss Huang, are you leaving already? Don’t go. If you leave, what will happen to us?”","“That’s right, that’s right. Who’s going to cook roast chicken for us?”","“Miss Huang, come and play often when you have time! You’re an honored guest of our Phoenix clan. You’re welcome to come back anytime!”","“Miss Huang, everyone will miss you...”","The Phoenixes drooled as they reluctantly bid farewell to Huang Yueli.","Some people even took out the medicinal herbs that were treasured at home and gave them to her as a parting gift.","This scene was in stark contrast to the scene when Huang Yueli was chased by the Phoenixes when she first arrived.","Seeing this scene, Zhao Lin, who was following behind, almost fainted from anger!","What a brainless fellow!","Until now, he still did not know that he had been scammed!","The clansmen were all so silly and sweet. As the Patriarch...It was really heartbreaking!","However, it was worth celebrating that this Female Devil was finally sent away by him!","It was truly a joyous occasion worthy of celebration!","Huang Yueli’s hands went soft from receiving gifts once again.","Later on, the Phoenixes came to send them off, and the small path down the mountain gradually returned to silence.","She and Li Moying were walking side by side on the mountain path and couldn’t help but grumble softly,” Zhao Lin this fellow, he’s after all the Phoenix Clan’s Patriarch! He was actually so petty! They didn’t even send someone to send us down the mountain and asked us to walk down by ourselves!”","When Li Moying heard that, his handsome face revealed a helpless smile,” You...Just leave them a way out, right? We’ve already been tricked by you to this extent. It’s already magnanimous of Zhao Lin not to be angry out of humiliation and lock us up. The Phoenix clan is indeed extraordinary!”","When he obtained the supreme treasure just now, he was already prepared for Zhao Lin to fall out with him and was ready to fight at any time.","Although the difference in strength between both parties was huge, but he and Huang Yueli possessed precious treasures and their strength had increased by a huge margin, so it wasn’t as if they didn’t have the strength to fight.","In the end, Zhao Lin actually did not do anything and let them go.","This made Li Moying look at her in a new light.","It had to be said that even the Patriarch of the Phoenix clan, who had lived in seclusion for many years, was very simple and honest...","If it were the ancient Ancient God Clan, the patriarchs of the various large families would have more than a 90% chance of falling out with them over these supreme treasures and killing them.","Huang Yueli smiled,” I know...Lord Zhao Lin is actually a good person. With such a big brother, I can rest assured.”"]},{"number":4429,"title":"Chapter 4429 Those who are courting death are here again (1)","paragraphs":["4429 Those who are courting death are here again (1)","Huang Yueli and Li Moying followed the small path and walked for two days and two nights before walking out of the canyon.","Fortunately, the two of them had the map given by the Phoenix clan, so it took them a little time to find the way out of the dense forest.","“Where should we go next?” As Huang Yueli walked, she looked at the map as she pondered over it.","Li Moying replied,” Our current cultivation has already reached a bottleneck so it’s best to find a place to gain some experience. When I left Cloudy Qilin Clan, I brought along quite a number of maps. They are all famous maps of Divine Realm’s mystic regions...”","“However, these mystic realms have already been explored by seniors. If we go again, it will be relatively safe. However, if it’s too safe, it will be detrimental to our cultivation...”","Huang Yueli immediately said: ” You’re right. We can’t covet comfort and ease. We should still look for mystic regions that others have never been to. But is there such a place now?”","The Divine Realm wasn’t Soaring Heavens Continent.","The ancient Ancient God Clan had occupied the 12 continents for hundreds of thousands of years. Most of the areas in the entire God World, except for the areas occupied by the Devil Race, should have been explored by the Ancient God Clan.","Li Moying smiled as he said,” Actually, there are still Forsaken Lands in the Divine Realm...Do you still remember the area we passed by when we first ascended?”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she pondered for a moment and revealed a look of realization.","“You mean... Serenity Sea...”","The Ethereal Sea was a very special region of the Divine Realm.","All the cultivators who ascended from the lower realm would pass through the void and enter the Divine Realm through the Ethereal Ocean.","Therefore, this area didn’t belong to any Ancient God Clan. It was quite a distance away from the 12 continents of the Ancient God Clan.","To the north of the Sea of Secrets, there was a vast uninhabited wasteland. It was called the Barren Land by the ancient gods.","This wasteland was unfathomable and densely packed with spirit beasts.","Moreover, the deeper they went, the stronger the spirit beasts were. There were even very powerful groups of spirit beasts.","In the past, many Profound Life Realm experts had entered the Forsaken Land to figure out what was going on.","However, in the end, they either disappeared or escaped dejectedly.","From the information brought by these experts, there were at least two things to know. First, there were powerful spirit beasts in the Forsaken Land that were equivalent to the Profound Life Realm of humans. Moreover, they appeared in groups.","When Huang Yueli had just ascended, because she was plotted against by Sacred Phoenix Race’s Elder Huang Sanbai, she had no choice but to escape and even brushed past Li Moying.","In the end, he also encountered danger many times. It took him a month to go a hundred miles deep.","After confirming that Huang Yueli didn’t go in, he then left.","“With our strength, it’s indeed a little difficult for us to force our way into the Forsaken Land.” Huang Yueli muttered.","Although she was very confident in her and her husband’s strength, she was not blindly arrogant. She could still make an objective judgment.","Many Life Profound Realm experts had died in the Forsaken Land so she and Li Moying naturally didn’t dare to say that they would definitely be able to come out alive."]},{"number":4430,"title":"Chapter 4430 Those who are courting death are here again (2)","paragraphs":["4430 Those who are courting death are here again (2)","However, since he wanted to train himself to break through the bottleneck, he definitely had to take a certain risk.","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and said,” We have quite a number of supreme treasures on us to protect ourselves. No matter what dangers there are in the Forsaken Land, it shouldn’t be a problem for us to protect ourselves. Since that’s the case, why don’t we take this opportunity to go and investigate. If we encounter any danger that we can’t deal with, it won’t be too late to retreat. Husband, what do you think?”","Although she asked for Li Moying’s opinion, but Huang Yueli was actually very clear that her husband would definitely not go against her.","Indeed, Li Moying pondered for a moment before nodding his head,” Alright, I’ll listen to you then.”","Huang Yueli’s lips immediately curled into a smile. Just as she was about to speak, she heard Li Moying’s tone turn solemn as he continued,” But this isn’t an ordinary mystic region. You must be careful and not rush in recklessly, understand?”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips,” I know, I know. Husband, you’re getting more and more long-winded!”","Hearing the little fox’s careless response, Li Moying shook his head helplessly.","His wife was good in everything, but her courage was even fatter than his!","He was really worried to death...","The two of them finished their discussion and immediately set off without delay, heading in the direction of You ‘an City, which was the closest to them.","The distance from here to the Sea of Secrets was extremely far, so the best way was to take a flying ship.","However, the spaceship needed a large open space when it took off. In addition, it was too close to the demon territory, so it was not safe to take off. Therefore, they planned to walk through the Vermillion Light Collet where the demons were stationed and reach the area controlled by the gods before taking out the spaceship.","After walking for a few hours, they saw the Vermillion Light Collet in the distance.","When the two of them arrived, they had saved little Phoenix Xiangxiang at the Vermillion Light Collet’s market and even fought with the Vermillion Light Collet’s Lord, Rui Jiang.","“Husband, since we’re here, let’s go to the Vermillion Light Collet. The last time I went to the market, I originally wanted to buy some materials from the devil race. In the end, with the matter of Xiangxiang, I couldn’t care less...” Huang Yueli thought of something and suggested.","Li Moying naturally had no objections,” Alright.”","The two of them disguised themselves and sneaked into the Vermillion Light Collet again.","This time, they had experience. They knew that in the territory of the Devil Race, strength represented everything. They couldn’t be as low-key as they were in the 12 continents of the Ancient God Clan.","Therefore, they took the initiative to release a portion of their evil Qi, disguising themselves as two demons with the strength of Earth Demons in the middle stage.","As for why he did not disguise himself as an early-stage Sky Devil like he did when he came...","The strength of a middle stage was quite reliable. He was considered an expert in the devil race. To ordinary devils, he was a target to look up to. However, he was not very rare, so he was not conspicuous and convenient for them to move.","“The last time I came, I saw someone selling that kind of red stone in the market. It was about the size of a fist and had a special aura inside. It was a little like evil qi, but it was different from evil qi...”"]},{"number":4431,"title":"Chapter 4431 Those who are courting death are here again (3)","paragraphs":["4431 Those who are courting death are here again (3)","“Last time, time was tight, and I couldn’t decide what it was, so I didn’t buy it. However, when I was in the Perched Phoenix Canyon, I heard an old phoenix say that this stone is called the Red Bell Stone. It’s a precious material used by the demons to advance. I think it’s also very beneficial to increase the concentration of our evil energy. Why don’t we buy some and try?”","“Also...”","Before Huang Yueli came here, she had already prepared a plan and listed out all of them in a targeted manner for Li Moying to help pay attention to.","But who knew that after they strolled around the market, they discovered...","There were at least half of the stalls in the market compared to the last time they came.","Especially those stall owners who sold high-end materials, they had basically disappeared. The only ones left were some peddlers selling scrap metal.","Even the human traffickers they met last time had disappeared.","The two of them could not help but frown.","If they couldn’t see any problems, they would have wasted their time!","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and stopped a random peddler by the roadside. She asked directly: ” What’s going on? Why are there so few stalls in the market?”","The peddler was obviously surprised.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s question, she knew that the two of them were from other places.","Foreign demons were the best targets for extortion!","Small vendors like them, who did not have any good goods to sell, mainly relied on scamming outsiders to make money.","The peddler thought of something and was about to speak.","However, at this moment, a powerful pressure suddenly approached him!","The peddler’s face suddenly turned pale. He could not help but take a step back. His chest churned, and he almost spat out a mouthful of blood on the spot!","This terrifying pressure only lasted for a short three breaths before it disappeared.","However, the hawker’s attitude had completely softened.","He realized that the man and woman in front of him were very powerful and not someone an ordinary person like him could provoke.","Huang Yueli raised her brows in surprise as she exchanged a glance with Li Moying.","Huang Yueli’s eyes flashed with a trace of seriousness as she continued to ask: ” So that’s the case, then...” How’s the situation between us and the God Clan?”","“This... It can be said that there are wins and losses, but overall, our demon race has the upper hand! Lord Rui Jiang is one of the top experts of our demon race. He has already reached the late stage of the Heavenly Demon realm. The allied forces at the front line of You ‘an City can’t withstand him at all! This time, we might be able to take You ‘an City directly. If we really succeed, it’ll definitely be a great merit!”","The peddler said with envy in his eyes.","If Lord Rui Jiang conquered You ‘an City, everyone in the demon army would be rewarded. Of course, the peddler wanted to be rewarded as well.","Unfortunately, his strength was too low, and the army did not like him."]},{"number":4432,"title":"Chapter 4432 Those who are courting death are here again (4)","paragraphs":["4432 Those who are courting death are here again (4)","However, Huang Yueli and Li Moying frowned.","The demons and the allied army actually started a war so soon!","The last time they passed by the Pill Light Region, the atmosphere was still harmonious. It didn’t look like a war was going to happen.","Moreover, this time, from the tone and expression of the peddler, it could be seen that the demon army had a great advantage, while the situation of the alliance army was quite unfavorable.","Otherwise, the demons were not stupid. How could they rush to the battlefield to die one by one?","Huang Yueli waved her hand and sent the peddler away.","She turned to look at Li Moying beside her,” Husband, what do you think is going on? Could something have happened to You ‘an City?”","The two of them had seen You An City’s City Lord Meng before too. He was a late-stage Dao Profound Realm powerhouse. His strength was rather decent, and his battle merits were brilliant. Otherwise, he would not have been sent to oversee such an important military fortress either.","As for the Pill Light Region’s lord, Rui Jiang, they had fought before. He was at the peak of the late stage of the Heavenly Demon Realm.","But in terms of individual strength, Rui Jiang was indeed slightly better.","However, the outside of each city was set up with very powerful defensive array formations. It could be described as impregnable.","The city also stored a large number of Crystal Jades as strategic resources.","If he spared no expense and used the crystal jades to activate all the defensive formations, then with Rui Jiang’s strength, it would be impossible for him to break through You ‘an City.","Li Moying frowned slightly,” I heard a few days ago that there were some problems within the alliance army. Because of the internal strife, several City Lords and Divine Generals were ostracized and were transferred out of their original battle zone. Who knows, City Lord Meng might not be in You An City anymore...”","Huang Yueli’s expression turned serious,” What? There was such a thing? In that case, could it be that Youan City is really in a tight situation?”","Li Moying replied,” There’s no use for us to guess here. Let’s go to the front line to take a look and we’ll know. Killing demons on the battlefield is also a kind of training. It saves us the trouble of traveling thousands of miles to the Forsaken Land.”","“You’re right!” Huang Yueli nodded her head.","Then, he rolled his eyes.” However, since we’re already here, there’s no need for us to go to the front line ourselves...”","Li Moying was startled but immediately understood as he shook his head in amusement,” You...”","Huang Yueli grabbed his large hand and pulled him towards a street.","The demon conscription points were located on every main street of the Pill Light Ridge, so they were easy to find.","Huang Yueli took a look at the notice in front and it was written on it that those with strong abilities would be prioritized.","She immediately pulled her husband and walked to the front of the team.","“I’m sorry, we’re in a hurry. Please let us register first so that we can be the first to go to the front line to support.”","Huang Yueli said impolitely.","The red-haired demon warrior at the front was a late Earth Demon, the strongest at this recruitment point.","When the other mo saw him, they were very afraid and consciously hid behind him, not daring to provoke him.","Unexpectedly, he was interrupted by a dough hole that he had never seen before.","The expression of the red-haired demon changed abruptly, and he angrily rebuked,”Get lost! He didn’t even know the rule of the strong taking priority! Do you know how strong I am? Go to the back and die!”"]},{"number":4433,"title":"Chapter 4433 Those who are courting death are here again (5)","paragraphs":["4433 Those who are courting death are here again (5)","The red-haired demon didn’t just talk.","The surrounding demons immediately cried out in surprise.","” Where did these two people come from? They actually dared to cut in Lord Cheng Hui’s line!”","“He’s simply courting death!”","“Isn’t that so? They’re dead for sure now. They deserve it!”","The red-haired demon, Cheng Hui, was quite famous in the Pill Light Region. He was one of the few late-stage Earth Demons and was known as invincible under the Heavenly Demons.","He was also highly regarded in the mo army of Auspicious River.","This time, he was out on business and had just returned to the Pill Light Ridge. That was why he was unable to catch up with Rui Jiang’s army.","Cheng Hui came to the recruitment point and relied on his strength to suppress him. Even the demon race did not dare to look him in the eye.","Who would have thought that two Earth Devil Middle Stage fellows would suddenly appear and actually cut the queue, and even wanted to chase him away without any politeness!","Cheng Hui couldn’t stand this anger and immediately chose to attack.","In the eyes of him and the demons on the side, this casual wave of his hand was not something that the two Earth Demons at the middle stage could withstand. Everyone seemed to have already seen the tragic scene of the two of them being sent flying and smashed into meat paste.","However, Huang Yueli naturally wouldn’t be frightened by a mere Late Earth Devil.","She didn’t even have the intention to dodge. She didn’t even put up a defensive stance. She just stood there calmly.","The pitch-black and cold demonic qi pounced straight at her and hit her chest.","“No one has ever dared to say such things to me, Cheng Hui.” Cheng Hui sneered.","His arrogant and domineering words stopped halfway. His eyes widened as he stared at the girl in front of him in disbelief.","Huang Yueli actually didn’t fly out like he had imagined and instead, she stood firmly on the spot.","Not even a single wound could be found on his body!","“You... You...”","He could not accept the reality in front of him!","Moreover, she didn’t even dodge just now and took that attack head-on!","Huang Yueli gave a slight smile,” You want me to die till the end? Unfortunately... You don’t have such strength! If you don’t want to lose face, then obediently leave and give up your position. Otherwise, I’ll make a move. Don’t blame me if you can’t get off the stage.”","Huang Yueli couldn’t be bothered to fight with him.","However, Cheng Hui thought that she was feeling guilty.","He thought about it and immediately understood.” Okay, I understand! You wretched girl must be wearing some powerful armor! Was it a treasured weapon from the God Clan? No wonder he could block one of my moves! Do you think you can defeat me with a treasured weapon?","What a joke! Just nice, the armor on your body...I want it!”","Cheng Hui laughed sinisterly, feeling that he was in luck this time.","The Devil Race couldn’t refine high-grade spirit weapons by themselves, and spirit weapons above the Bejeweled Weapon level rarely flowed out from the twelve continents of the Divine World.","A treasure that money couldn’t buy was actually presented in front of him.","Cheng Hui immediately used all the strength in his body to bombard towards Huang Yueli!","This time, he didn’t hold back at all. He wanted to kill her as soon as possible.","Not only did he save his face, but more importantly, he had to snatch the treasure armor from her!"]},{"number":4434,"title":"Chapter 4434 Those who are courting death are here again (6)","paragraphs":["4434 Those who are courting death are here again (6)","Seeing Cheng Hui’s aggressive appearance, all the spectating fiend race martial artists revealed a horrified expression.","It wasn’t just to chase Huang Yueli and the rest away and teach them a lesson.","He wanted their lives!","But among the devil race, the strong were angered by the weak and in a fit of anger, they killed on the spot. This kind of thing wasn’t rare and the passersby didn’t have any sympathy to speak of. Instead, they were rather agitated, feeling that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were so unkind that they deserved to be killed!","Everyone had submitted to Cheng Hui. Who were they to be so arrogant?","” When Lord Cheng Hui attacked just now, she couldn’t even dodge. If it wasn’t for the treasure armor on her body, she would have died long ago!”","“It’s over this time. She’s dead!”","“Ha, she still can’t move this time!”","Cheng Hui’s palm had already reached Luo Chenxi’s chest, and it looked like he was about to send her flying.","Just at this moment, Huang Yueli’s figure suddenly swayed.","Cheng Hui only felt that his eyes were blurred and he couldn’t see anything clearly. When he regained his senses, he realised that Huang Yueli’s figure had suddenly disappeared.","What was going on?","Before he could react, he suddenly heard the exclamations of the surrounding demons behind him.","“Good heavens!”","“She’s behind us!”","Cheng Hui’s mind buzzed, and he immediately realized that something was wrong.","His reaction was fast. Although he didn’t know what was going on, he had already turned around. A wave of demonic qi seeped out of his body and he instinctively adopted a defensive posture.","However, no matter how fast his movements were, he couldn’t catch up to Huang Yueli’s speed.","Before his devil qi barrier could take shape, Huang Yueli had already swung out a palm strike towards him.","Although she wasn’t as proficient in using fire attributed energy, but the evil aura in Huang Yueli’s body had been through multiple dual cultivation and daily tempering, so it was incomparably pure. Just relying on brute force alone wasn’t something that Cheng Hui’s level of devil race could withstand.","His fat and tall body was sent flying, crashing into the wall of a building opposite him.","Cheng Hui’s body was pressed under this pile of ruins, and it was unknown whether he was dead or alive.","For a moment, all the demons present were stunned by this scene.","No one had expected that such a young, beautiful and slender girl like Huang Yueli was actually so powerful to this extent. She only used a single move to send a Late Earth Devil expert flying!","Moreover, looking at her calm expression, it was obvious that this did not take much effort.","None of the demons dared to make a sound.","Those few Devils who had mocked Huang Yueli in order to please Cheng Hui earlier had turned pale as they shrunk back in fear, afraid that Huang Yueli would settle the score with them.","Huang Yueli totally didn’t pay attention to these people but turned towards the recruitment point’s management staff.","“How is it?” he asked coldly. Can I sign up to join the army now?”","“Ke ke ke...Yes... Sir, you... This way please...”","The demon hurriedly spoke, feeling that his voice was trembling.","Where did this monster come from? How could he be so strong at the middle Earth Devil Stage?","Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t waste any words as they directly stepped forward and casually filled in a fake name on the form, leaving everything else blank.","“Alright? When can we go to the front line?”","Huang Yueli threw the form aside and asked impatiently."]},{"number":4435,"title":"Chapter 4435 Are you guys stupid?(1)","paragraphs":["4435 Are you guys stupid?(1)","“Two...Sir Li, this batch of soldiers is still... It was not full yet. I’m gonna... We’ll set off together tomorrow after the recruitment is full...”","Because they were in awe of Huang Yueli’s ability, they didn’t dare to raise their heads to look at her.","The names they left behind were Li Yue and Li Mo.","Although it looked very fake, this was a demon race that respected strength. As long as they were strong enough, no one would dare to question them.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance and nodded,” Got it.”","The reason why the two of them didn’t return to You ‘an City directly and chose to participate in the mo’s recruitment was because they wanted to take this opportunity to blend into the mo army and act according to the situation.","Therefore, he had to go with the main group.","The demon conscripters did not expect them to suddenly become so easy to talk to, and they immediately heaved a sigh of relief.","“Sirs, please sit here and rest for a while. We will immediately register the martial artists behind us...”","Although the mo conscription had already sped up as much as possible, there were simply too many mo signing up to join the army.","It was not until the evening that all the applicants had registered.","During this period, Huang Yueli and Li Moying sat at the side and observed silently.","With these two powerful experts in close proximity, the mo suddenly became obedient. The originally crooked team suddenly became very orderly, and they did not dare to speak loudly.","After everyone had signed up, the mo conscripters brought them to the temporary camp.","The Devil General in charge of this campsite had a cultivation of Late Earth Devil and after listening to the recruit’s explanation of everything that happened today, he looked at Huang Yueli and Li Moying with a gaze filled with playfulness.","“Oh? He really did not expect that there was actually someone who could leap realms and defeat Cheng Hui, and even only used one move! You must be geniuses nurtured by other territories, right?”","Li Moying swept a glance at him as he spoke coldly,” This doesn’t seem to have anything to do with you right?”","“I want to make sure that you are not spies from other territories! However, this attack on You ‘an City was personally ordered by His Majesty the Demon King. I’m sure you won’t dare to cause trouble at this time.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s eyes flashed with a trace of surprise as she hurriedly lowered her head to hide her expression.","This operation was actually related to the legendary Demon King...","In addition, this Demon General suspected that they were spies, which also surprised her.","The Demon General sized up all the demons present and finally said,” Li Mo, Li Yue, since the two of you are the strongest, then according to the convention, you will be the captain of this batch of recruits. At that time, you will be in charge of leading them to the front line.” Everyone, tighten your skin. The Protoss and the Human Race are not as easy to deal with as you think!”","That night, Huang Yueli and Li Moying stayed in the devil race’s temporary camp.","Because there were many people around, they did not say much.","In any case, the two of them had the same thoughts and knew that the other party would definitely have the same thoughts as them.","The next morning, they brought this demon troop and set off for the front line.","“Sir, are you thirsty? I have nectar specially made from the Pill Light Necktie. Would you like to try it?”","“Sir, are you bored? Why don’t I sing a little song for you?”"]},{"number":4436,"title":"Chapter 4436 Are you guys stupid?(2)","paragraphs":["4436 Are you guys stupid?(2)","“Sir...”","It wasn’t that Huang Yueli and Li Moying hadn’t led troops before. The last time when they killed Heavenly Devil Rui Ze, they had also led the allied troops.","Therefore, he thought that this time would be similar to the last time.","Who knew that as soon as they left the Pill Light Ridge, these demons would become active and surround the two of them to flatter them.","That fawning attitude almost made Huang Yueli vomit.","“Enough! No one is allowed to speak! Pay attention to the situation around you. You, you...And the few of you, form two teams and patrol five miles in the east and west directions. Once you find traces of humans or gods, report back immediately!”","” Everyone, cheer up. If we can find the alliance army on the way to the camp and make a contribution, we will definitely be highly regarded by Lord Ruijiang!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t bear to listen on any longer and could only speak out, picking out a few Earth Devil ranked devils to act as scouts to scout the surrounding situation.","The purpose of her doing this was naturally not to obtain the military merits of the fiend race.","He just wanted to send these noisy demons away.","Finally, under Huang Yueli’s arrangement, the Devil Race was split into small teams and went to carry out their respective missions.","Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief as she sneaked closer to Li Moying’s side and grumbled softly,” These devils are too ruthless when they flatter me, right? I really don’t know what they’re thinking!”","Li Moying smiled as he replied,” The devil race has always been afraid of the strong. If you want to blame someone, blame yourself for the strength you revealed at the recruitment point yesterday which was too strong! If I had kept a low profile, there wouldn’t be such trouble.”","Huang Yueli pursed her lips.","To be honest, after she had acted impulsively yesterday, she was a little regretful.","If she had known that these demons were so troublesome, and that the strongest would be appointed as the captain, she would not have challenged Cheng Hui just to queue for a few hours less!","Wouldn’t it be good to hide in the demon team and do something bad?","Now that he had become the captain, although there were benefits, there were too many annoying bootlickers...","“It’s all your fault. You clearly saw that I was annoyed by these people. Why didn’t you help me chase them away? As a husband, shouldn’t you handle all the things that Wifey hates?” Huang Yueli was filled with regret as she tugged at Li Moying’s sleeve to act shamelessly, and swiftly pushed the blame onto her husband.","Li Moying didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","Usually when he was outside, he would always be silent. If he needed to make decisions, he would listen to his wife’s command.","Why was this little fox unhappy today?","He cleared his throat and was about to coax Huang Yueli.","At this moment, a series of hurried footsteps sounded, and a team of demon soldiers quickly ran towards them.","At the same time, he shouted,”My Lords! We’re gonna... I’ve found some information!”","“What news?” The two of them were stunned.","The demon soldier ran forward and panted,”Reporting to the two lords, just...” Not far northeast...There was... There was a group of people following...We’re fighting the alliance army!”","” What?!”","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows in surprise.","She had sent these people out to investigate the enemy’s situation just to use them as an excuse to chase them away. She had never expected to get any useful information about the battle situation.","After all, these demons were like a plate of loose sand, without the qualities of the allied soldiers.","Moreover, they were now at the rear of the frontline. Under normal circumstances, the allied soldiers should not be here."]},{"number":4437,"title":"Chapter 4437 Are you guys stupid?(3)","paragraphs":["4437 Are you guys stupid?(3)","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment,” How far is the location of the battle from us?”","“So close?”","Huang Yueli was even more surprised as she thought for a moment and said: ” Then let’s go over and take a look.”","Although it was indeed surprising to meet the soldiers of the alliance army here, it was fine if she didn’t meet them. Since she did, she couldn’t pretend that she didn’t know.","If the alliance army was at a disadvantage, she would definitely have to save them.","Li Moying understood her thoughts as he nodded his head,” Let’s go over and take a look!”","The two of them walked towards the battlefield.","Behind him were several hundred demon soldiers.","The demon squad that was scouting for information was indeed right. Not long after they walked, they could already see the chaotic scene in front of them. The air was also filled with the energy ripples of various attributes.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying quickened their pace and continued to walk closer, finally seeing the situation clearly.","The two sides that were fighting were an alliance army team of a dozen people and a demon army of a hundred people.","Following Huang Yueli’s increase in strength, her divine sense also became stronger and stronger. Even though they were separated by such a long distance, she could still clearly judge the strength of both parties through the Profound Energy fluctuations.","She blinked.” Eh? These allied army martial artists are basically all from the god clan. Moreover, their strength is very outstanding. They are all at the Heart Profound Realm!”","Within the alliance army, most of the Heart Profound Realm martial artists were at the level of Divine Guards. Even if they were not, they were at least Company Leaders and not ordinary soldiers.","A small team full of such elite martial artists...","” It seems that they are responsible for carrying out important missions.” Li Moying’s deep voice rang out beside her ear.","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” I think so too.”","Li Moying continued,” But this team’s situation doesn’t look good...”","This was obvious.","Although the alliance army was made up of elites, there were only a dozen of them. They were unable to kill their way through when faced with an enemy ten times their number.","At this rate, it was only a matter of time before they were completely defeated.","For a moment, they were all extremely excited.","” Hahaha, our luck is really good. We’ve already met the trash of the alliance army. The credit is right in front of us!”","“Isn’t that so? They were already injured. They were simply unable to withstand a single blow! I reckon it won’t be long before he falls.”","“Not good! If they fall now, where are we going to get the credit?”","“That’s right, we have to rush...”","The fiend race all rubbed their fists and were ready to go up and have a big fight!","Everyone turned their expectant gazes towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying.","It wasn’t that they didn’t want to rush up to snatch the credit but in these two days, the two Lords Li’s strength had left a deep impression on them and no one dared to disobey them so they could only restrain themselves and listen to Huang Yueli and the rest’s orders.","Huang Yueli didn’t say a word.","Just as the demons were puzzled, she suddenly stomped on the ground, and her figure was like an arrow that had left the bow, charging toward the chaotic battlefield!","Almost at the same time, Li Moying also stood up.","” Ah!” The demons exclaimed in surprise.” The two Lords Li actually took action personally! Those alliance soldiers are finished now. The credit belongs to our team!”"]},{"number":4438,"title":"Chapter 4438 Are you guys stupid?(4)","paragraphs":["4438 Are you guys stupid?(4)","These devils had witnessed Huang Yueli’s attack yesterday and knew that their abilities were far above the devils who were fighting!","After joining the battle, it would definitely form a crushing situation.","They had not guessed wrongly.","After Huang Yueli and Li Moying rushed into the forest, they immediately made their move as extremely sharp demonic aura seeped out from their bodies, as they attacked fiercely towards the opposite side.","” Captain Li is too powerful. Hurry up and beat up this bunch of bastards from the alliance army!”","“Killing them is all our credit!”","“Charge, everyone charge together...Eh? What happened?”","The demon soldiers were originally following behind the two of them and were prepared to charge into the crowd.","Following behind such a powerful captain, even if it was just to fish in troubled waters, the credit would be indispensable.","However, they had only run a few steps when they realized that something was wrong with the situation in front of them.","No, something was very wrong!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s imposing manner was shocking. The moment they attacked, their target wasn’t the allied soldiers, but...It directly killed the demon closest to it!","The demon soldiers who followed the two of them did not expect this at all. They were all stunned.","And in this short few breaths, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already killed over ten devils.","The two of them were extremely powerful and had an overwhelming advantage. In addition, the demons in the chaotic battle had never thought that they would be attacked by their allies and were completely caught off guard.","So Huang Yueli and Li Moying totally didn’t expend any effort as they had already killed half of the devils.","The remaining demon soldiers finally reacted at this time.","“Everyone gather, gather, gather towards me! Formation! Attack them together! Did you hear that?”","The leader of the team shouted loudly, wanting to gather the team.","However, the demon soldiers lacked discipline to begin with. Now that they were facing the danger of losing their lives at any time, they were even more chaotic. Some even wanted to escape into the forest when they saw that the situation was not good.","Who would take his words seriously?","“Damn it, come here! Whoever dares to be a deserter, I will kill him after we win!”","Unfortunately, it was too late.","In just a few words, more than ten demon soldiers died.","Half of the soldiers had already died.","The rest knew that they had encountered an expert and only wanted to escape.","Not only did the captain not manage to gather a single person, he even exposed his identity as the captain and gained Huang Yueli’s special attention.","“So you are the leader of this team. That’s great. I’ll send you off and let you continue leading your team underground.” Huang Yueli said smilingly.","The captain’s expression changed.” You...” Where did you come from? How dare you kill me? You... Do you know who I am?","I’m the nephew of the Lord of Pill Light Region, Lord Rui Jiang. If you dare...”","“Tsk, so much nonsense!”","The Captain had not finished his words when Huang Yueli casually waved her hand and a strand of evil aura pierced through his chest. With his hand covering his chest, his eyes widened as he slowly fell to the ground.","Without a leader, the remaining demons were even more vulnerable.","This was a battle without any suspense.","At this moment, the dozen or so allied soldiers stood rooted to the ground like blocks of wood, staring blankly at everything that was happening in front of them. They were completely unable to come back to their senses.","They thought they were dead for sure!","In order to avoid falling into the hands of the demons and being tortured or even refined into blood pills, they even planned to draw their swords and commit suicide.","In the end...There was actually internal strife among the demons?"]},{"number":4439,"title":"Chapter 4439 Are you guys stupid?(5)","paragraphs":["4439 Are you guys stupid?(5)","This was an unexpected turn of events.","By the time everyone finally recovered from their shock, the hundred demons had already been cleaned up by the two of them.","Huang Yueli slowly kept the long sword in her hand as she walked towards the crowd.","The demon soldiers in her team all looked at the two of them with trepidation.","They had just killed more than a hundred demons. Although there were no traces of blood on their bodies, the sharp killing intent that they emitted was enough to make anyone who saw them tremble in fear.","Huang Yueli swept a glance at her subordinates,” Are all of you fools? Seeing my husband and I fight, you just stand there and watch? What’s the use of having trash like you?”","The demons finally reacted.","They were all filled with confusion. Even now, they still could not figure out what had happened.","After a moment of silence, a bold demon finally mustered up his courage and spoke carefully.","“That... Li...Lord Li, are you...Eh, killed the wrong person? How many are there opposite us?","They are the soldiers of the alliance army...”","After saying this, he immediately shut his mouth and looked terrified.","He was afraid that if he exposed the powerful captain, the captain would fly into a rage out of humiliation and directly kill him to silence him!","Huang Yueli’s face indeed showed a trace of anger.","However, she did not do anything to this demon. Instead, she frowned and reprimanded him. Or do you think I’m a fool like you? Would I not be able to distinguish between the demons and the allied forces, and not know which side to kill?”","“But...But... Those were clearly...”","The demon couldn’t help but speak again.","However, halfway through his sentence, his companion beside him tugged at him and reminded him not to court death.","He quickly shut his mouth.","Although he didn’t finish his sentence, his meaning had already been expressed.","The demons were stunned.","Huang Yueli continued: ” There are only a dozen allied soldiers here while the Devil race has over a hundred people. Moreover, they have almost wiped out the entire allied army. If we were to be together with them, how would we be able to get any credit? He might as well kill them all! Who else can snatch it from us?”","Hearing this, all the demons came to their senses.","The gaze they gave Huang Yueli was filled with admiration and admiration.","“As expected of Captain Li. You have considered far ahead...”","” That’s right. We must kill these brats. They dared to snatch military merits from Lord Li. They deserve to die!”","“Lord Li is wise, Lord Li is mighty!”","All kinds of flattery were sent over as if they were free.","Even Li Moying couldn’t help but raise his brows.","He had not expected that Huang Yueli would actually explain it in such a way...And these demons really believed it!","Huang Yueli’s lips twitched as she forcefully suppressed the disgust in her heart and pretended to be enjoying it.","After a long while, she waved her hand.” Alright, all of you, return to the team!”","She turned around and walked towards the soldiers."]},{"number":4440,"title":"Chapter 4440 Are you guys stupid?(6)","paragraphs":["4440 Are you guys stupid?(6)","The alliance army soldiers originally wanted to escape when they saw the demons fighting among themselves. However, there were simply too many demons.","Seeing Huang Yueli walk over, the leader immediately spat out a mouthful of saliva at her.","“Demons are really disgusting. They can do anything without any sense of propriety and shame! He actually killed his own allies in order to snatch credit! You’ve really broadened my horizons!”","Behind the captain, those allied army soldiers also threw disdainful gazes towards Huang Yueli and the rest.","For the humans and the Protoss, unity was the most basic moral bottom line.","Even if it was Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan who had deep grudges in private, once they joined the alliance army and went to the front lines, they would have to temporarily put down their grudges.","On the battlefield, it was very normal to sacrifice oneself for a comrade.","In the end, the fiend race’s performance today was an eye-opener for them.","There was actually someone who publicly killed his entire team in order to snatch credit!","Moreover, none of the subordinates of these two captains thought that they were wrong. They were all excited and shouted,”Captain is wise!”","Thinking of this, the soldiers of the alliance army were so disgusted that they could not speak.","Huang Yueli turned her body slightly and avoided the Captain’s saliva. Walking closer, she raised her chin and looked at them with an arrogant expression.","“Your surname is Xuan? So, they are warriors of the Black Tortoise Race?”","“What does it have to do with you?” Captain Xuan sneered. If you want to kill me or cut me up, do as you please. Don’t even think about getting information from me. I won’t say anything!”","“Yes, we won’t say anything!”","“I will never bow to you disgusting fellows!”","The soldiers of the alliance army began to clamor.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up as her voice was clear and cold,” Very good, you indeed have a backbone. Then I’ll fulfill your wish! Men, tie them up and take them all away!”","The demon soldiers swarmed up and went to kidnap him.","The soldiers of the alliance army were unwilling to give in, so they naturally struggled with all their might.","Therefore, he was subdued by the demons in a few moves.","Seeing the Demon soldiers approaching with a sinister smile, he gritted his teeth and endured the intense pain all over his body. Forcefully condensing the Profound Energy in his body, he used all his strength to blast towards the Demon soldiers.","“Boom!”","A pillar of water shot into the sky.","“Not good!”","“Damn it!”","Accompanied by a series of screams, the few demon soldiers standing at the front were directly bombarded by the water-type energy.","Among the four, two of them were directly pierced by the water pillar. It looked like they wouldn’t be able to survive, and the other two were also sent flying.","No one had expected Captain Xuan to be able to unleash such a powerful attack despite being so heavily injured.","In an instant, all the demon soldiers present were stunned.","Seeing this, the alliance army soldiers cheered.","However, the good times did not last long. This attack seemed powerful, but it was actually completed by Captain Xuan’s overdraft of his blood essence power. At the same time he killed the demon, he also instantly drained the remaining strength in his body.","Captain Xuan’s body swayed a few times and fell to the ground with a bang. He could not get up no matter what."]},{"number":4441,"title":"Chapter 4441 Is she a demon?(1)","paragraphs":["4441 Is she a demon?(1)","The demons heaved a sigh of relief.","” Hehe, these bastards of the alliance army have long lost their strength. They’re just pretending!”","“You still have the strength to kill? It seems that we were too polite to you, right? I’ll show you our methods now!”","An early-stage Earth Devil sneered as he walked forward. He raised the long whip in his hand high and whipped it fiercely towards Captain Xuan’s face!","He used all of his strength in this whip, and it was very strong and fierce.","Once it landed on his face, his skin and flesh would definitely split open and his face would be disfigured on the spot.","Even though Captain Xuan had been through hundreds of battles and had a strong will, he could not help but reveal a trace of nervousness and fear in his eyes. He stared at the whip and tried his best to mobilize the Profound Energy in his body, wanting to block the whip.","However, his Profound Energy had already been completely exhausted and he could not use any strength at all. He struggled for a long time but he could not even move a finger.","Just as the whip was about to hit his face, the demon soldier’s sinister laughter could be heard clearly.","He could only close his eyes and wait for the pain to come.","However, at this moment, the whizzing of the long whip suddenly stopped, and the laughter of the demons also stopped abruptly.","Captain Xuan kept his eyes closed and waited for a few breaths. He did not feel any pain. He was shocked and hurriedly opened his eyes.","He saw that the female captain of the demon race who was still killing in all directions was standing not far from him. The long whip that had just been whipped at him had unknowingly fallen into her hands.","The devil who attacked Captain Xuan had an astonished expression as he looked at Huang Yueli,” Li...Captain Li, what are you... I just want to teach this arrogant god a lesson! “You don’t know that these god clans are very cunning. They always want to escape, so it’s impossible not to use some methods to tame them...”","“Do I need you to teach me?” Huang Yueli’s voice was ice-cold.","The mo trembled and did not dare to make a sound.","Although he was an Early Earth Devil and it seemed like he was only a small realm away from Huang Yueli.","However, the difference in strength between the two of them was like heaven and earth!","Although he didn’t agree with Huang Yueli’s way of doing things, but he didn’t dare to say a single word, afraid of angering this ruthless Captain.","The corpses of the more than a hundred demon soldiers were still lying on the ground!","Only then did the demon soldiers reveal a look of realization.","“Captain is wise! Why didn’t we think of that!”","“It’s all our fault for being brainless!”","“Captain, don’t worry. We won’t touch a single hair on their heads!”","Huang Yueli then nodded her head and waved her hand,” Stop doing brainless things! Hurry up and tie her up! Oh right, we have to be careful of them biting their tongues and committing suicide. This is all our credit. We can’t lose anything!”","When Captain Xuan and the rest heard Huang Yueli’s words, they almost fainted from anger.","They had indeed received an important mission and when they heard Huang Yueli say that she was going to interrogate them for information, many of them had planned to bite their tongues to commit suicide to avoid leaking the information.","In the end, before he could make a move, he heard these words again!","Was this guy a demon?","He didn’t even allow her to commit suicide!"]},{"number":4442,"title":"Chapter 4442 Is She a Devil?(2)","paragraphs":["4442 Is She a Devil?(2)","Weren’t demons all brawny but simple-minded?","Where did this guy come from? Why was he so sinister and cunning?","Unfortunately, it was too late for them to do anything now.","Under Huang Yueli’s reminder, the devil soldiers came to their senses and hurriedly rushed forward, tying up all the allied soldiers and even stuffing rags into their mouths to prevent them from biting their tongues.","The demons could not find rags at the last minute, so they just casually pulled a piece from their clothes and made do with it.","The hygiene habits of the devil race were not good either and the cloth was filled with a foul stench. Some of the allied soldiers had even fainted from the stench and those who didn’t faint were filled with hatred towards Huang Yueli. Each and every one of their eyes were filled with ferocity, looking as though they couldn’t wait to pounce on her and kill her on the spot.","Huang Yueli totally didn’t take their attitude seriously and after giving her instructions, she brought Li Moying along and left.","The team continued on their journey.","Moreover, because they had wasted a lot of time on the road, they had to speed up in order to reach the predetermined campsite in time.","The mo soldiers were all in high spirits, and their thoughts ran wild along the way.","He had already made such a huge contribution before even reaching the army camp. He would definitely receive a lot of rewards in the future!","As night approached, the team finally arrived at the campsite.","For matters like setting up a tent, naturally Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t need to do it personally.","The demon soldiers rushed to serve the two of them. After the tent was set up, they politely invited the two of them in.","As the night deepened, most of the demons had already rested, except for a few patrolling squads of soldiers.","Huang Yueli then jumped up from the soft couch that was temporarily set up,” Let’s go, let’s go and see that Xuan...Aiyo!”","Before she could finish, a strong arm suddenly grabbed her waist and pulled her back.","Huang Yueli fell back onto the soft couch as her back bumped into the man’s sturdy chest and she couldn’t help but let out a light snort.","“Moying, you...What are you doing?”","Li Moying’s pitch-black eyes flashed with a trace of darkness as he turned his head sideways and blew lightly at her ear,” What’s the rush? Anyway, it will take at least five to six days for us to reach the demon camp. It won’t be too late to meet them in a few days. We haven’t dual cultivated for two days. We should hurry up and cultivate...”","The man’s scorching hot breath blew by her ear and Huang Yueli’s small face instantly turned red.","She slapped Li Moying’s hand away,” You you you...Don’t touch me! I’m talking business with you! That group of alliance soldiers clearly misunderstood our identity. We should go over and explain as soon as possible. Otherwise, if we scare them...”","” They asked for it when they got scared. Who asked them to be so brainless that they couldn’t tell who was their ally?” Li Moying gave a cold sneer,” Moreover, it’s just the right time to dampen this bunch of fellas ‘spirit, so as to prevent them from ruining things at the crucial moment.”","Huang Yueli was slightly startled and when she turned her head, she saw Li Moying’s slightly gloomy expression and couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","Her husband must have heard Captain Xuan and the others scold her in the afternoon, so he bore a grudge against these allied soldiers. He was deliberately tormenting them.","Thinking of this, the corners of her lips curled up as she grabbed Li Moying’s arm and shook it,” Husband, don’t be angry anymore. The one being scolded is me but I’m not angry at all! From another perspective, they scolded me because we pretended to be demons, right? It would be terrible if they could tell that something was wrong with a glance!”"]},{"number":4443,"title":"Chapter 4443 Is She A Devil?(3)","paragraphs":["4443 Is She A Devil?(3)","Li Moying didn’t think much of it,” They act like it’s our business but if they can’t tell, it’s them who are blind. Moreover, we’ve just captured them today, so there must be many demon soldiers watching. If we want to obtain information from them, we’ll definitely have to expose our identities. That’ll be too easy to expose.”","In his opinion, no matter what the reason was, no matter what the twists and turns were, as long as he dared to insult his wife, he was courting death!","The reason why he didn’t personally teach them a lesson was that he had considered that they were soldiers of the alliance army and didn’t want to ruin the plan.","However, letting them be frightened for a few more days was the least punishment.","“But...”","Huang Yueli still wanted to say something when Li Moying suddenly grabbed her wrist and pulled her into his embrace.","Her pink lips were immediately blocked.","The man’s deep and sexy voice reverberated beside her ears,” Li ‘er, don’t think about others anymore. Think about how we can make up for the cultivation that we lost these few days without cultivating...”","“Mmm... Wuwu!”","Huang Yueli struggled hard for a few moments as she really wanted to tell Li Moying that cultivation was a long-term process and if he missed out on cultivating for a day or two, it wouldn’t affect him at all!","But after this period of dual cultivation, Li Moying really understood every single weakness on her body and without any effort, he made her entire body soften.","Forget it, forget it.","Her husband was right about one thing. If she went today, it would indeed be easy to expose herself.","At least it would be safer if he went a few days later.","Just like that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying led the devil race team and rushed for another five days.","Seeing that they would reach the camp of the demon army in another day, the demon soldiers were all excited.","Along the way, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had established absolute authority with their powerful abilities.","Of course, Captain Xuan and the others disliked them even more.","Even though Huang Yueli treated these captives with preferential treatment and didn’t abuse them, but in the eyes of the allied soldiers, this wasn’t any preferential treatment, but a scheme!","After all, the she-devil in front of him was a demon who would even kill her allies in order to snatch credit!","Who would believe her if she said that she had no conspiracy?","So that night, when Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s figures appeared in the captive’s tent, Captain Xuan and the rest were the first to wake up from their dreams as they stared at the two of them with guarded gazes.","Huang Yueli strode into the tent and waved at the demon soldiers who were in charge of guarding the tent.","“Alright, all of you can go and rest. Tomorrow, after we gather with Lord Mizuki’s army, we will definitely enter the battle immediately. Go and rest well tonight. Don’t embarrass me tomorrow!”","“But, Lord Li, these bastards from the alliance army are very cunning. This subordinate is worried...”","“What are you worried about? With these two moves, what can they do to this captain? All of you, get out of here. Don’t disturb me from interrogating the criminal.”","When the devil soldiers were swept by Huang Yueli’s icy cold gaze, they quivered and hurriedly retreated.","Huang Yueli used her spiritual perception to scan the surroundings and after confirming that no devils had passed by within a radius of three miles, she turned towards the allied soldiers.","He opened his mouth indifferently.” I have a few things to ask you...”","“Bah! Give up on this idea. Don’t think about getting information from us! If you want to kill me or torture me, it’s up to you. That’s impossible!”","“Right, don’t give me that. Hurry up and get lost!”"]},{"number":4444,"title":"Chapter 4444 Is She A Devil?(4)","paragraphs":["4444 Is She A Devil?(4)","“If you have the ability, kill us immediately! Otherwise, as long as I can escape, the first thing I will do is kill all of you!”","Although she knew that they must be very resentful, it had already been a few days, yet they were still so angry. It was beyond her expectations.","Such impulsiveness could easily put him at a disadvantage on the battlefield.","No wonder her husband said a few days ago that he wanted to cool them down and dampen their spirits.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly and just as she was about to say something, she felt a strong Profound Energy pressure from her surroundings.","When Li Moying heard them insulting Huang Yueli again, his expression sank as he immediately released the Profound Energy within his body.","He was already at the peak of the Profound Heart realm, and his cultivation was much higher than Captain Xuan and the others. Moreover, his Profound Energy was countless times purer than ordinary peak of the Profound Heart realm.","All of a sudden, everyone present felt an incomparably heavy pressure, and their faces instantly turned pale.","The few with the lowest cultivation could not help but hold their chests and almost vomit blood on the spot!","“You... You...”","Captain Xuan wanted to say something, but under such immense pressure, it was extremely difficult for him to even utter a word.","His heart was filled with shock as he could only look at Li Moying with a terrified expression.","That day in the dense forest, the one who made a move was mainly Huang Yueli and Li Moying was basically just adding on the damage from the side.","So Captain Xuan already had a deep understanding of Huang Yueli’s strength but he didn’t have a deep understanding of Li Moying’s ability.","It was only at this moment that he realized what kind of tyrannical existence he was facing!","Under Li Moying’s pressure, some of the soldiers couldn’t withstand it and with a plop, they knelt down on the ground.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she gently tugged at Li Moying’s sleeve,” Alright, Husband, it’s enough.”","Li Moying then retracted his Profound Energy and said coldly,” Cut the crap! Let my wife finish first. We didn’t come here to harm you today. If we wanted your lives, why would we wait until today?”","The soldiers were frightened by his strength and did not dare to make a sound.","However, his eyes were still filled with vigilance.","Her smile was especially sweet.","Unfortunately, this was just her wishful thinking. The soldiers of the alliance army had already been frightened too much. No matter how good their attitude was now, it was useless. They still had a defensive look on their faces.","Huang Yueli could only cough lightly as she continued: ” In fact, my husband and I are also from the alliance army. We are both Gods Race practitioners and not from the Devil Race. We’re just in disguise, hiding in the demon army. Don’t misunderstand.”","Captain Xuan did not believe his words at all. He immediately sneered,”Hehe, I knew you would say this!” Do you think we are fools? Do you think you can trick us into trusting you with this excuse? And tell you about the alliance army? Let me tell you, this move is no longer new!”","Huang Yueli had long prepared herself and knew that with just these few words, it was impossible to convince them.","“Of course I’m not lying to you. When my husband attacked earlier, didn’t you feel the thunder attributed Profound Energy on his body?”"]},{"number":4445,"title":"Chapter 4445 Is She a Devil?(5)","paragraphs":["4445 Is She a Devil?(5)","Everyone was stunned and subconsciously recalled.","But now that he thought about it, that powerful force...It was indeed thunder attributed Dark Force and not the Devil Qi that they had imagined.","Many of the allied soldiers showed signs of loosening up.","However, Captain Xuan still had a guarded look on his face.” You...” Don’t be fooled by them! I’ve long heard that there are some special spiritual artifacts that can hide the demonic aura on one’s body. In the past, many demons used this to secretly infiltrate our alliance army as spies!”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was speechless.","She was indeed a spy, but Captain Xuan had turned her camp upside down, right?","“Hehe, aren’t you all thinking too highly of yourselves? What good would it do to lie to you? If I really want to know any information, I just have to force a confession. You’re a strong-willed captain, but can you guarantee that all your soldiers can endure torture?” Huang Yueli sneered coldly.","Captain Xuan shivered.","“You... You want to... As expected of a ruthless fiend, doing things by hook or by crook! Do you think I’m afraid of you? Try it if you have the ability!","My team is specially selected to complete special missions. No one will yield!”","“Oh... Therefore, you are indeed here on a special mission and are not ordinary soldiers...” Huang Yueli was deep in thought.","“I...”","Only then did Captain Xuan realize that he had been tricked. He choked and his face turned red. He quickly shut his mouth.","Following that, no matter what Huang Yueli said to him, he didn’t reply and made up his mind to play dead.","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly and she could only directly reveal her and Li Moying’s identities.","“Alright, don’t be like this. I didn’t do anything to you...I already said that my husband and I are both from the God Race!”","Captain Xuan had suffered a loss just now, so he didn’t even look at her now.","Completely ignored.","Huang Yueli didn’t take it seriously as she continued,” My husband and I are considered famous people in the Twelve Continents. You might have heard of our names. I am Huang Yueli from the Sacred Phoenix Race and my husband...It was Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Young Lord Li Moying! The two of us left the Sacred Phoenix Continent some time ago and planned to go out to train. In the end, we heard that You ‘an City was attacked on the way, so we mixed into the demon army...”","As Huang Yueli spoke, she took off a human skin mask which was used to disguise her face, revealing her beautiful face which was covered by the mask.","Li Moying frowned as he coughed heavily,” What are you all looking at?”","Captain Xuan was also stunned, but after he woke up, he still had a stubborn expression on his face.","“Hehe, your Demon Race is quite well-informed. You even found out about Patriarch Huang and Young Lord Li secretly eloping despite the opposition of the family! Unfortunately... You still can’t fool me. That’s right, according to the legends, Patriarch Huang is indeed a peerless beauty. However, do you think I don’t know that demons above the Heavenly Demon Realm are also very outstanding in appearance! Besides, it’s not like demons don’t know how to disguise themselves!”","This time Huang Yueli was really speechless.","In this day and age, people would believe a lie, but no one would believe the truth!","After the Divine Realm’s Martial Competition, she and Li Moying were already famous people in the twelve continents of the Celestial Race. The various great Celestial Race’s genius practitioners had practically all seen them during the Martial Competition.","Usually, she didn’t disguise herself and didn’t even dare to go out. She would be recognized by passersby at any time.","However, she neglected that these genius martial artists in the alliance army did not participate in the Divine Realm Martial Competition because they had military orders. Hence, they did not recognize the two of them at all!","She narrowed her eyes slightly,” Then what do you need to do to make you believe that I’m Huang Yueli?”"]},{"number":4446,"title":"Chapter 4446 Is She a Devil?(6)","paragraphs":["4446 Is She a Devil?(6)","Captain Xuan was slightly stunned before he sneered.” I won’t believe anything you say, unless...”","“Unless...” Captain Xuan choked on his words as he couldn’t think of a way to get Huang Yueli to prove it.","Just as Huang Yueli was about to lose her patience, he suddenly slapped his head,” I got it, I’ve thought of it!”","“I’ve heard from others that the Sacred Phoenix Race’s new Clan Leader Huang Yueli is not only a god grade genius, but she has also contracted a powerful ancient phoenix! If you can summon a phoenix, I’ll believe you!”","“Huh? Phoenix?”","Hearing this, it was Huang Yueli’s turn to be dumbfounded.","Captain Xuan saw her reaction and thought that he had successfully exposed her scheme. He immediately sneered.","“What’s wrong? Didn’t you say that you were Huang Yueli? Then why is your expression like this? You can’t pretend anymore, can you? How dare he call himself Patriarch Huang!","Haha! Let me tell you, Patriarch Huang is the most outstanding genius of our Shen clan, the future hope of the Shen clan. A trash like you still wants to impersonate her? Why don’t you look at yourself in the mirror and see what kind of person you are? Ridiculous!”","Huang Yueli was choked speechless.","She didn’t even need to look in the mirror to know what she looked like.","Of course, she was smart and beautiful!","But the problem was, where could she summon the phoenix now? Little Wang Cai was no longer the artifact spirit of the Sky Phoenix Ring and already had a new corporeal body.","Under normal circumstances, contracted magical beasts could not be too far away from their master. Once they exceeded a certain range, they could not be summoned.","Right now, Little Wang Cai was already far enough in the Perched Phoenix Canyon...","Captain Xuan looked at her mockingly.” How is it? You have nothing to say, right? You demons are really simple-minded. You still want to deceive me?”","Huang Yueli frowned,” This really won’t do. My family’s Little Phoenix is currently in closed door cultivation and can’t be summoned. Change your request!”","“What closed-door training? Are you kidding me?” Captain Xuan sneered. I only have one request. If you can’t complete it, then don’t lie to me. Hurry up and get lost...”","“Phoenix didn’t, but...If I summon my divine beast Qilin, can it also prove our identities?”","Not waiting for Captain Xuan to finish his sentence, Li Moying cut in and spoke unhurriedly.","Li Moying’s lips lifted slightly,” What? Since you know that Huang Yueli has contracted a Divine Phoenix Beast, don’t you know that I have also contracted a Qilin?”","Captain Xuan stammered,” Y-y-you...Are you serious?”","Li Moying replied coldly,” Time is tight. I don’t have time to joke around with you guys.”","After he finished speaking, he didn’t wait for the alliance army soldiers to say anything and made a hand seal.","Purple-blue lightning energy flickered in the air, emitting a weak light.","After a few breaths, the tent flap was lifted, and a five or six-year-old girl with two braids came in.","She blinked her big bright eyes and curiously sized up the soldiers of the alliance army for a while, then revealed a look of disdain.","Turning towards Li Moying and Huang Yueli, her eyes suddenly lit up,” Master, Little Older Sister, are you looking for me? I just sprinkled the sleeping powder that the little sister gave me in every tent nearby. They were all fast asleep and no one noticed me! Am I very smart?”"]},{"number":4447,"title":"Chapter 4447 Cooperate from the inside and outside (1)","paragraphs":["4447 Cooperate from the inside and outside (1)","When Huang Yueli saw the purple jade, she couldn’t help but curl her lips.","This little mouth was so sweet, calling her “little sister” every time!","On the other hand, Wang Cai called her ‘she-devil’ when it saw her. It really didn’t know any manners.","Huang Yueli patted Ziyu’s little head and smiled: ” You’re indeed very smart! Moying called you over because he wanted you to help us with something.”","“What favor?” Ziyu tilted her head curiously.","Huang Yueli explained: ” These few people don’t believe in my and Moying’s identity so they want us to provide proof. Recover your original body and show them.”","Ziyu pouted and was a little unhappy.” Is my original body something these people can see?”","“Just do us a favor. Hurry up and go!” Huang Yueli urged.","“Wait, what do you mean?” Captain Xuan asked subconsciously. Are you trying to tell me that this little girl is actually an ancient Qilin? What a joke. Although I’ve never seen a Divine Beast with my own eyes, I’ve read about it in the family’s ancient records. Which Ancient Divine Beast isn’t majestic and extraordinary? How could it be such a cute little girl? I...”","Captain Xuan’s voice stopped abruptly.","He widened his eyes and stared straight ahead, his jaw almost falling to the ground.","Purple Jade obediently took a few steps back. Her figure flashed, and a purple lightning flashed, so dazzling that the people in the tent could not open their eyes.","After a few breaths, the light faded, and the sweet and lovely little girl disappeared. In her place was a gorgeous divine beast that emitted powerful spiritual power.","The sharp claws, the blade-like scales wrapped in lightning, and the sharp purple pupils...It was exactly the same as the ancient Qilin recorded in the secret manual!","“This... This...”","Captain Xuan couldn’t even speak. The shock in his heart was incomparable.","For a moment, he thought he was dreaming!","Ancient divine beasts were very rare now. 99% of the god clans had never seen a divine beast in their entire lives, but he had actually seen one here with his own eyes!","Ziyu waited for a while. Seeing that Captain Xuan and the others would only stare at her, she immediately became impatient and waved her claws.","The pressure that she exuded was extremely strong, even stronger than the Profound Energy pressure that Li Moying had intentionally released earlier.","Purple Jade turned her head and looked at Huang Yueli,” Little Older Sister, is this alright?”","Although the surroundings of the tent had already been sealed by her and Li Moying’s spiritual perception and the devils in the temporary campsite weren’t strong so the possibility of breaking through their blockade was extremely low.","However, the Heaven and Earth Dark Force fluctuation caused by the original body of the Divine Beast was too huge. She was still worried that it would attract the attention of others.","After all, they were at the front line, so it was better to be careful.","When Ziyu heard this, she cheered. With a flash of purple light, she turned into a cute little girl again.","She turned her head and looked at Captain Xuan in disdain.” You actually dare to doubt the identity of my master and sister? Are you blind? You’re not even worthy of carrying their shoes!”","With that, the little girl ran out.","The soldiers of the alliance army were left standing there in confusion.","Huang Yueli replied indifferently,”How is it? Now... Do you have any questions?”","Captain Xuan and the others looked at each other. In the next moment, they suddenly knelt on the ground.","“See...Greetings to Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li!”"]},{"number":4448,"title":"Chapter 4448 Cooperate from the inside and outside (2)","paragraphs":["4448 Cooperate from the inside and outside (2)","The soldiers of the alliance army kneeled very quickly.","Because they didn’t kneel on their own accord, but because their legs were really weak, they knelt down.","What kind of identity did the ancient god clan’s clan leader and young clan leader have? In the entire Divine Realm, he stood on the clouds, the highest existence.","Other than a few hidden Life Profound Realm experts, no one else could surpass them.","For ordinary god clans, most people would never have the chance to see their clan leaders in their lifetime.","Moreover, many of these soldiers were not even ancient gods but ordinary humans.","It was even more unimaginable for them to see the clan leader of the Shen clan with their own eyes.","After seeing Zi Yu reveal her Qilin True Body, they no longer had any doubts about Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s identity and what replaced it was full of fear and frustration.","Offending such a noble existence was no laughing matter!","If he was not careful, he would die on the spot.","At this moment, what everyone couldn’t figure out the most was, didn’t Huang Yueli and Li Moying go sightseeing together? Why did he run over to the demons for no reason?","Huang Yueli looked at everyone’s shivering looks and felt a little helpless.","“Alright, get up. There’s no need to be so afraid. My husband and I have always hidden our names among the demons. It’s normal that you can’t recognize us. It’s fine as long as the misunderstanding is explained.”","She was not an unreasonable person.","Although the stubbornness of these soldiers made her speechless, from another perspective, being cautious was also a good thing.","If he encountered a real demon, he would not be so easily deceived.","Initially the allied army soldiers didn’t dare to stand up but after hesitating for a moment, they realised that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s expressions were indeed calm and they didn’t have any intention of blaming them so they carefully stood up and stood respectfully at the side.","Huang Yueli looked at Captain Xuan,” What’s your name? What is your position in the alliance army?”","” I’m Xuan Chaoyi,” the captain said respectfully.” I’m from the Black Tortoise Tribe. I’m currently one of the Divine Guards under You ‘an City.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” If I’m not wrong, you guys took the risk to venture deep into the territory controlled by the devil race, so you must have received the order from the alliance army right? However, I don’t understand. With your combat strength, wouldn’t it be disastrous for you to enter the rear of the frontline? What kind of mission do you need to carry out?”","Originally, Huang Yueli didn’t want to take the risk of being seen through by the devil race to meet with these allied soldiers.","However, these questions lingered in her heart for a long time, but she could not find the answer.","The overall strength of this team was not bad, but there were not many people, and there were no truly top-notch experts. It was obviously unrealistic to rely on a team like theirs to launch a sneak attack on a demon camp guarded by a late-stage Skyfiend expert.","Therefore, they must have other missions.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s question, Captain Xuan’s face revealed a hesitant look,” This...Patriarch Huang, you’re right. We received the order from the alliance army to carry out a top-secret mission. Before we set off, we swore to the Mystic Divine General that we would never reveal a single word to anyone!”","Huang Yueli narrowed her eyes,” The Mystic Divine General you mentioned, are you referring to Xuan Jiuling?”","Seeing Captain Xuan nod his head, she turned around and exchanged a glance with Li Moying.","When the two of them had just arrived in the Divine World, they had met Xuan Jiuling once in You An City."]},{"number":4449,"title":"Chapter 4449 Cooperate from the inside and outside (3)","paragraphs":["4449 Cooperate from the inside and outside (3)","The two of them had a good impression of this powerful and prestigious Divine General.","However, Xuan Jiuling had only come to You ‘an City to patrol, not to stay here permanently.","Under normal circumstances, there was no need to use a god to guard a town.","Now that Xuan Jiuling was personally commanding the battle and had even sent a team out to carry out a mission, it must be because Rui Jiang had personally come to the front line. This line of defense in You ‘an City was already very tight...","Xuan Chaoyi didn’t know that Huang Yueli had already analyzed so much from his few sentences.","Seeing her dark expression, he felt a little uneasy.","“Patriarch Huang, it is not that this subordinate is deliberately hiding this matter. I really have no choice...”","” I know you need to keep it a secret,” Huang Yueli interrupted him,” But as a person, you must know how to be flexible, understand? The current situation is already very clear. With your abilities, it will be very difficult for you to even survive in the territory of the demon race. If you don’t tell me the details, you won’t be able to complete the mission!”","“This...”","Xuan Chaoyi choked and looked troubled.","Because Huang Yueli’s words were simple and crude, not beating around the bush at all, directly hitting the core of the problem.","When they left You An City, they were escorted by the alliance army and sneaked into the demon territory. They were full of confidence.","Who knew that they had just separated from the main group and in less than a day, they were discovered by the demon army and attacked.","That battle was very tragic, and the number of people in the team was halved on the spot.","The remaining people barely managed to escape under the cover of their teammates ‘self-destruction.","However, before the survivors could breathe a sigh of relief, they were targeted by another demon team.","This time around, if it wasn’t for Huang Yueli and Li Moying who suddenly appeared, they would definitely have been completely annihilated.","At this point, Xuan Chaoyi no longer had any hope of completing the mission.","Unless he could obtain the help of these two Divine level geniuses before him...","Xuan Chaoyi was still hesitating, but the teammates behind him had already reached a consensus through eye contact.","“Captain, we can’t go all the way to the end!” Telling the Huang Clan Leader and the others about this matter is also a stopgap measure. We have no choice.”","“That’s right, what are the identities of Patriarch Huang and Young Master Li? With their status, even if they went to the Mystic Divine General personally, the Mystic Divine General would still inform them of the mission’s situation. Therefore, you can’t be considered an outsider...”","“Completing the mission is the most important thing. This is the only path we have left...”","Under everyone’s persuasion, Xuan Chaoyi gritted his teeth.” Alright, there’s no other way now. I’ll go back and ask Divine General Xuan for forgiveness after the mission is completed!”","Huang Yueli smiled,” You don’t have to worry, I will naturally plead for mercy on your behalf.”","” Thank you.” Xuan Chaoyi hurriedly thanked him. Then, he thought for a while and said,” Judging from the looks of Patriarch Huang and Master Li, you guys probably don’t know about the situation at the front line of You ‘an City, right?”","Huang Yueli was startled,” We’ve indeed been wandering outside and we’re not clear about the battle situation. What the... Is the situation at the front line very critical?”","Xuan Chaoyi sighed heavily.” That’s right. The demons have been attacking Youan City since more than ten days ago. Every winter, when the demons run out of resources and food, they would launch a wave of attacks. We were already used to it and thought that it would be the same this year. Therefore, they only set up defenses like in previous years. Who knew that we were so wrong!”"]},{"number":4450,"title":"Chapter 4450 Cooperate from the inside and outside (4)","paragraphs":["4450 Cooperate from the inside and outside (4)","Huang Yueli raised her brows and indicated for Xuan Chaoyi to continue.","“In the past, although the demons sent a large number of troops, they weren’t very strong. Their goal wasn’t to conquer You ‘an City, but to snatch our food and resources. Therefore, they would usually run away after stealing a wave and would not even take the initiative to fight with the alliance army. Therefore, our defense is usually just a formality.”","“However, this year, our army went to expel the demons as usual, but they were unexpectedly attacked by the demons! The first batch of troops that went to fight were completely wiped out. Not a single one survived!”","“What? How did this happen?” Huang Yueli was shocked.","” We didn’t know the reason at first,” Xuan Chaoyi said.” We only thought that we underestimated our enemy and caused the tragedy.” “Therefore, the second batch of troops chosen to fight is one of the most elite troops in Youan City. Before they set off, the City Lord carefully explained the strategy and told them to end the battle as quickly as possible, but in the end...”","At this point, Xuan Chaoyi suddenly stopped and took a deep breath.” In the end, the second batch of troops was still annihilated! The leader of the Divine Guard is my good friend. We’ve been stationed in You ‘an City together for three years.”","” Before he left, he was full of confidence, thinking that he had obtained the best opportunity to make contributions. He even thought that he would have enough military merits after this mission to exchange for a new set of superior-grade spiritual weapons. Who knew that the result would be like this...”","Huang Yueli’s brows creased slightly as she was extremely astonished in her heart.","She had stayed in the allied army camp before, so she had some understanding of the strength of the allied army.","Although their individual combat strength was not as good as the demons, the weapons and armor used by the allied forces were several levels higher than those of the demons. They were also very good at using various formations to cooperate in battle. Overall, they were stronger than the demons.","How could they be completely wiped out despite careful preparations?","Moreover, the location of the battle was near You ‘an City, in the territory controlled by the God Race!","“In that case, the demons must have some means that we don’t know about.” Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and guessed,” Either there are too many top notch experts from the devil race, or...” What powerful divine artifact did they obtain that can be used for group attacks...”","This time, it was Xuan Chaoyi and the other soldiers who were shocked.","Each and every one of them stared at Huang Yueli as their faces were filled with surprise.","” Patriarch Huang, you’re really amazing. You can even guess this!”","Huang Yueli raised her brows,” What? It wasn’t hard to guess. The leader of the demons, Pill Light Region’s Lord Rui Jiang, is a late-stage Skyfiend expert. Demons at this level rarely fight personally, so it’s normal that you can’t resist. However...Why didn’t the alliance army send anyone to help you?”","Hearing this, Xuan Chaoyi frowned again with a worried expression and sighed deeply.","“Of course the alliance headquarters sent someone over. Our Black Tortoise Clan’s Elder, Xuan Jiuling, is not stationed in You ‘an City. This time, because Rui Jiang personally led the army to attack the city, the situation in the city was critical, so the headquarters sent him over.”","So, what happened after Divine General Xuan arrived at You ‘an City?” Huang Yueli asked thoughtfully."]},{"number":4451,"title":"Chapter 4451 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (1)","paragraphs":["4451 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (1)","“What is it? How did this happen?”","Although they had already guessed it from Xuan Chaoyi’s words, they were still shocked to hear such a situation.","Xuan Jiuling was a very famous expert in the 12 continents of the Shen clan. Not only could he enter the top 20 of the Heaven roll with his own strength, but he was also famous for his ability to lead troops in battle.","This was the experience that he had accumulated over a hundred years from commanding battles in the alliance army. Even peerless geniuses like Huang Yueli and Li Moying could only admit defeat in this aspect.","Xuan Jiuling had personally come out and actually ended up in a miserable defeat?","Was the demon army really that powerful?","Huang Yueli was stunned,”This...” Was there an unexpected factor? My husband and I have just come from the territory of the Demon Race. I can see that the Demon Race soldiers are no different from before in terms of combat strength and morale...”","” That’s right, Patriarch Huang, you guessed right.”","Xuan Chaoyi nodded and paused for a moment, as if he was thinking about how to explain.","“The exact situation of the battle... I didn’t see it with my own eyes, so I’m not very sure. However, five days ago, when Divine General Xuan gathered us together, he mentioned the situation at that time.”","“It’s said that when the two armies were fighting, the demon army suddenly shot out a golden light. Under the cover of the light, the strength of all the demon soldiers suddenly soared, at least two small realms higher. Originally, our alliance army still had the advantage. In the end, in the blink of an eye, the situation has reversed...”","Xuan Chaoyi explained the situation.","Huang Yueli gradually calmed down as she pondered for a while before replying: ” In that case, the Devil Race seems to have obtained an ancient secret treasure with boundless might. Furthermore, the might of this secret treasure has even surpassed ordinary life bound magical treasures!”","A life-bound magic artifact was the highest grade spirit artifact in the Divine Realm.","Only a Profound Life Realm expert could refine it, and they could only refine one in their lifetime.","Naturally, the life-bound magical equipment refined by the original owner was the most compatible and powerful. However, the magical equipment left behind by a Profound Life Realm expert after his death was much weaker. Even the original owner would find it difficult to unleash fifty percent of his strength.","Moreover, most Profound Life Realm experts had gone through a fierce battle before they died, and their magic tools were more or less damaged. With these two factors added together, the power of the magic tools was not as heaven-defying as imagined.","Huang Yueli originally didn’t know much about magic tools but after seeing quite a number of them in the Phoenix Clan’s treasure vault, she had gained some knowledge.","“I wonder what kind of expert can refine such a magic tool...”","Xuan Chaoyi hurriedly nodded.” That’s right! The Mystic Divine General had also guessed so. Patriarch Huang, you are indeed the leader of a clan. You are indeed knowledgeable! Divine General Xuan sent us here because he wanted us to inquire about this artifact from the Demon Race. At the very least, we have to figure out what kind of treasure this is.”","Xuan Chaoyi could hear the hidden meaning in her words.” Patriarch Huang, you...” Do you know something?”"]},{"number":4452,"title":"Chapter 4452 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (2)","paragraphs":["4452 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (2)","Xuan Chaoyi stared blankly at Huang Yueli, unable to say a word.","In terms of experience, he didn’t think that Huang Yueli could surpass a veteran powerhouse like Xuan Jiuling.","After all, Huang Yueli’s age was displayed here.","No matter what, he was just a young man who was not even twenty years old. In the Divine Realm, many girls of this age in the big families had never even left their families!","But now, she was so calm and collected, saying something that even Xuan Jiuling couldn’t figure out.","Huang Yueli didn’t notice the gazes of the allied army soldiers and after guessing, she turned around to look at Li Moying who was behind her.","“Husband, what do you think?”","Li Moying’s gaze had been focused on her face,” I’ve also heard that in ancient times, some powerful Life Profound Realm Array Masters would spend all their efforts to arrange a huge array with boundless power and seal it onto a jade board when their life was about to end. This is the so-called array talisman, but...”","He paused for a moment and frowned.” However, I heard that this talisman can only be used three times at most. Therefore, although many large factions have such array talismans in their collections, they will definitely not use them unless they are in a critical moment of life and death.”","“The secret treasure in Rui Jiang’s hand has already been used at least three times in a row, and it was in an unimportant battle. This... It didn’t sound logical...Perhaps it isn’t the formation talisman you’re guessing, but some other secret treasure.”","Li Moying pondered for a moment and slowly opened his mouth.","Huang Yueli shook her head,” No, I feel that the possibility of it being an array talisman is higher. First of all, this artifact can greatly increase the strength of so many people. This kind of group enhancement type artifact is very rare. Other than the array talisman, the other artifacts are very large and very eye-catching on the battlefield. It is impossible for the Mysterious Divine General to fight with the other party without seeing the artifact with his own eyes.”","“As for what you said...There were two possibilities. One was that the fiend race didn’t understand spirit tools and didn’t know that the formation talisman could only be used three times, so once they got it, they directly squandered all the uses. If that’s really the case, then we’ll save some trouble. Next time, we can just directly attack the demon army. Without the support of the formation talisman, Auspicious River shouldn’t be a match for Divine General Xuan.”","Li Moying nodded slightly,” You’re right, what about the other possibility?”","“The other possibility is that the talisman in the Demon Race’s hands has already broken through the usage limit...This is not impossible. If the refiner’s strength is strong enough to withstand the backlash of the heavenly tribulation, there is still a chance to successfully refine it.”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s words, Xuan Chaoyi and the rest who had been standing at the side silently couldn’t help but mutter in their hearts.","An artifact that could be used three times was already a life-bound magic artifact!","Then what kind of terrifying level would a talisman that could be used indefinitely be?","They didn’t even dare to think about it!","But when it came out from Huang Yueli’s mouth, it seemed so light...","Obviously, the second possibility did not exist!"]},{"number":4453,"title":"Chapter 4453 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (3)","paragraphs":["4453 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (3)","Xuan Chaoyi couldn’t hold it in any longer. He couldn’t care less about his low status in front of Huang Yueli as he couldn’t help but say: ” Clan Leader Huang, this...” How was this possible? I really don’t understand...”","In order to boost the morale of the soldiers of the alliance army, the demons were often described as savages who ate raw meat and drank blood during the propaganda of the alliance army. It was even said that although they were born with extremely high talent, they had some problems in terms of intelligence, so it was difficult for them to make any achievements in special skills such as spiritual weapons and spiritual medicines.","When Huang Yueli had just arrived in the Divine Realm, she had also had this misconception.","However, after entering deep into the demon territory, she realized that her previous view was wrong.","The Devil race was unable to refine overly profound Spirit Weapons. It was probably because of the Devil Qi contained within their bodies. Devil Qi was more violent than Celestial Chi and was difficult to control. When refining weapons, one needed to precisely control every trace of power. This was too difficult for them.","Xuan Chaoyi and the others looked at each other, their eyes still filled with doubt.","But due to Huang Yueli’s status, they didn’t dare to say anything more and could only lower their heads in silence.","But they didn’t expect that Huang Yueli’s following words immediately made their jaws almost drop to the ground.","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and turned to look at Li Moying beside her,” Husband...”","Her large watery eyes flashed twice and before she could finish her sentence, Li Moying had already guessed her intentions as his brows furrowed.","“No, this is too dangerous!” He refused.","Huang Yueli’s small face puffed up as she said unhappily: ” You didn’t even listen to what I said and you said no?”","Li Moying glanced at her indifferently,” How can I not guess what you want to do? Don’t you just want to go to the demon camp and get this talisman from Rui Jiang? You should know that Rui Jiang is a peak late-stage Skyfiend expert. The two of us combined can barely deal with him. Now, he still has the array talisman to increase his strength...It’s too risky!”","Seeing that he had guessed it, Huang Yueli’s shoulders slumped but she immediately puffed out her chest and argued with reason.","“Of course I know that this will be a little dangerous. “However, we came out this time to seek a breakthrough in the first place. It’s a rare opportunity for us to fight with a strong expert like Rui Jiang! Moreover, that talisman...If it’s really as I guessed, it’ll be of great use to me!”","Li Moying naturally understood Huang Yueli’s meaning.","Geniuses of their level might not even care about the little bit of strength that the array talisman itself increased.","However, if he could study it carefully, he might be able to develop a special refining technique for the array talisman, thereby extending the lifespan of all spiritual weapons.","Moreover, Youan City was in a critical situation.","As members of the Shen clan, it was fine if they did not know. Since they knew, it was impossible for them not to interfere.","Huang Yueli stood on her tiptoes and gave him a peck on the cheek,” Husband, I knew you’re the best!”"]},{"number":4454,"title":"Chapter 4454 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (4)","paragraphs":["4454 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (4)","Huang Yueli easily convinced her husband and the two of them quickly came to a conclusion.","When did they say that they wanted to get the secret treasure from Ruijiang?","Seeing Huang Yueli and Li Moying getting more and more excited as they talked, Xuan Chaoyi couldn’t hold it in any longer as he opened his mouth weakly,” That...” Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li...”","“What’s wrong?” Huang Yueli turned around and looked over.","Xuan Chaoyi braced himself and said,”Patriarch Huang, we...” The order we received was to find out exactly what the secret treasure in Ruijiang’s hands is, and then try to understand as much as possible about it. Divine General Xuan did not ask us to bring the secret treasure back...”","Huang Yueli didn’t mind as she casually waved her hand,” I know, but if I can bring the secret treasure back and conveniently resolve the Sky Devil Ruijiang, wouldn’t that be a great merit?”","“But, but...” Xuan Chaoyi was tongue-tied.","He had totally not expected that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s guts were actually so big!","It was fine if they wanted to steal the array talisman, but from her tone, she actually wanted to kill Sky Devil Ruijiang!","This... Wasn’t this too ridiculous?","Young people were just not steady enough and underestimated their enemies!","The Devil Clan’s combat power was much stronger than the God Clans. A peak late stage Sky Devil was already infinitely close to a Profound Life Realm expert.","They still wanted to kill him? How was this possible?","Xuan Chaoyi originally didn’t dare to speak carelessly but he was afraid that Huang Yueli and the rest would really send themselves to their deaths so after thinking about it, he decided to risk his life to speak up.","“Patriarch Huang, this won’t do! Even if we wanted to kill Sky Devil Ruijiang, that would have to wait for the reinforcements from the Allied Army to arrive. Our small team doesn’t even have a Dao Profound Realm powerhouse. Being scouts was already somewhat forceful, let alone...Not to mention assassinating and searching for secret treasures. I think that we should sneak into the camp and leave as soon as possible after hearing the news...”","Xuan Chaoyi had always been known for his steadfastness. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been chosen by Xuan Jiuling and entrusted with such an important task.","His words could be said to be sincere.","Unfortunately, Huang Yueli and Li Moying totally didn’t take it seriously.","“Well, we really don’t have Dao Profound Realm cultivator. But wouldn’t it be useful if my husband and I joined? You can rest assured that even if the assassination fails, my husband and I will have a way to escape safely.”","She and Li Moying had just obtained so many Holy Armaments from the Phoenix Clan’s treasure vault and their abilities had increased by leaps and bounds.","“But...” Xuan Chaoyi and the others felt like their heads were about to explode.","This could not be said to be courage. This was simply brainless!","Even if the two of them were the most outstanding peerless geniuses of the younger generation, they were still not enough in front of a top-notch expert like Ruijiang. Ruijiang could probably crush them with a finger!","Huang Yueli seemed to have seen through his thoughts as she continued,” Don’t worry, I won’t let you guys do anything dangerous. All you need to do is to cooperate with us and provide some cover. If anyone were to die, it will definitely be us who dies. You guys will have enough time to return and report back.”","Xuan Chaoyi wanted to cry.","Was he afraid of death?","He was afraid that Huang Yueli and Li Moying would die!","If they died, the consequences would be more serious than if he died himself!"]},{"number":4455,"title":"Chapter 4455 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (5)","paragraphs":["4455 Secret Treasure Talisman Array (5)","At this moment, he was deeply regretting telling Huang Yueli and the rest the details of his mission.","It was impossible for the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan to let him off!","” Patriarch Huang, Young Master Li, please think twice. Don’t be rash...”","He still wanted to put up a final struggle as he tried his best to persuade her but unfortunately, Huang Yueli and the rest had already made up their minds and ignored his feeble protest.","Li Moying looked at the sky outside and said in a low voice,”Little Li’er, it’s getting late. We should leave.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” Alright, then it’s settled. My husband and I will lead the team into Ruijiang’s campsite tomorrow, and you guys... If you are unwilling to follow, I can find an opportunity to let you go...”","“No, no, no. We naturally have to follow you two esteemed ones!” Xuan Chaoyi said hurriedly.","What a joke, if they were to go back like this, if something really happened to Huang Yueli and Li Moying, how was he going to explain to Divine General Xuan and the rest?","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she felt a little helpless.","Although she had already tried her best to ensure that there was no danger and wanted Xuan Chaoyi and the rest to be at ease, but these people clearly didn’t trust her and Li Moying’s abilities.","There was no other way. She could only rely on facts to prove it in future battles.","However, it was a good thing that they were willing to stay by her side.","It was not that she needed these people to do things for her. In fact, Xuan Chaoyi and the others were basically of no help to her.","But if these people wanted to leave the Devil Territory by themselves, it would be extremely dangerous so it would be safer for them to follow her and Li Moying.","Huang Yueli nodded slightly,” Alright, then you guys continue to follow the devil army and wait for my orders.”","After she finished speaking, she left with Li Moying.","Not long after, the sky gradually brightened.","The Devil soldiers who were knocked out by the Little Qilin gradually woke up.","Although many people wondered why they suddenly fell into such a deep sleep, they were afraid of being punished by their superiors, so they did not dare to take the initiative to say it.","Huang Yueli was also happy to pretend that she didn’t know anything as she passed down the order and the team set off immediately.","Other things aside, the acting skills of these allied soldiers were pretty good!","The two of them carried the identity tokens issued by Vermillion Light Collet with them. After being verified by the guards at the entrance of the camp, they were led to the camp area.","“You two are new faces, right? To be able to sit in the captain’s position as soon as you arrived, it seemed that your strength was not bad. However, our military camp has its own rules. No matter how strong you are, you have to abide by the rules. Otherwise...”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she took out a few crystal jades from her space and stuffed them into the hands of the Devil Clan’s captain who was guiding them.","“We have just arrived and don’t know anything. We will need this Brother’s guidance...”","Although the Crystal Jade of the Twelve Continents of the Divine World was not the common currency of the Devil Race, the energy inside could be extracted for cultivation. It was also considered a rare item.","The Devil Clan’s captain nodded in satisfaction and left with his men after giving them a few instructions."]},{"number":4456,"title":"Chapter 4456 Meritorious service (1)","paragraphs":["4456 Meritorious service (1)","Xuan Chaoyi and the rest were the captives that Huang Yueli had brought back and were brought to the place where the captives were kept and kept in custody.","Because these Allied Army soldiers had already taken the healing medicine that she had distributed to them, the injuries on their bodies had almost recovered by half. At the same time, Huang Yueli had also given them some spirit tools so that they could be used at the critical moment.","Armed with these spiritual weapons, the strength of Xuan Chaoyi and the others had already surpassed most of the Devils in the military camp.","However, according to Huang Yueli’s orders, they would temporarily endure and hide in the prisoner of war camp to contact the other prisoners of war while waiting for Huang Yueli’s further instructions.","“Alright, we’ve finally sent them away. Little Li’er, what should we do next? Do you have any ideas?”","There was no one around as Li Moying leaned back on the chair, quietly looking at the young lady in front of him.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes,” Up till now, everything is going smoothly. Since we’ve successfully infiltrated the Devil camp, we’ll follow what we’ve discussed at the beginning and investigate step by step. First, we’ll find clues about that Secret Treasure Talisman Array and figure out where Ruijiang hid it.”","Li Moying nodded his head,” Alright, but this way, we can only act at night for the time being.”","After entering the Devil Army, they discovered that the internal management of the Devil Army was not as loose as they had imagined.","Although the Devils didn’t have a complete system like the Allied Army, the system they had in place was simple and crude.","The superior did not even need to give a reason to cut off the head of the subordinate.","In just two hours since they entered the camp and settled down, they had already witnessed several bloody incidents.","With their strength, no one in the camp could hurt them except Ruijiang.","However, once there was a dispute, it was still easy to expose their identity and ruin the plan.","Therefore, they decided to keep a low profile.","However, plans could never keep up with changes. Just as the two of them finished their discussion, they heard a series of anxious footsteps coming from outside the tent.","“Squad Seven, Squad Eight! Come out and gather, quickly! Advance and prepare for battle! Those bastards from the Allied Army are attacking the camp again!”","Huang Yueli was startled as she turned her head and exchanged a glance with Li Moying.","It couldn’t be such a coincidence, right?","They had just arrived and had yet to find out anything, yet they were already going to fight with their own people...","However, there was no time for them to think about it.","The two of them did not want to appear too special, so they could only leave the tent in a hurry. They gathered the Devil soldiers under them and rushed to the gathering point as soon as possible.","“It took a whole fifteen minutes to gather. Are you all eating sh * t? If it wasn’t for the fact that Lord Ruijiang needed you to go out and fight, I would have cut off your heads and kicked them like balls!”","Their immediate superior was a dark-skinned Devil Deputy General. As soon as he saw them, he scolded them.","Huang Yueli’s expression did not change as she pretended to be terrified,” Apologies Sir, we just arrived at the military camp today so we don’t know the rules...”","“Ignoring the rules can be used as an excuse? When we go to the front line later, each of you must kill at least two members of the Allied Army. Chop off their fingers as a token and if you can’t do it, kill them immediately! Lord Ruijiang’s camp doesn’t need trash, nor does it raise trash! Did you hear me clearly?”","Seeing that her attitude was not bad, the Devil Deputy General’s expression relaxed slightly and let her go for the time being. He turned around and began to lecture loudly.","“Especially the squad leaders, each of you is to kill at least five of the Allied Armies! If you lose one, your heads will explode!”","The Devil soldiers all responded excitedly. Clearly, such a kind of request was very common in the Devil camp.","However, Huang Yueli and Li Moying were secretly conflicted.","No way!","Were they really going to kill the Allied Army?","He even wanted to chop off their fingers as tokens..."]},{"number":4457,"title":"Chapter 4457 Meritorious service (2)","paragraphs":["4457 Meritorious service (2)","This was awkward.","However, if they were acting in secret, where would they get the fingers?","While the two of them were deeply contemplating this issue, the Deputy General of the Devil Clan had already impatiently commanded everyone to set off for the battlefield.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying could only follow.","As they walked, they were thinking hard on their next round of actions.","They did not expect that they would encounter trouble before they had the time to investigate.","No matter what, they had to shut this person up first...","The Devil soldiers were all very excited. They felt that their chance to kill the enemy had arrived, especially those veterans who had already experienced several battles. They did not put the Allied Armies in their eyes at all.","“That’s great. Those Ancient God Clan bastards are here to die again! They’re really not afraid of death. They’re here to give us battle credits again, hahahaha!”","“That’s right. Isn’t this credit too easy to earn? I killed three humans by myself last time!”","“Bah, there are only three, and you have the nerve to show off? I killed five of them!”","“Six for me!”","The Devil soldiers reported their battle achievements one after another and began to compare.","The new recruits who came with Huang Yueli were all exceptionally excited but Huang Yueli and Li Moying couldn’t help but frown.","Just by listening to what these ordinary soldiers said, one could estimate that Blessed City’s Allied Army had suffered heavy casualties.","At this rate, it was only a matter of time before Blessed City was breached.","Once Blessed City fell, not only would the people living in the city suffer, but the entire Empyrean Fox Continent would be in danger.","It seemed that they had to hurry up.","“All of you listen up. When the battle starts later, no one is allowed to leave the team. Do you see that big flag in front? That is the flag of our Lord Ruijiang. Lord Ruijiang has strictly ordered that if anyone dares to act without permission, they must be killed immediately if they are within a ten-mile radius of the flag!”","The Deputy General pointed at the flag in front of him and ordered loudly.","The ordinary Devil soldiers were still muttering, complaining that the military orders were getting stricter and stricter, but they grunted that they understood immediately.","Thinking of this, a bold idea immediately surfaced in Huang Yueli’s heart!","The battlefield was so chaotic. Perhaps, they could take advantage of the chaos to find an opportunity to seize the Talisman Array...","However, this thought only flashed through her mind for a moment before she immediately rejected it.","On the battlefield, although Ruijiang definitely had the Talisman Array in his hands, this was definitely the time when he was the most cautious. This was precisely the most inappropriate time, unless they could kill Ruijiang on the spot while surrounded by so many Devil soldiers and snatch it forcefully...","However, if they had such strength, why would they still mingle in the the military camp?","Huang Yueli could only put her thoughts aside and continue to mix with her husband in the main devil army.","Before long, they reached the real front line. They could hear the sounds of fighting and weapons clashing.","Intense Profound Energy fluctuations filled the entire sky.","“It’s your turn. All of you, focus. Charge!”","The Deputy General gave the order, and most of the Devil soldiers rushed up at once to fight for the heads.","After all, the number of soldiers in the alliance was limited. Not everyone could complete the task of killing two enemies.","The others ran too fast so Huang Yueli and Li Moying who were still walking slowly were left behind, looking especially conspicuous.","The Devil Deputy General’s gaze fell on the two of them and he immediately frowned.” Hmm?”"]},{"number":4458,"title":"Chapter 4458 Meritorious service (3)","paragraphs":["4458 Meritorious service (3)","“Why are you two dawdling? Are you courting death by telling me that you aren’t gonna go? We don’t have trash like you in our army!”","The Deputy General glared at the two of them and gripped the scimitar in his hand tightly.” Hurry up and attack! Otherwise, I’ll kill you right now, do you hear me?”","Huang Yueli secretly pursed her lips as she hurriedly pulled her husband along and braced herself to speed up her pace, catching up with the group.","From the looks of it, it was impossible for them not to fight against the Allied Army.","The Devils in front were already brandishing their weapons and exchanging blows with the Allied Army.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying mixed in with the group, dodging the attacks of the Allied Army soldiers left and right with ease.","After all, in front of these ordinary soldiers, the two of them had an overwhelming advantage in strength. With just a little attention, they could be unharmed.","On the chaotic battlefield, the battle quickly reached its climax.","However, the two of them were basically unaffected as if they were taking a stroll on the battlefield. Instead, they spent a lot of time observing the situation around them.","It could be seen that the strength of the Devil Clan and the Allied Army was relatively close at this time. In fact, the Allied Army even had a considerable advantage.","Especially in the battlefield where they were, because the two of them were hiding in the dark and stabbing the Devils in the back from time to time, the defeat of the Devil army was very obvious.","“Damn it, you bunch of trash, charge! Ughh, why did he die again! Trash is ninety percent trash!”","The Devil Deputy General who had scolded them just now had been shouting and urging his subordinates to fight, but more and more Devils still died.","He could not understand why every time the situation was good and they were about to break through the Allied Army’s defense line, the few Devils with the strongest combat strength at the front would suddenly fail and be cut into seven or eight pieces by the Allied Army...","When the Allied Army’s front line was advancing, the Devil’s side was clearly very stable at the beginning, but in the end, they were inexplicably routed...","Unlucky, really unlucky!","How could his team be so unlucky today?","What was even worse was that after several tug-of-war battles, the Devils did not gain any advantage. The situation of the battle became one-sided.","The Allied Army was full of vigor as they shouted and charged into his camp.","“Charge, brothers, kill these Devils and drive them out of our territory!”","“Damn it, don’t retreat, don’t retreat! If anyone dares to take another step back, I’ll immediately cut them in half.”","Seeing this, the Deputy General of the Devil Clan immediately became anxious. In order to establish his might, he immediately fulfilled his threat and directly beheaded the few retreating Devils on the spot.","Boiling blood that was still warm from his body immediately sprayed out from his neck. The impact was very strong.","This scene indeed frightened many Devils.","In order to avoid being killed immediately, they had no choice but to hold on and use all their strength to resist, wanting to block the attack of the Allied Army.","However, it was all in vain.","Huang Yueli saw that they weren’t retreating so she quietly hid in the dark and attacked. Very quickly, she got rid of the strongest few devils in the team and didn’t even leave behind a single trace.","At the same time, she shouted,” It’s over, it’s over. There are so many Allied Armies! We can’t block it anymore! Everyone’s dead! We all... We won’t be able to survive!”","At this moment, it was taboo for someone to say something disheartening.","As soon as she said this, the morale of the Devils, who were already at a disadvantage, took another blow, and they retreated again and again.","“Damn it, don’t retreat! You guys are courting death!”","The Devil Deputy General stomped his feet in anger, but there was no good way to stop everyone from retreating.","Once the pessimistic mood spread in the army, the army would be defeated like a landslide. It would be useless to kill people to establish their prestige. After all, he could not kill all the deserters alone.","The corners of Huang Yueli’s mouth secretly curled up into a smile.","Although she couldn’t kill the Allied Army and chop off their fingers, she could fish in troubled waters.","As long as the Devils were defeated, no one would have the mood to count how many fingers she had cut off...","Seeing that her plan was about to succeed, Huang Yueli relaxed as she held her husband’s hand and lazily blended into the group.","However, at this moment, the livid Deputy General of the Devil Clan suddenly seemed to have sensed something. His eyes suddenly lit up and he shouted,” Don’t run around! Stop! We... We’re saved!”","Huang Yueli was puzzled as she frowned,” Husband, this fellow can’t be crazy right? What is he talking about?”","At this time, anyone with eyes could see that the Devil army’s defeat was set in stone!","Li Moying frowned as he pointed at the huge flag in front,” Ruijiang is here.”","Huang Yueli was startled and before she could say anything, she felt a powerful energy surging into her body!"]},{"number":4459,"title":"Chapter 4459 Meritorious service (5)","paragraphs":["4459 Meritorious service (5)","This energy was extremely powerful and overbearing, directly surging into her meridians.","Even with Huang Yueli’s current strength, she was totally unable to resist as she was completely suppressed by this energy. Even her four limbs had turned stiff.","Just as her expression changed and she thought that things were going to get worse, the Profound Energy that was suppressed in her body suddenly burst out. Not only was it not weakened by this energy, it was even clearly strengthened.","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she said in realization: ” This... Could this be...That talisman...”","Li Moying’s expression was solemn as he nodded his head,” It shouldn’t be wrong. No wonder the devil army is at a disadvantage but they are still so fearless.”","Even though they had already guessed it, they did not expect that the Talisman Array would be so powerful. Moreover, it was not difficult to activate it. It was even more powerful than they had imagined.","“I didn’t expect that there would be such a powerful secret treasure in the world! If this thing is in the hands of the Devils, the future of our Ancient God Clan and human race will be bleak! No, we have to think of a way to get it back!”","Huang Yueli’s expression turned solemn.","Such a powerful talisman that could be activated quickly and could be used indefinitely was definitely a key factor in determining victory or defeat on the battlefield.","Although she had personally experienced that the array only increased her strength by about 30%, which was still not comparable to the entire set of standard spirit weapons she had refined, its coverage was too wide!","The Devils within a ten-mile radius of Ruijiang’s Great Flag had been strengthened, covering at least ten thousand people.","This was extremely shocking.","The Sacred Phoenix Race’s mountain protecting formation could only cover twice the area. However, it could only be used thrice...","When Li Moying heard that, he pursed his lips as his voice turned even lower,” Now is not the time to consider this...”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes as she followed the direction of his gaze.","Then, his expression changed.","“Oh no, the strength of the Devils has suddenly increased by so much. The Allied Army...can’t hold on anymore!”","As the power of the Talisman Array instantly appeared, the Allied Army, which had an absolute advantage just now, was at a disadvantage in the blink of an eye. Meanwhile, the Devil’s momentum was renewed with vigor. Under the lead of the Deputy General, they charged into the Allied Army’s formation without hesitation.","Huang Yueli frowned as she couldn’t care less about letting her imagination run wild as she hurriedly followed Li Moying and rushed over, continuing to mix in with the devil army to cause trouble.","However, this time, their operation did not go as smoothly.","The difference in strength between the two sides was too great.","The two of them were unable to reveal their identities and could only secretly kill people. Hence, they were unable to release a wide range of Profound Skills to attack the Devils, so the efficiency of sneak attacks was very low.","This way, there was no way to stop the Devil army from advancing straight in.","“Everyone, hurry up! Victory is right in front of us. This time, we’re going to charge straight into Blessed City! Those bastards of the Gods Race can hide a lot of treasures. There are plenty of Spirit Armaments and pills!” The Deputy General laughed proudly.” Oh right, I heard that the women of the God Clan race are also very beautiful. I haven’t slept with a woman of the God Clan race yet!”","Huang Yueli’s brows creased as she almost couldn’t help but rush over to kill him on the spot.","Luckily Li Moying pulled her back in time.","Seeing that the Devil Clan’s attack was already unstoppable, Huang Yueli was at her wit’s end when suddenly, the Devil Clan’s charging attack came to a halt and some people couldn’t withstand the pressure and started to retreat.","“Damn it, why is he here?”","“Everyone, hold on! You’re not allowed to retreat! Do you hear me?”","The Devil Deputy General began to curse again.","Huang Yueli hurriedly raised her head and saw a familiar figure appearing in front of the Allied Army camp."]},{"number":4460,"title":"Chapter 4460 Meritorious service (6)","paragraphs":["4460 Meritorious service (6)","She didn’t expect that the leading General of the Allied Army was actually Jing Shaoyuan of the White Tiger Clan!","This surprised Huang Yueli.","During the previous God Realm’s Grand Meet, Jing Shaoyuan had suffered a terrible defeat in her and Li Moying’s hands, so he was extremely unwilling to accept it when he left.","Not long after, Jing Shaoyuan had returned to the front line to participate in the battle against the Devils.","It seemed that he was very unwilling to accept the defeat back then. He was desperately trying to sharpen himself and improve his strength!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli had a whole new level of respect for him.","A cultivator with talent and determination would definitely have very high achievements in the end.","Although she didn’t think much of Jing Shaoyuan’s character, it was undeniable that he would definitely be ahead of his peers in the future.","But to surpass her and Li Moying...Still no chance.","Jing Shaoyuan had been in the army for some time, but his strength had improved very quickly.","Huang Yueli very quickly saw that he was already at Heart Profound Realm peak cultivation and was only a step away from Dao Profound Realm. Just based on cultivation, he was already on par with her and Li Moying and his combat skills had also improved greatly.","Under Jing Shaoyuan’s leadership, the allied soldiers displayed their superior fighting strength. Even with the support of the Talisman Array of Ruijiang, the Devil army still had no obvious advantage.","When Huang Yueli saw this, her eyes lit up.","It seemed that the Allied Army still had a chance to win!","She exchanged a glance with Li Moying and the two of them immediately took action, using the same trick again, mixing in the middle of the devils and secretly taking action, killing a few of the devils who were charging at the front.","Jing Shaoyuan didn’t disappoint them. Every time, he could keenly detect the flaws in the Devil army. After several changes in formation, the Allied Armies gradually gained the upper hand.","The Devil Deputy General simply could not believe his eyes!","Was his army really so unlucky?","He had clearly obtained the support of Lord Ruijiang’s secret technique, but he was still defeated step by step...","“Impossible, this is impossible! Everyone, go up! No one is allowed to retreat!”","He shouted at the top of his lungs, but not only did he fail to stop the Devils from being defeated, he even attracted Jing Shaoyuan’s attention.","Jing Shaoyuan’s eyes lit up as he rushed toward him.","“A late stage Earth Devil! Very good, I like people like you who are strong. Not only can you sharpen my skills, but you can also provide me with a large amount of battle merits!”","One day, he would surpass Li Moying and become the most legendary young powerhouse in the Allied Army!","After the God Realm’s Grand Meet, he had always been holding back a wave of anger in his heart. He did his best to cultivate, and on the battlefield, he also took the initiative to look for stronger opponents.","Because Li Moying had once killed a middle stage Sky Devil so Jing Shaoyuan had always wanted to fight with a middle stage Sky Devil so that he could kill the other party to prove that his ability wasn’t any weaker than Li Moying.","Unfortunately, he hadn’t been able to find an opportunity, so he could only use late Earth Devils to make up the numbers.","Jing Shaoyuan’s bitter cultivation was indeed effective. His strength had improved by leaps and bounds, and the Devil Deputy General had almost no resistance in front of him. He was at a disadvantage from the start.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying watched from the side for a while and after confirming that Jing Shaoyuan would definitely win, they decided to leave secretly.","They had caused enough trouble here, so they could continue at another place.","However, as soon as they left the crowded area, they heard Jing Shaoyuan’s voice from behind. Stop right there!”","Huang Yueli frowned slightly as she turned her head to take a look, only to discover that Jing Shaoyuan had already killed the devil Deputy General and the long blade in his hand was still dripping with fresh blood as he rushed towards them."]},{"number":4461,"title":"Chapter 4461 Meritorious service (7)","paragraphs":["4461 Meritorious service (7)","“This fellow...When did he become so powerful?”","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened in astonishment.","Although she could tell that Jing Shaoyuan had improved greatly, she was still surprised that he could kill a Devil of the late Earth Devil Stage in just a dozen breaths.","After all, the Deputy General of the Devil Clan was augmented by the Ruijiang Talisman Array, and his strength was at least equivalent to an early-stage Sky Devil.","Jing Shaoyuan’s move was beyond their expectations.","The battlefield was so crowded that there was nowhere to hide.","Although Huang Yueli and Li Moying had the ability to move freely in the crowd, but if they used their movement Profound Skills, it would easily expose that they weren’t from the Devil Clan.","Jing Shaoyuan, on the other hand, didn’t have such concerns.","With a flash, he rushed in front of the two of them. Without any explanation, he raised his long saber and slashed at them.","He tacitly agreed that the female Devil Clan’s strength would be slightly weaker so this blade directly slashed towards Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli’s brows creased and before she could react, Li Moying had already given a cold snort and with a wave of his sleeves, he threw it towards Jing Shaoyuan.","An ethereal black aura flew out from his sleeves. It seemed to be floating and harmless, but when the two forces collided, Jing Shaoyuan’s face suddenly turned pale and he took a few steps back.","He completely did not expect that this Devil in front of him would actually be so strong!","With just a casual wave of his sleeve, he was able to force him back.","He clearly looked to be of similar strength to him, only at the late stage of the Earth Devil Realm. How could he be so strong? Could it be that this was some hidden expert of the younger generation of the Devil Clan?","He wasn’t the only one who was shocked, even Huang Yueli didn’t expect that Li Moying would suddenly make a move to force Jing Shaoyuan back.","She hurriedly tugged at Li Moying’s sleeve and gave him a look.","Li Moying frowned slightly as he took a step back.","It wasn’t that he wasn’t clear that they weren’t suited to fight with Jing Shaoyuan now. But when he saw how this fella dared to use such a deadly move on his Little Li’er, he couldn’t suppress the rage in his heart and subconsciously attacked.","At least he still had some sense left as he suppressed the powerful Profound Energy that was about to burst out from his body and did not arouse the suspicion of the surrounding Devil Clan.","“Let’s retreat!” Huang Yueli said as she turned around and ran.","It was their bad luck to encounter an expert like Jing Shaoyuan on the battlefield.","After all, they couldn’t do anything to Jing Shaoyuan. If the number one genius of the White Tiger Clan was injured by them and died on the battlefield of the Devil Clan, it would be a huge loss for the entire Ancient God Clan.","Therefore, the only way was to escape.","Li Moying didn’t even spare a glance at Jing Shaoyuan as he hurriedly followed after his wife.","The two of them moved very decisively. Very quickly, they passed through the Devil army.","However, the two of them never expected Jing Shaoyuan to not stop to kill the enemy. Instead, he chased after them relentlessly.","“Stop! Those two guys in front, stop right there! Where are you running to!”","Hearing Jing Shaoyuan’s voice, Huang Yueli’s lips twitched,” What the hell? Is Jing Shaoyuan out of his mind? Why is he chasing after us? There are so many Devils. If we kill the enemies nearby, we can earn more battle credits!”","What she didn’t know was that Jing Shaoyuan had always wanted to train himself on the battlefield, so he had been picking powerful Devils to challenge recently.","And Li Moying’s attack earlier had revealed his shocking innate talent and he had already been identified as the Devil Clan’s genius."]},{"number":4462,"title":"Chapter 4462 Meritorious service (8)","paragraphs":["4462 Meritorious service (8)","It was rare to meet such a suitable opponent, and Jing Shaoyuan didn’t want to miss it at all. Naturally, he wouldn’t let the two of them go.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but frown.","Jing Shaoyuan was too unreliable!","This was not a competition, but a battle between two armies.","As a commander, the most important thing was not how many Devils he killed, nor was it to kill the enemy’s commander. Instead, it was to command his soldiers and control the overall situation of the battlefield.","From this perspective, Jing Shaoyuan was not a qualified soldier.","However, no matter how much Huang Yueli ridiculed him in her heart, Jing Shaoyuan was determined to kill her and Li Moying, as a stepping stone in his journey of tempering himself.","When Huang Yueli saw this, she could only secretly give Li Moying a look.","Luckily, Li Moying’s mind was connected to hers and with just a glance, he understood her intentions.","The two of them immediately turned around and walked away while fighting. They gradually retreated from the center of the battlefield and moved towards a sparsely populated place.","Seeing how persistent Jing Shaoyuan was, it would be very difficult to get rid of him.","So Huang Yueli quickly made a decision and prepared to put Jing Shaoyuan in a gunny sack and knock him out with a stick, ending everything once and for all.","However, if she did that in the middle of the battlefield, Jing Shaoyuan would definitely be chopped into mincemeat by the Devil soldiers.","To put it bluntly, they had no deep hatred for Jing Shaoyuan.","Although Jing Shaoyuan was indeed a little petty, every time he fought with them, he was always fair and aboveboard. He would provoke them in front of them and get beaten up.","It was embarrassing, but he didn’t do anything bad.","In any case, the one who lost face was Jing Shaoyuan himself so Huang Yueli didn’t hold a grudge against him.","She didn’t want Jing Shaoyuan to be killed, so she decisively retreated from the battlefield and even left the range of the talisman.","Jing Shaoyuan didn’t see anything wrong with the two of them running further and further away. Instead, he was secretly delighted.","That was great!","He was still complaining that there were too many Devil soldiers beside him. He did not expect that someone would give him a pillow when he was sleepy. These two Devil geniuses were probably afraid of being chased by him and had lost their minds. They actually ran out of the range of the camp!","Wasn’t this courting death?","” Stop running!” Jing Shaoyuan shouted.” Stop running!” Come out and fight me if you have the guts! Are you Devils all cowards?”","Seeing that the two of them hadn’t stopped, he gritted his teeth and chased after them.” It’s useless for you to run. Stop for this Young Master. I can still give you a quick death! Otherwise...Today, this Young Master will definitely kill all of you and sacrifice your blade. I must prove to everyone that the peerless geniuses of the ancient Ancient God Clan, are not only Li Moying and Huang Yueli!”","Huang Yueli pulled her husband along as they ran, but she felt that they were still too close to the battlefield.","She had never expected Jing Shaoyuan to say something like that after getting impatient.","When she heard her husband’s and her own name from his mouth, Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment, thinking that they had overlooked something and exposed her identity.","When she stopped and turned around to look at Jing Shaoyuan’s ferocious expression, she realized that she had been mistaken.","Jing Shaoyuan had simply said what he was thinking.","She was speechless.","What kind of grudge was this?","She had already eloped with her husband, and there were still people drawing circles and cursing them every day. No wonder she had been sneezing recently."]},{"number":4463,"title":"Chapter 4463 Meritorious service (9)","paragraphs":["4463 Meritorious service (9)","Was Jing Shaoyuan really so brainless?","Huang Yueli cursed in her heart, totally not realizing that she had slapped Jing Shaoyuan’s face several times, and all of them so ruthlessly, leaving behind such a huge psychological shadow...","Huang Yueli and Li Moying increased their speed and very quickly, they arrived at a deserted area.","There were a few Devils along the way, but Jing Shaoyuan killed them all, saving them a lot of trouble.","Huang Yueli looked around and saw that there was no one around as she slowed down her footsteps and gradually came to a stop.","Jing Shaoyuan had been chasing the two for almost an hour, and he was still wondering how lucky these two Devil geniuses were.","Why was it that every time he was about to catch up to the two of them, he would always accidentally step on a rock or encounter a Devil that suddenly appeared, allowing the two of them to escape from his hands?","Seeing that Huang Yueli and Li Moying had actually stopped, Jing Shaoyuan’s spirits were roused as he immediately rushed towards the two of them.","“I told you to run! Hah! Look, now you know you can’t escape, right? Lie down obediently and die!”","Jing Shaoyuan immediately brandished his saber as Profound Energy on his body was channeled into his next move and an energy vortex had been condensed. The surrounding air swirled all around as he leaped up high and slashed towards Li Moying’s head.","Because Li Moying had turned the tables on him earlier, so this time, Jing Shaoyuan had learnt his lesson and directly attacked Li Moying.","From his point of view, Li Moying’s ability was obviously a level higher so rather than leaving him to stare at him like a tiger eyeing its prey, it was better to kill him first!","Although it was inevitable that it would take a little more time, at least he would be able to entangle a stronger opponent. The possibility of an accident would be much smaller.","As for that weak female Devil, she was not that dangerous. He would throw her aside first, so she should not be a threat.","Jing Shaoyuan’s plan was very well thought out and he was extremely cautious as he used all of his strength, his aura was like a rainbow as he attacked Li Moying fiercely.","He had thought that this thunderous strike of his, even if it couldn’t kill Li Moying on the spot, it would definitely cause him serious injuries.","This was his first step to prove himself!","What happened next was similar to what he had imagined.","Facing his full powered attack, Li Moying didn’t know if he was scared silly or he didn’t have the time to react as he didn’t even budge, only frowning as he stared blankly at him.","Jing Shaoyuan couldn’t help but smile, as if he could already see the moment of his victory.","However, at this moment, he suddenly felt a chill coming from behind him. It was bone-chilling!","“Not good! It was... It’s that Female Devil!”","Jing Shaoyuan’s expression changed.","He had never thought that Huang Yueli actually had such shocking strength, not one bit inferior to the man beside her and her attack speed was even more shocking.","Jing Shaoyuan admitted that his speed was fast enough but in front of Huang Yueli, he was as slow as an old bull pulling a broken cart!","Jing Shaoyuan closed his eyes, thinking that he was doomed.","But...","“Swish...”","A sharp sword sound tore through the air and entered his ears.","Immediately following that, Huang Yueli let out a soft moan as the long whip in her hand which she was holding firmly, actually deviated by a centimeter and brushed past Jing Shaoyuan’s ear."]},{"number":4464,"title":"Chapter 4464 Meritorious service (10)","paragraphs":["4464 Meritorious service (10)","Although she had left an obvious scar on Jing Shaoyuan’s face, her plan to knock him out had failed.","Li Moying had been on full alert as he observed his little fox’s situation.","Seeing that Huang Yueli had missed, he immediately made his move as the long sword in his hand was unsheathed, as he charged towards the other party. At the same time, he blocked Huang Yueli behind him.","A crisp sound was heard. It was the sound of swords clashing.","Li Moying only felt the tip of the sword tremble violently as an incomparably powerful energy was transmitted over from the tip of the sword, causing his entire arm to turn slightly numb.","He had actually fought to a draw with the person who came!","The other party must be an expert!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s hearts simultaneously had this thought as they frowned and raised their heads as they looked forward.","Behind Jing Shaoyuan, a tall figure stood against the light. He was dressed in a simple green robe, but it could not hide his powerful and solid aura.","Although half of his face was covered by the shadow of the leaves above his head, the two of them recognized him immediately.","“.. Jun Sihan? Why is he here?” Huang Yueli muttered to herself.","Her voice was very soft, but Jun Sihan could still hear it clearly.","His cold and stern gaze turned towards Huang Yueli as he gave a cold snort: ” Devil Clan rat, you actually know me! That’s good. Today, you can also be ghosts who understand the world.”","After he finished speaking, he didn’t immediately attack Huang Yueli and the rest but looked at Jing Shaoyuan,” Young Master Jing, are you alright?”","“No... It’s fine...”","Jing Shaoyuan’s voice was trembling as he spoke.","However, he wasn’t completely frightened. He was mainly embarrassed.","Earlier when he attacked Li Moying, he thought that victory was already within his grasp but who knew that in just a blink of an eye, he had almost lost his life.","If Jun Sihan hadn’t arrived in time, he was sure that he would have been a corpse on the ground.","The two Devils in front of him...were actually so strong!","He was not even a match for one of the two. Just now, he actually had the delusion of fighting one against two!","However, this wasn’t the most embarrassing thing. What made him feel even more ashamed was that Jun Sihan had seen the scene just now!","He was also one of the top geniuses of the 12 Ancient God Clans, but he couldn’t even block a single move from the female Devil. Jun Sihan was able to force the two of them to join forces. Although he had the advantage of a sneak attack, it at least showed Jun Sihan’s strength...He was also much, much stronger than him!","Jing Shaoyuan felt a sense of despair.","As the oldest and most mysterious Veracious Wyvern Clan’s Young Lord among the twelve god clans, Jun Sihan had always kept a low profile and rarely left the clan. His only good friend from the outside was Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Li Moying.","Hence although he grew up in the Divine Realm, his reputation wasn’t as illustrious as Li Moying’s. The only thing that left an impression on people was the matter of him and Li Moying joining hands to kill the Sky Devil.","Jun Sihan didn’t even show up during the Divine Realm’s Grand Meet.","Therefore, many of the younger generation of the Divine Realm had underestimated his strength. They felt that although he was very strong, he was still far from being able to compare to a Divine level genius!","Although he would never be able to catch up to Li Moying and Huang Yueli, these God grade geniuses, but the gap between Jun Sihan and himself wasn’t too big.","Before today, Jing Shaoyuan had thought so."]},{"number":4465,"title":"Chapter 4465 Meritorious service (11)","paragraphs":["4465 Meritorious service (11)","However, Jing Shaoyuan finally realized how wrong he was!","No wonder the usually cold and emotionless Li Moying would become good friends with him.","In front of Jun Sihan’s powerful strength, his confidence and arrogance just now became a complete joke.","However, after a short moment of frustration, Jing Shaoyuan felt a sense of relief.","At least, Jun Sihan’s timely arrival saved his life.","Moreover, with such a powerful assistant, he once again had the confidence to kill the two Devils in front of him!","Thinking of this, Jing Shaoyuan calmed down and turned to Jun Sihan.” Young Master Jun, you came at the right time!” I’ve been chasing after these two Devils for a long time. They’re so young, but their strength is extraordinary. I reckon they’re geniuses that the Devils have carefully nurtured! We can join forces to kill them and get rid of any future troubles!”","Jun Sihan’s expression was solemn as he nodded slowly,” Yes, these two Devils... We really can’t keep him!”","The short exchange just now was enough for him to determine the threat of the two people opposite him.","Even without Jing Shaoyuan’s reminder, he would have attacked the two of them and killed them with all his might.","Just as Jun Sihan and Jing Shaoyuan were discussing, Li Moying and Huang Yueli were also secretly shocked.","They didn’t expect Jun Sihan to come to the Devil Battlefield!","This was really surprising.","Because a few months ago, because Jun Sihan had missed the Divine Realm’s Grand Meet, Li Moying had specially written a letter and sent it to the Veracious Wyvern Clan to ask about Jun Sihan’s recent situation.","It was said that Jun Sihan’s son had disappeared for some reason. He and Xia Yunxi were anxious and went to almost every corner of the twelve continents of the Divinity to trace their son’s whereabouts. However, there were still no clues.","Now, Jun Sihan appeared here. Could it be that his son had been found?","Jun Sihan had always lived in seclusion and rarely left the Veracious Wyvern Clan. He was not interested in participating in the battle of the Allied Armies. It was very strange that he would appear on the battlefield.","The two of them were communicating with their eyes when they suddenly felt the surrounding air suddenly turn solemn and quiet. A dangerous aura suddenly approached!","The aura around Jun Sihan increased rapidly. Obviously, he was ready to make a move.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying immediately became alert.","With him making a move, even the two of them could not take it lightly!","However, at this moment, the two of them could not think any further.","Jun Sihan used the secret technique of the Veracious Wyvern Clan to accumulate power at an extremely fast speed. In almost an instant, his aura had risen to its peak.","His eyes shone with a cold light as he suddenly burst out with an astonishing Profound Energy as he attacked the two of them fiercely without holding back!","Unlike Jing Shaoyuan, who had underestimated his opponent, he had quickly determined that the two were dangerous and decided to do his best to catch them off guard and end the battle in the shortest time possible.","Jun Sihan’s full power was already strong enough, and Jing Shaoyuan was behind him.","Although Jing Shaoyuan was far inferior to him, he could at least protect his back when he attacked with all his might."]},{"number":4466,"title":"Chapter 4466 Meritorious Service (12)","paragraphs":["4466 Meritorious Service (12)","In this way, it made up for the only flaw in Jun Sihan’s attack. It could be considered both offensive and defensive, with almost no weakness.","The powerful energies that erupted from both sides collided in the air. A violent boom shook the entire ground and cracked it on the spot. The trees closest to the four were uprooted, and the surroundings were in a mess.","The battle this time was huge. Both sides suffered injuries, but there was no clear victor.","On Jun Sihan’s side, he was unharmed but under Huang Yueli’s fierce attack, Jing Shaoyuan’s shoulder was swept by the sword energy, leaving a long and narrow wound that was so deep that one could see the bone.","Although the injury wasn’t serious, it was enough to make Jing Shaoyuan’s face turn ashen and doubt his life.","Among the four of them, only he was obviously injured. Didn’t this mean that he was the weakest among them?","Why was this happening?","The peerless geniuses of the Divine Realm were actually so strong, and there were so many of them!","He had casually participated in a battle against the demons, and he had actually encountered three experts who were not inferior to god-grade geniuses at the same time?","Compared to these people, he...He was simply a useless snack!","Whereas Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s side, both of them similarly didn’t suffer any injuries but they could clearly feel the Profound Energy in their bodies gushing out uncontrollably, almost unable to be suppressed.","Because Jun Sihan was too strong!","If the two of them did not show their true abilities and accept the challenge seriously, they might really fail miserably...","Just as they were in a dilemma, Jun Sihan raised his wrist and the tip of the sword in his hand flashed. The aura in his body soared again!","Jing Shaoyuan couldn’t keep up with Jun Sihan’s pace, but in order to get the credit, he still forced himself to raise his bleeding arm to cover him.","At that moment, Jing Shaoyuan suddenly felt a sharp pain in the back of his head.",".. F * ck, what’s going on? Someone was ambushing him?","The thought flashed through Jing Shaoyuan’s mind, but before he could react, he blacked out and fell to the side.","He fell to the ground and lost consciousness.","However, at this moment, not only was Jing Shaoyuan shocked, even Huang Yueli and Li Moying were dumbfounded.","However, Jun Sihan’s movements were too fast and Jing Shaoyuan was completely unprepared for him. He didn’t even have time to react.","Alright, Li Moying, stop pretending!” Jun Sihan’s mouth twitched and he directly exposed their identities,” And Miss Huang, what’s wrong with you? Why did he run to the demon camp? Look at you guys, you really put on a good act. You can even disguise the Profound Energy in your body and almost fooled me!”","Huang Yueli also reacted and realised that she had been seen through. She pursed her lips and said disappointedly: ” Brother Jun, how can you even see through this? Even the deputy general of the demon race has been deceived by us!”","Jun Sihan said,”The dragon race is born with strong five senses. It’s fine if you don’t make a move but once you do, I can easily sense the changes in the Profound Energy in your body.”"]},{"number":4467,"title":"Chapter 4467 Meritorious service (13)","paragraphs":["4467 Meritorious service (13)","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but frown,” The Veracious Wyvern Clan actually has such innate talent! Looks like we’re lucky enough to not have met any other True Dragon Race cultivators before we met you. Otherwise, our identities might have been exposed!”","“For example, I could only sense that one of you is a fire attribute cultivator and the other is a lightning attribute cultivator. Your strength is close to mine. In addition, you are a man and a woman...In the Divine Realm, only the two of you can meet these conditions. You can guess it with a casual guess.”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying finally came to a realization.","To be able to meet a good friend on the Devil battlefield, Li Moying was very happy.","However, Jun Sihan didn’t seem to be so excited. Although his tone was calm, there were still faint lines between his thick black eyebrows. There were also obvious dark circles under his eyes. It was obvious that he was too worried.","Li Moying sensed something as his dark black pupils narrowed slightly,” Sihan, what’s wrong with you? Why did he appear on the Devil battlefield? I’ve heard you mention before that the Veracious Wyvern Clan rarely gets involved in such matters. The last time you killed Rui Xuan with me was already an exception.”","Jun Sihan was stunned. Then, a helpless smile appeared on his handsome face.” You can tell?”","“It’s so obvious. How could I not see it?” Li Moying frowned slightly as he asked directly,” What kind of trouble have you run into? If you need my help in any way, just tell me. Something that can stump the Veracious Wyvern Clan’s Young Lord is definitely not a small matter.”","Jun Sihan frowned habitually.” Forget it, you really can’t help with this.” You’d better worry about your own matters. I heard that after you eloped with Sister-in-law, the Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan were in a mess. Moreover, Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Patriarch even brought people and directly charged to the Sacred Phoenix Continent to denounce you, causing a huge ruckus between both parties.”","“If it wasn’t for the Island Master of the Floating Sea, the two races might have already started fighting.”","Huang Yueli was shocked,” What?! Why did they make such a big fuss? Moying and I were training in a mystic region some time ago and we don’t know what happened in the twelve continents.”","Jun Sihan nodded.” No wonder. I was wondering why the two of you didn’t come out to stop it.” Now, the friction between the two races is not small. A new grudge has been formed. It will be even more difficult for you to get married...”","Huang Yueli’s lips twitched as she was speechless.","Why was it so difficult for her to marry her husband?","Was it because those old men in the family who were thousands of years old and still young were psychologically perverted? Were they jealous of her and her husband’s love for each other and deliberately causing trouble for them?","However, although they had not seen this situation with their own eyes, they had already expected it.","Anyway, she and Li Moying had never expected that bunch of stubborn old fogeys to suddenly have a conscience. In the end, they still had to rely on the two of them to break through and everything else was just a facade.","Li Moying’s face remained expressionless as his gaze landed on Jun Sihan. He said coldly,” Alright, Sihan, don’t think that I don’t know what you’re thinking. Don’t change the subject. What happened to you?”"]},{"number":4468,"title":"Chapter 4468 Meritorious service (14)","paragraphs":["4468 Meritorious service (14)","Seeing that Jun Sihan was silent, Li Moying’s dark eyes flashed and he decided to be straightforward,” Did something happen to Sister-in-law?”","Jun Sihan’s eyes widened in shock. He was silent for a while and then shook his head.” I knew that I couldn’t hide it from you...”","He took a deep breath, and his complexion instantly became much more dispirited. His handsome face also showed obvious fatigue.","He glanced at Jing Shaoyuan, who was lying on the ground. After confirming that he was still unconscious and showed no signs of waking up, he lowered his voice and said,” You guessed right.” However, Yunxi wasn’t the only one who was in trouble. Our son, Jun Luoxing, was also in trouble.”","Luo Chenxi frowned when she heard that.” Why? Did something really happen to Sister-in-law? Oh right, during the God Realm’s Grand Meet a few months ago, I heard that something happened to your family...”","Xia Yunxi was the first friend she had made after arriving in the Immortal Realm. The two of them had a tacit understanding on the Devil battlefield and formed a deep friendship.","After that, Xia Yunxi was found by Jun Sihan and brought back to the Veracious Wyvern Clan while Huang Yueli followed Li Moying to Cloudy Qilin Clan.","At that time, the two of them had even agreed to meet often. Xia Yunxi had even said that she wanted her son to acknowledge her as his godmother.","Luo Chenxi had already planned to find time to visit her in the Zhenlong Continent. She did not expect that something would happen to Xia Yunxi.","Jun Sihan pursed his lips and his face was cold.” That’s right. It happened before the Divine Realm’s Grand Meet. I had already told Yunxi that I would go to the Floating Sea to meet you and your wife. However, the night before I left, Xing ‘er suddenly disappeared. We searched everywhere and finally saw Xing ‘er, who was unconscious, and a team of Devils in the suburbs.”","” Yunxi and I immediately made a move to stop them, but we didn’t expect that there would be four late-stage Sky Devil powerhouses in this team of Devils. The two of us were no match for them. I tried my best to protect Yunxi, but in the end, I still fainted.”","Huang Yueli’s brows were tightly knitted together,” So, during the God Realm’s Grand Meet, Brother Jun, both you and Yunxi were unconscious? No wonder I had an ominous feeling back then...”","But at that time, the situation of Sacred Phoenix Clan and Cloudy Qilin Clan was in a mess and Huang Yueli was in a hurry to expose Huang Sanbai’s true colors so she didn’t have the energy to delve into the matter of the Veracious Wyvern Clan.","Besides that, the members of the Veracious Wyvern Clan seemed to be unwilling to reveal Young Master’s situation. At that time, she and Li Moying merely asked a few more questions and were invited out of the Veracious Wyvern Clan’s encampment.","“So, have you found Xing ‘er yet?” Li Moying asked.","Jun Sihan’s expression became even more serious.” His whereabouts are still unknown...” The only thing worth rejoicing about is that the jade talisman of life he left in the clan has not shattered. He should still be alive and well, but we don’t know where he is.”","In the Divine Realm, many large factions would refine jade talismans of life for their family members. When they went out to train, they would leave the jade talismans at home. Once an accident happened, the family would be the first to know.","It was just that when this kind of jade talisman was made, it had to be infused with a wisp of blood essence taken out on the day of the jade talisman’s owner’s birth so for Huang Yueli who had ascended from the lower realm, she couldn’t be equipped with it.","Hearing this, Huang Yueli heaved a sigh of relief,” That’s a blessing in disguise! As long as he’s fine, there must be a way to find him. Brother Jun, don’t be anxious...”","“How can I not be anxious!” Jun Sihan’s usually calm and indifferent face was now full of anxiety,” Yunxi took advantage of the time when I was unconscious to secretly leave the Veracious Wyvern Clan to look for Xing ‘er. It has been a few months now!”"]},{"number":4469,"title":"Chapter 4469 Meritorious service (15)","paragraphs":["4469 Meritorious service (15)","“What? Sister-in-law, she...She actually went missing too? How did this happen?”","This time, even Li Moying found it hard to maintain his usual calmness and composure.","No wonder Jun Sihan looked so haggard. It turned out that his son and wife were missing!","Putting himself in his shoes, if he were to encounter such a situation where his beloved Little Li’er had gone missing for a few months and his son had been abducted by the Devil Clan, he would probably have long lost control of his emotions and was not far from going insane!","However, Jun Sihan remained calm, at least on the surface.","Only someone like Li Moying who understood him well could see the uneasiness and exhaustion in his heart from beneath his calm exterior.","Jun Sihan narrowed his eyes and recalled the situation at that time. His face turned even uglier.","“At that time, I was besieged by four late-stage Sky Devil experts of the Devil Clan and was seriously injured and unconscious. Because I protected Yunxi, her injuries were lighter than mine, so she woke up earlier than me. It took me more than ten days to wake up, but I found that Yunxi was gone. My clansmen told me that she had secretly left the True Dragon Continent. I don’t need to think to know that she must have gone to find Xing ‘er.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, she couldn’t help but say,” Yunxi, she...” How could she be so impulsive? It was understandable that she was anxious when Xing ‘er went missing. However, if she left the Zhenlong Continent alone and met a Devil expert, would she have to deal with it this way? What if we can’t save Xing ‘er and end up getting ourselves killed?”","Jun Sihan’s thick black eyebrows furrowed.” You can’t blame Yunxi for this. She wanted to leave the territory of the Veracious Wyvern Clan for a long time. Xing ‘er’s disappearance was just a fuse...” If you really want to blame someone, you can only blame me for not protecting her and Xing ‘er well.”","He didn’t finish his sentence but Huang Yueli and Li Moying had already guessed a little.","The Veracious Wyvern Clan had always felt that Xia Yunxi’s status was not high enough and she was not worthy of Jun Sihan’s status as the young master. The conflict had been going on for a long time.","This time, Jun Luoxing was missing and Jun Sihan was unconscious. Who knew what the Veracious Wyvern Clan would say about Xia Yunxi?","She had a tough temper, so it was normal for her to run away to look for her son.","Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched as she really wanted to scold Jun Sihan but seeing his pale face, she couldn’t bring herself to do so.","Li Moying could see that her expression wasn’t good as he stretched out his hand to hold her small hand and pinched it.","At the same time, she turned to Jun Sihan again.” What do you plan to do now? It’s been so long. Is there any news of Sister-in-law and Xing ‘er?”","Jun Sihan nodded and then shook his head.","“There is some news, but the person has gone missing and has not been found. I recently received news that someone saw Yunxi outside Blessed City, so I specially rushed over. In the end, we didn’t find him, but we encountered the attack of the Devils...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli came to a sudden realization.","So, Jun Sihan was just passing by today! No wonder he appeared here.","She thought for a moment and was a little puzzled,” Brother Jun, to tell you the truth, Moying and I came from the Devil Clan’s territory. A while ago we went to a secret base to train and on the way, we passed by the Devil Clan’s territory, Vermillion Light Collet. However, we went back and forth twice, but we didn’t see Yunxi or Xing ‘er.”","Although the two of them had only visited a small area and did not walk through the entire Vermillion Light Collet, Xia Yunxi’s aura was too special as a member of the Sorcerer Tribe. As long as the two of them used their divine senses to detect her, they would definitely find her."]},{"number":4470,"title":"Chapter 4470 Meritorious service (16)","paragraphs":["4470 Meritorious service (16)","Jun Sihan was stunned.” What? You came from Vermillion Light Collet? Are you sure Yunxi isn’t in Vermillion Light Collet?”","Huang Yueli nodded her head,” I...I shouldn’t be mistaken.”","After she finished speaking, she looked at Jun Sihan carefully. She was afraid that he would be disappointed when he received such news.","” Big Brother Jun, although Yunxi is not in Vermillion Light Collet, it doesn’t mean that something happened to her. Maybe she didn’t take the risk to enter the Devil Clan’s territory. She’s still in the Ancient God Clan’s 12 Continents. She’s very safe...”","Before Huang Yueli could finish her words of persuasion, Jun Sihan raised his right hand and stopped her.","“Sister-in-law, I appreciate your kindness, but the information I received shouldn’t be wrong. Yunxi did enter Vermillion Light Collet. Since you said she was gone...It seems that she has already left Vermillion Light Collet...”","Jun Sihan paused for a moment.","But even without him saying it, Huang Yueli and Li Moying could guess that Xia Yunxi should have set off from Vermillion Light Collet and continued to venture deep into the Devil Clan’s territory.","Thinking of this, the two of them frowned at the same time.","The Divine Realm was extremely vast. The twelve continents that the Shen clan completely controlled could be considered the most fertile piece of land. However, compared to the entire Divine Realm, it was only a small portion of the region.","The remaining areas were unexplored by the Ancient God Clans and the Human race.","Even the God Clans did not fully understand how big the territory occupied by the Devils was.","Vermillion Light Collet was only a strategic town on the outskirts of the Devil Clan. No one could predict what would happen if they continued to venture deeper.","Huang Yueli’s expression turned even more solemn,” This is bad, why is Yunxi so bold! Brother Jun, you...What do you plan to do next?”","Jun Sihan narrowed his eyes and didn’t hesitate,” Of course, I want to cross Vermillion Light Collet immediately and enter the Devil territory to continue searching for Yunxi.”","“We’ll go with you...” Huang Yueli immediately said.","She knew very well how cruel and dangerous the Devils were!","Xia Yunxi actually dared to go in alone. She couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat for her good friend.","However, Jun Sihan shook his head and interrupted her,” No, the Devil territory is full of danger. You don’t have to take the risk with me.” Besides, you can’t leave now! If I’m not wrong, you disguised yourselves as Devils and joined their army to help Divine General Xuan protect Blessed City, right?”","Huang Yueli calmed down a little as she recalled her original motive and nodded her head.","Jun Sihan said,” To tell you the truth, according to my investigation during this period of time, a big thing happened within the Devil Clan. It is said that...” The previous Devil King died a few months ago, and the new Devil King has just ascended the throne. Whether it’s the disappearance of my Xing ‘er or the sudden large-scale attack of the Devil Clan on the twelve continents of the God Clan, it should be related to this matter.”","“The Devil King has fallen...” Huang Yueli was stunned.","A thought flashed across her mind, but she couldn’t grasp it.","Jun Sihan didn’t notice her strange behavior and continued,” I don’t know what the Devils are planning. However, the strength of the Devils ‘attack this time has exceeded the countless battles in the past. My intuition tells me that if I can’t protect You’ an City, the consequences will be very serious.”","“Now, I have to hurry up and find Yunxi. The mission of protecting Blessed City can only depend on you. If you leave, even with the Dark Divine General, Jing Shaoyuan and the others won’t be able to hold Blessed City.”"]},{"number":4471,"title":"Chapter 4471 Meritorious service (17)","paragraphs":["4471 Meritorious service (17)","Although Huang Yueli was also worried about Xia Yunxi’s condition, but she had to admit that Jun Sihan was right.","Moreover, Jun Sihan’s strength wasn’t any weaker than hers.","Jun Sihan who grew up in the most ancient and mysterious Veracious Wyvern Clan in the Divine Realm had a deep understanding of the secrets of the Divine Realm. It wasn’t something that she and Li Moying who had just arrived in the Divine Realm for less than two years could compare to.","If Jun Sihan couldn’t track Xia Yunxi, they definitely couldn’t do anything.","She pondered for a moment,” Alright, then Moying and I will stay here first to deal with Ruijiang.”","Jun Sihan’s expression was cold as he nodded.” Thank you for telling me about the situation in Dan Guang Region. It saved me a lot of time.” In that case, I’ll take my leave first!”","Li Moying patted his shoulder,” Be careful along the way. If you encounter any unsolvable problems, you know how to contact me. Don’t take risks alone.”","Although he said that, he also knew that his words were useless.","His good friend, Jun Sihan, was the same as him. He had a strong personality and had a deep relationship with Xia Yunxi. It was almost impossible for him to calm down and ask his friends for help when his beloved woman and son were in danger.","Moreover, from Jun Sihan’s words just now, he could tell that Jun Sihan still had some reservations about Xia Yunxi and Jun Luoxing’s situation and did not explain it clearly.","Li Moying didn’t think that Jun Sihan was on guard against them, but he probably had some unspeakable secret...","Thinking of this, he did not say anything more as he turned around and held his wife’s small hand,” Little Li’er, let’s go back.”","“Alright.” Huang Yueli nodded.","“Oh right, wait a moment!”","The two of them were about to leave when Jun Sihan suddenly called out to them from behind.","“Are you going back empty-handed? Don’t you need to bring something back so that you can show off in front of Ruijiang and gain his trust?”","Hearing that, Huang Yueli turned around and raised her brows,” I do want to but I can’t possibly cut this fellow’s ear back right?”","She pointed at the unconscious Jing Shaoyuan on the ground.","He didn’t know what Jun Sihan did to him, but he was still lying on the ground.","Jun Sihan shook his head slightly.” That’s not necessary. However, I know that Jing Shaoyuan has the commander’s seal that the coalition army uses to mobilize troops. If you take it back, it will definitely be a great contribution.” Of course, you could also say that you killed Jing Shaoyuan, which would be even more meritorious! I guarantee that Ruijiang will treat you as his trusted aides.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up,” Not bad, this is a good idea! However, we can just take the commander’s seal and not claim credit for killing Jing Shaoyuan. I think this guy is very impatient. He’s greedy and rash. He can’t even tell the strength of the enemy. This was fatal on the battlefield. If he did not learn his lesson and be careful, he might die here. If Jing Shaoyuan really dies and the White Tiger Clan puts the blame on us, we’ll be wronged.”","She mumbled as she walked over to Jing Shaoyuan. She bent down and reached for Jing Shaoyuan’s chest, trying to find the commander’s seal.","However, before her fair and tender hand could touch Jing Shaoyuan’s clothes, Li Moying grabbed her wrist and pulled her back.","” Little Li’er, you’re tired so rest for a while. I’m here to look for the commander’s seal.”","Huang Yueli turned back in surprise and looked at her husband’s solemn and handsome face,” Ah? I’m not tired...”"]},{"number":4472,"title":"Chapter 4472 Meritorious service (18)","paragraphs":["4472 Meritorious service (18)","“No, you’re tired.”","Li Moying said expressionlessly as he pulled her behind him and even grabbed Huang Yueli’s little hand, placing it by his lips to give it a kiss to disinfect it.","Following that, he let go of Huang Yueli and bent down to personally search Jing Shaoyuan’s body.","Huang Yueli was speechless.","Jun Sihan was speechless.","Huang Yueli looked at her husband’s slightly red ears and realised that he didn’t want her to touch another man’s body so he pulled her away.","Was there a mistake? She was just searching Jing Shaoyuan for no other purpose. Why couldn’t she do that?","Jun Sihan felt even more stifled.","These two people...This was really enough!","How dare he show off his love and abuse his dog in front of a poor man whose wife and son had gone missing? Didn’t they say that they would be brothers for life?","Li Moying took out the commander’s seal from Jing Shaoyuan’s pocket and just as he straightened his body, he hooked his arm around Huang Yueli’s waist and planted a kiss on her face.","His entire movement was too natural, so natural that it was like flowing water. He did not pause at all. Of course, he did not realize that there was someone else beside him.","On the contrary, Huang Yueli recalled that Jun Sihan was beside her and her face turned slightly red as she pushed Li Moying twice but she didn’t push him away...","Jun Sihan really wanted to ask Huang Yueli, you are a peak Heart Profound Realm practitioner, how could you not push away a lecher who had stolen a kiss from you! Was that soft strength playing with him?","The pitiful Young Master Jun couldn’t bear to watch any longer. So, he directly said: ” Alright. Since you’re all fine now, then let’s part ways here!”","Li Moying turned his head to look at him as his expression turned grave,” Be careful on the way back. I’ll wait for you, Sister-in-law and nephew to return safely.”","“You must be careful.” Huang Yueli also reminded him.","Jun Sihan nodded and didn’t say anything else. He turned around and left decisively.","Looking at Jun Sihan’s lonely back view, Huang Yueli’s heart felt heavy and stifled, feeling that something big was about to happen.","“I hope that Yunxi and the others will be safe...”","The two of them stayed in the same place for a while until Jun Sihan’s back was out of sight. Then, they prepared to return to the center of the battlefield and meet up with the demon army.","Before she left, Huang Yueli looked at the unconscious Jing Shaoyuan.","“Aiya, not good! Brother Jun forgot to wake this guy up when he left. What should he do now? She couldn’t just let him lie here like this, right? If the demon army comes and sees him motionless, they will definitely slaughter him like a fat sheep.”","They were all Protoss, and although they didn’t have a good relationship, it was fine if they had tricked Jing Shaoyuan, but it would be too much if they really killed him.","Li Moying replied indifferently,”Then wake him up.”.","Huang Yueli was startled: ” How do I wake him up?”","Every major force in the Immortal Realm had their own unique restrictive techniques. Without learning the corresponding mental cultivation method, it was very difficult to break it. Unless the difference in strength between the two sides was several times, one could only use Profound Energy to break through the restrictive technique.","However, it was obvious that the gap in strength between them and Jun Sihan was not that big.","Li Moying didn’t reply immediately but took two steps towards Jing Shaoyuan’s side and lifted his long leg up as he gave Jing Shaoyuan’s butt a fierce kick.","Jing Shaoyuan couldn’t withstand the immense power of the man’s attack. His body was sent flying, and he even flew past a towering tree in front of them. With a crash, he landed on the back of the tree.","At the same time, there was the sound of vomiting coming from the tree."]},{"number":4473,"title":"Chapter 4473 Meritorious service (19)","paragraphs":["4473 Meritorious service (19)","Huang Yueli was dumbfounded as she turned to look at her husband.","Of course, doing so required a very high level of strength. One also had to have a powerful divine sense and be able to accurately determine the location of the qi and blood accumulation in the other party’s body. There were very few people who could do it.","Huang Yueli thought for a moment and understood.","She didn’t know whether to laugh or cry when she heard the miserable sound of the other party vomiting.","“Sigh, Jing Shaoyuan is also considered to be in trouble...”","Li Moying didn’t think much of it as he gave a cold snort,” Just like him, he couldn’t even judge the enemy’s strength and dared to take the risk to chase after them. It’s a fluke that he can even keep his life! Today, he will suffer a little and learn a lesson.”","Finished speaking, he grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist.","“If you don’t want Jing Shaoyuan to see you, we should leave.”","Although they still had disguises on their faces and weren’t worried about exposing their true identities, Jing Shaoyuan now regarded them as enemies. It would take a lot of time for them to be pestered by him.","“Then let’s go back quickly.” Huang Yueli hurriedly said.","When Jing Shaoyuan finally finished vomiting and came out from behind the tree, he saw the two of them running away.","These two fellows had caused him to be in such a miserable state!","As the top genius of the younger generation in the Twelve Continents of the Divine Realm, he had only suffered such a huge setback in the hands of Huang Yueli and Li Moying in this lifetime!","Now, even two demons could bully him!","Jing Shao was so angry that he felt his blood churning in his chest. He felt a sweet taste in his throat and almost vomited blood again.","He quickly took a few deep breaths, held his breath, and focused. After adjusting for a long time, he finally calmed down.","“Don’t be angry, don’t be angry... There’s no point in being angry with these demon b * stards. I want to remember today’s hatred. When these two are alone, I will kill them with my sword and regain my face!”","Jing Shaoyuan turned around and saw that Jun Sihan was nowhere to be seen, so he didn’t think too much about it.","With Jun Sihan’s strength, the possibility of him dying in the hands of the two demons was close to zero. Moreover, his body was nowhere to be seen.","He reckoned that after the bloody battle with the demons, both sides suffered losses, so he left first.","However, as he walked, he touched his chest and his body suddenly stiffened.","..","“Achoo! Achoo!”","Huang Yueli sneezed a few times as she rubbed her red nose,” Who’s scolding me? Could it be that Jing Shaoyuan has reacted?”","Li Moying grabbed her hand and pulled her towards his side. He lowered his head and whispered into her ear,” Don’t bother about that Jing fellow. It’s our turn soon.”","Li Moying raised his chin and pointed forward.","This was the team that the demons used to count their battle merits. It was already full of people.","The two of them had just returned from Jing Shaoyuan’s place and wanted to continue on the battlefield for a while but who knew that the battle had ended so quickly and because of her and Li Moying’s departure, the battle ended in a one-sided victory for the Devil Race.","The two of them were dragged to line up to report their battle achievements."]},{"number":4474,"title":"Chapter 4474 Meritorious service (20)","paragraphs":["4474 Meritorious service (20)","” I am Wu Lin from Squad Five. I killed three humans. This is the finger I cut off!”","“The first squad...Killed two humans!”","“The second squad...”","Every mo in the queue loudly reported the number of people they had killed in the alliance army. It was actually more than two.","Of course, because of the orders of the mo army, those mo who didn’t kill enough people hid at the side and didn’t dare to line up.","But this portion of the Devil race’s numbers were lesser than Huang Yueli had imagined.","Moreover, many of the demons in the team had killed three or even five humans!","At this moment, a tall and burly Demon with a full beard stood up and announced loudly,” I, the captain of the sixth squad, Peng Qi, have killed 20 humans and 5 gods. These are all my spoils of war.”","As Peng Qi said, he directly threw out a large number of incomplete fingers.","The surrounding demons all let out waves of exclamations.","” As expected of Captain Peng. He actually killed five Protoss. The Protoss in the allied forces are not weak!”","“Hey, what do you know? Captain Peng is an expert in the late stage of the Earth Demon Realm. Most of the Protoss in the alliance army are not as strong as him. In the last battle, he killed the divine guard leading the team!”","“That’s amazing. Everyone says that Captain Peng is the strongest among the team leaders. Now that the deputy general has died, he should be able to advance, right? In the future, you will be Deputy General Peng.”","Hearing these words, Peng Qi’s face carried an obvious smugness, and he could not help but throw his head back and laugh loudly.","“Hahaha, of course! “The god race only has that bit of ability. Isn’t it just relying on the spirit weapons and spirit medicines on their bodies that they can contend with us? Otherwise, with their small bodies, I’ll kill one if one comes, and I’ll kill a pair if two come! However, don’t say anything. The taste of the little girls of the God Race is very good. If you see them, don’t be in a hurry to kill them. Enjoy them first, hehe...”","A wretched laughter came from the demons.","In the alliance army, compared to the human race, the number of gods was much smaller. Sometimes, they might not be able to find them even if they wanted to.","Moreover, the strength of the god clan was generally on the high side. They often had life-saving spirit weapons given by their families. They were not so easy to kill.","Therefore, occasionally, someone would report that they had killed a god clan in their battle records, which would immediately cause the surrounding people to exclaim in surprise.","Not to mention Peng Qi, who killed five god clans at once!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying stood at the back of the line and when they heard these flattering words, they couldn’t help but frown.","Just from the battle achievements of these demons, it could be judged that the alliance army could be said to have suffered heavy casualties this time. Otherwise, there would not be so many people who could come to report their battle achievements.","They used the fingers of the alliance army soldiers to count their military achievements!","Just thinking about it made their hearts turn cold.","Especially Peng Qi and the rest’s smug faces, it made the two of them even more eager to make a move on the spot and clean up all the devils present.","Unfortunately... They had more important tasks to complete, and now was not the time to act up.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying weren’t in a hurry to report their battle merits but waited at the side for a period of time to tally the number of casualties on both sides.","As time passed, most of the mo with military merits had already been registered, leaving only a few people.","“Hey, those two over there! Are you the captains of the seventh and eighth squads?” Peng Qi suddenly shouted loudly.","Seeing Huang Yueli and Li Moying turn their heads, his face revealed a mocking smile,” I heard that the two of you are very powerful. Before you even reached the camp, you have already made a great contribution. I wonder if this time.... How many god clans have you killed?”"]},{"number":4475,"title":"Chapter 4475 Meritorious service (21)","paragraphs":["4475 Meritorious service (21)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment.","They did not expect that the two of them had already been watching the show so low-key. There was actually someone who remembered them and specially came to provoke them.","However, the surrounding demons had already started shouting.","“That’s right. Aren’t you two the new experts of the Pill Light Ridge? They captured more than 20 god clans alive as soon as they arrived. The entire camp has heard about it!”","” He’s so strong. He must have made great contributions on the battlefield, right?”","“What new expert? How could he compare to our Captain Peng? You must be dreaming!”","” That’s right. I just saw the two of them being chased around by the God Clan’s Jing something Divine Guard. It’s so embarrassing. They’re lucky to be alive. What credit is there to talk about?”","Hearing these sarcastic remarks and seeing the different expressions of the devils, Huang Yueli immediately understood.","It seemed that Jing Shaoyuan’s killing of the demon deputy general had a huge impact on the demon soldiers!","That was true. The army was still at the front line, and there was already an empty position for a deputy general. They would definitely have to select one of the team leaders to take over. This was a rare opportunity to rise to the top in one step!","Peng Qi’s prestige in the fiend race army was so high. He also looked like a true expert. He was definitely determined to get the position of deputy general.","But now, she and Li Moying suddenly appeared...The moment he arrived at the camp, he became famous for offering Xuan Chaoyi and the other captives. This time, even if they had no intention of competing for the position of deputy general, it had become the biggest obstacle for Peng Qi to ascend.","“How is it? What kind of methods do you have? How many gods have you killed? Hurry up and show everyone! There are so many ordinary soldiers here who have killed three to five humans. As the team leader, you can’t be worse than them, right?”","“Yeah, where’s the finger you cut off? Hurry up and take it out for everyone to see!”","Many demon soldiers began to clamor.","Only the demon soldiers who had followed Huang Yueli and the rest out from Pill Light Region did not say a word as they hid at the back of the crowd, carefully watching the two of them.","They had seen Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s moves before and were very clear in their hearts that these two devils ‘methods were far beyond Peng Qi’s reach. To dare to go against them was purely courting death!","No matter how much the devils clamored, Huang Yueli’s face remained indifferent.","” We ran into an accident on the battlefield this time. We were entangled by Jing Shaoyuan of the White Tiger Race. As a result, we didn’t have time to kill the ordinary soldiers of the alliance army...”","Hearing these words, Peng Qi’s face already revealed a cold smile.","He had already guessed earlier that Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t have much battle merits so he thought that their clothes were spotless and they didn’t look like people who had just returned from a fierce battle.","However, he did not expect that they actually did not obtain any military merits!","This was really God helping him, allowing him to completely deal with these two suspected competitors.","Thinking up to here, Peng Qi’s expression changed, and he suddenly spoke out, his voice incomparably stern,” What? As the squad leaders, you didn’t even kill a single member of the alliance army? He was simply trash! I think it’s not that you can’t kill him, but that you’re cowards and deliberately hiding! Our army does not need cowards like you. According to the iron law of the army, those who fear war should be killed!”"]},{"number":4476,"title":"Chapter 4476 Meritorious service (22)","paragraphs":["4476 Meritorious service (22)","Peng Qi wasn’t just talking about it but following the reprimand in his eyes, the long blade in his hand was unsheathed as he strode towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying, his eyes filled with killing intent.","From the looks of it, they were prepared to grab this opportunity to kill Huang Yueli and the rest on the spot.","All the Demon soldiers present were stunned by this austere scene but no one spoke up for Huang Yueli and the rest.","In the demon army camp, it was too common for a superior to find a reason to kill a subordinate.","Although Peng Qi and Huang Yueli were on the same level, but he was the most likely candidate to become the Deputy General and he was in the right so who would dare to step forward to stop him?","Peng Qi walked in front of Huang Yueli with a sinister smile and with a flip of the long blade in his hand, he slashed towards her head.","His reputation in the army did not come from nothing. It was just a simple move. It did not look fancy, but the surrounding air seemed to be enveloped by his demonic aura. A gloomy and cold aura came and silently seeped into the body, making people feel a chill from the bottom of their hearts.","The demon soldiers who were watching by the side, whose cultivation was slightly weaker, could not help but tremble. There were even some who could not hold on and fell to the ground.","The moment Peng Qidao made his move, a cold smile hung on the corner of his mouth.","From his point of view, Li Moying and Huang Yueli had not been able to establish any military merits, which in itself already showed that their abilities were limited and it was only because of their good luck that they were able to become the team leader.","Even the god race was unable to kill them. In front of him, Peng Qi, weren’t they just like weak rabbits that could be split into two with a single slash?","However, out of his expectations, Li Moying and Huang Yueli didn’t move.","Li Moying’s lips curled up as he revealed a playful smile,” A little interesting.”","In the past, he had a very vague impression of the Devil Race. He only knew that the Devil Qi circulating in their bodies and the Dark Force cultivated by the Celestials were two completely different powers.","However, after going deep into the fiend race’s territory, he discovered that the fiend race’s fiend qi was the same as the Profound Energy, they also had different attributes. Every different attribute would manifest different powers in battle.","For example, this Peng Qi, this kind of cold and gloomy energy was already very close to ice attributed Profound Energy.","If not for Peng Qi rushing up to court death himself, he would have planned on keeping this person to observe properly.","What a pity.","Li Moying’s heart felt a little regretful but his face still had an extremely cold expression. Seeing that Peng Qi’s long blade was already a few inches away from his Li ‘er, he took his time to make his move.","“Go to hell!”","Following a fierce roar, Peng Qi’s long blade hacked down fiercely.","However, in the next moment, he felt that something was wrong. His long saber seemed to be blocked by something. No matter how hard he tried, he could not slash it down.","Peng Qi was startled. He hurriedly raised his head to take a look, and his face immediately revealed a shocked expression.","He saw Li Moying’s two slender fingers grabbing onto the hilt of his knife, his posture elegant and he didn’t seem to be using much strength.","However, his aggressive power was completely dissolved.","Peng Qi was stunned for a moment and immediately realized that he had provoked a tough opponent. In his heart, he was shocked and immediately gripped the hilt of his saber tightly with both hands, wanting to pull back his treasured saber.","But it was impossible for him to pull back now so Peng Qi pulled back with all his might and his face was flushed red but the long blade was still between Li Moying’s fingers, not moving at all."]},{"number":4477,"title":"Chapter 4477 Meritorious service (23)","paragraphs":["4477 Meritorious service (23)","When the surrounding demons saw this scene, they were all tongue-tied and completely stunned.","Although there were some people who had guessed that for Li Moying and Huang Yueli to be able to sit on the position of the team leader, they definitely had some skills. But they only felt that since the two of them were able to exchange a few moves in front of Peng Qi, it was unlikely that they would be defeated in one move.","No one had expected this to happen.","This young couple who looked excessively young actually had such shocking strength. That young girl did not even make a move, and the man beside her already restrained Peng Qi with one move.","And as a famous expert with outstanding battle achievements in the fiend race’s military camp, Peng Qi did not even have the slightest leeway to resist.","No matter how hard she tried, she was unable to retrieve the long blade from Li Moying’s hands...","Li Moying’s eyes flashed with a cold light as he gave a cold snort as a burst of evil aura shot out from his body, as it followed the blade and bombarded towards Peng Qi’s direction.","Peng Qi felt that something was wrong and his expression changed in shock, hurriedly wanting to let go.","However, it was already too late.","The powerful and overbearing force hit his chest and heavily bombarded his body. Peng Qi spat out blood on the spot and flew back.","With a loud bang, he fell to the ground.","The campsite instantly fell silent. No one could say anything. Even their breathing was soft, afraid that they would make a noise and anger the expressionless man in front of them.","It was really...It was too terrifying!","He looked to be in his twenties, and his behavior was elegant and noble, like a noble young master who had lived a luxurious life. Who knew that he actually had such shocking strength? When he attacked, he was incomparably cold and ruthless!","Looking at Peng Qi’s appearance when he landed on the ground like a puddle of mud, most of the bones in his body were probably shattered. There was an 80% chance that he would not survive.","Even if he could barely be saved, his demonic qi would definitely dissipate and he would become a cripple.","In the territory of the demons, people without strength were no different from slaves. They could only survive under the oppression of the strong.","To the always arrogant expert Peng Qi, it was really better to just die!","Amidst the silence, there was a sudden clang. It sounded like the clash of weapons.","Everyone was shocked. They thought that someone was fighting again and quickly turned around to take a look.","In the end, she saw the long blade between Li Moying’s fingers was cut in half and fell onto the ground.","The Devil race’s weapons weren’t of a high grade compared to the allied army’s weapons. Even though he was a small team leader, the long blade Peng Qi used was merely a middle grade spirit weapon which was taken from the allied army’s soldiers before Huang Yueli improved the blueprint.","Such a weapon, how could it withstand Li Moying’s peerless strength?","The demon soldiers who saw this scene were even more shocked.","For a moment, no one could say anything.","“What’s going on?” A voice sounded from behind them. Why were they all standing there like idiots? Didn’t I ask you to report your battle achievements?”","The soldiers turned around and were shocked. Lord Piao...”","The person who came was Pu Jinchuan, the deputy general who Rui Jiang relied on the most.","Seeing him appear, everyone didn’t dare to make a sound as they all lowered their heads and carefully looked towards Li Moying’s direction.","Pu Jinchuan had already noticed Peng Qi, who was lying on the ground half-dead. He immediately raised his eyebrows in surprise.” What’s going on? How could Peng Qi be like this? What happened?”","One had to know that he came this time to seal Lord Rui Jiang’s order, to come and appoint Peng Qi as the new Deputy General.","Unexpectedly, when he arrived here, he saw Peng Qi who had already become a cripple. This...How was he supposed to explain this to the adults?"]},{"number":4478,"title":"Chapter 4478 Meritorious service (24)","paragraphs":["4478 Meritorious service (24)","At the thought of this, Park Jinchuan’s voice suddenly became sharp.” What exactly happened? Why are they all mute? Tell me clearly!”","The demon soldiers on the side all lowered their heads, like quails, not making a sound.","“What happened? Could it be that no one knew what was going on with Peng Qi? Those who do not report the situation will be punished by military law!”","When the demons heard this, they wanted to cry but had no tears. It was not that they did not know and did not want to say it, but...He didn’t dare to say it!","Pu Jinchuan was admittedly Lord Rui Jiang’s trusted aide and had immense authority but in terms of ability, he might not even be comparable to Li Moying who had seriously injured Peng Qi with a casual strike!","Now that he had revealed the truth of Li Moying’s crime, it was indeed pleasing to Pu Jinchuan but once Pu Jinchuan left, who could withstand Li Moying’s revenge?","Didn’t they see that an expert like Peng Qi was also wiped out with just a wave of his hand?","Seeing that no one spoke, Park Jinchuan also realized that something was wrong with the situation. He immediately became angry and increased his tone.","“Men, give me these useless Hades who know nothing and don’t report...”","“Milord, please calm down. Why do you have to make things difficult for these ordinary soldiers?”","At this moment, a sweet and gentle voice sounded.","Pu Jinchuan was stunned for a moment as he turned around and saw a petite young lady slowly walking over. Although she had disguised herself, but it was still unable to completely cover up Huang Yueli’s beauty and youth.","“You... You are...”","Huang Yueli gave a slight smile,” Didn’t Lord want to know what happened to Peng Qi? I can tell you.”","Even the mo couldn’t help but feel a little soft-hearted when they saw such a young and beautiful girl smile.","Park Jinchuan’s tone softened a little.” What exactly happened?”","“It’s very simple. Peng Qi felt that my husband and I were strong opponents to compete with him for the Deputy General position. In order to prevent future trouble, he took the initiative to attack us. I know that this is against the rules of the military camp, but Captain Peng obviously wanted to kill someone. We can’t just wait to die, right?”","When Huang Yueli said this, her tone was extremely calm and her face carried a faint helpless expression, as though what she and Li Moying had done earlier wasn’t anything strange and wasn’t worth anyone’s surprise.","However, when Pu Jinchuan heard this, his reaction was not much better than those ordinary demons. He was similarly shocked and could not believe his ears!","Peng Qi had already been under Lord Rui Jiang for several years. He could absolutely be considered a very talented powerhouse among the fiend race’s younger generation.","Mizue-sama had also been training and promoting him.","Looking at the young couple in front of him, they seemed to be very young...He was actually able to injure Peng Qi to such an extent?","“All of you...You guys...”","Pu Jinchuan was tongue-tied. For a moment, he did not know what to say.","However, when he turned around and saw the alarmed and frightened expressions on the demon soldiers ‘faces, he had no choice but to accept this fact...","Li Moying also slowly walked over and stood beside Huang Yueli,” There’s a reason for this. Although Peng Qi is our comrade, but for him to make a move on my wife, that’s courting death! If there is any violation of military orders, if there is any punishment, just come at me. It has nothing to do with my wife.”","“You...!”","Huang Yueli frowned and just as she turned her head to say something, she felt a pinch on her waist.","Receiving the hint from Li Moying’s eyes, she could only shut her mouth.","Pu Jinchuan felt a little dizzy at this moment.","Seeing Peng Qi collapse on the ground with such heavy injuries, he even thought that a fierce battle of life and death had just occurred!","But now, looking at Li Moying’s appearance, he was dressed immaculately, without a speck of dust...Where was there any sign of fighting?"]},{"number":4479,"title":"Chapter 4479 Meritorious service (25)","paragraphs":["4479 Meritorious service (25)","At this moment, rather than saying that he was angry, it was more like he felt that it was too unbelievable!","Pu Jinchuan stared at Li Moying for quite a while before he frowned and asked,” Was it really you who beat Peng Qi up to this state?”","Li Moying’s expression was indifferent as he nodded his head and at the same time, he slowly swept his gaze across the entire camp.","” If you don’t believe me, you can ask these soldiers. There were quite a number of people who saw it just now.”","Pu Jinchuan’s brows creased as he turned around to look at those ordinary soldiers and instantly understood that Li Moying’s words were absolutely not a lie.","Just by looking at the respectful and fearful eyes of these soldiers, one could tell that this seemingly harmless young man in front of them was definitely an expert with amazing strength!","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have frightened so many devils to such an extent that they didn’t dare to speak ill of Li Moying in front of Pu Jinchuan!","Thinking of this, Pu Jinchuan carefully sized up Li Moying from head to toe,” Honestly speaking, I still feel that it’s a little unbelievable. The Peng Clan was also a big clan in the Pill Light Region. Among the experts of the younger generation, Peng Qi was considered pretty good. Even in the capital, he could barely be considered an expert. You actually managed to heavily injure him...Since when did our Pill Light Ridge have a young man like you? Could they be from another territory?”","Pu Jinchuan spoke slowly, his tone clearly probing.","Although the mo were loners and didn’t pay attention to the friendship between clans like the god clan, they still valued the young generation of experts.","If Li Moying really had such ability, there was no reason for him to leave his own clan and run over to the Pill Light Region.","Towards this, Li Moying was already prepared for it and he didn’t even lift his eyelids as he said calmly,” Something happened in the clan and after Father passed away, I fell out with my elder brother...”","Pu Jinchuan revealed a look of understanding when he heard him speak so vaguely.” I see...”","Because the kinship between the mo was thin, there were many cases of siblings turning against each other for the sake of family property.","Looking at Li Moying’s attire and actions, coupled with his cultivation and ability, it was obvious that his background wasn’t bad. If he had lost in the fight for power and position and was chased out by the clan, it would be understandable...","“It’s fine even if you are expelled from the clan. Our Lord Rui Jiang has always cherished talent. With such strength, as long as you are loyal, you might have a better future...Since you’ve come to our army, why don’t you perform well...”","Park Jinchuan changed the topic and spoke again, clearly trying to recruit him.","That anger when he saw Peng Qi seriously injured at first glance just now, he had long lost it.","Demons were just so realistic.","Even though Peng Qi had always been the young man he valued the most before today and had always had special privileges in the military camp, but he was clearly already crippled now. What use was there in protecting him?","On the contrary, it was Li Moying who not only severely injured Peng Qi, but he was also completely unharmed. Such a young top expert obviously had greater potential than Peng Qi and his value was greater!","He had merely committed a crime and injured Peng Qi...He was a cripple, so what if he was beaten up? Could he be reprimanded for such a small matter?","Pu Jinchuan changed his attitude and became extremely passionate, which was already within Li Moying’s expectations.","He exchanged a glance with Huang Yueli and was just about to say something when suddenly, a weak moan came from behind.","“Pu... Lord Piao, please host for me...To uphold justice...”","Peng Qi had unknowingly woken up!"]},{"number":4480,"title":"Chapter 4480 Meritorious service (26)","paragraphs":["4480 Meritorious service (26)","This was really unexpected. Pu Jinchuan was stunned for a moment and frowned.” Peng Qi, I’m so disappointed in you!”","“Alright, don’t worry about him. The two of you, come with me.”","After Pu Jinchuan finished speaking, he totally didn’t care about Peng Qi who was still lying on the ground as he immediately turned around, wanting to bring Huang Yueli and Li Moying away.","Peng Qi was extremely anxious, his face flushed red, using all his strength to want to get up from the ground.","But earlier in order to establish his might in one strike, Li Moying had used a very heavy blow. His internal organs seemed to have shifted positions and he didn’t know how many bones were broken. No matter how hard he struggled, he couldn’t get up and could only let out a shrill cry,” Lord Piao, you...” You can’t leave me alone...I... I became like this because of Lord Ruijiang!”","Peng Qi had been in the military camp for so long, so he naturally knew very well that he was seriously injured to this extent. If he was abandoned by Pu Jinchuan, then he would truly become an abandoned child. The outcome could be imagined!","Actually, when Park Jinchuan appeared just now, Peng Qi had already woken up. Because it was too embarrassing just now, he kept pretending to be unconscious.","Now, seeing that Park Jinchuan did not even ask about his condition and was about to leave, he did not dare to continue pretending and quickly called out to them.","If he did not make a sound now, he would probably never have the chance to make a sound again!","“Pu... Sir Piao! You... Believe me, this subordinate is really doing this for the military camp, for Lord Ruijiang! Just now, I asked these two newcomers to report their battle achievements, but they didn’t even kill a single enemy!","I suspect that the two of them are spies sent by the alliance army!”","“A spy?” Park Jinchuan’s brows twitched when he heard this word. He was obviously moved.","Seeing his reaction, Peng Qi knew that he was reminded of the defeat caused by the spies of the alliance army, so he seized the opportunity to add fuel to the fire.","“Lord Piao, think about it. With their strength, how could they not kill a single enemy? There was obviously a problem! I didn’t want to find trouble with them for no reason, but I saw that they were too suspicious and wanted to ask them clearly. Who knew that they would actually directly knock me unconscious! What did this mean? It meant that they were guilty!","He was afraid that I would be exposed if I asked too much, so he wanted to strike first...”","Peng Qi was also a smart person and knew that Pu Jinchuan valued Li Moying and the rest so there was no meaning in arguing about who would make the first move.","The only way to bring down this young man and woman was to accuse them of the most sensitive crime and slander them as spies!","In the early years, the alliance army would often send dark attributed martial artists to disguise as demons and sneak into their barracks.","The Dark Attribute practitioner’s Profound Energy was 70% similar to the Devil Qi. Under the circumstances where the difference in strength between the two sides was huge, ordinary Devil soldiers could not differentiate at all.","The demon race had experienced many defeats because of this.","Of course, it was unrealistic to use such a crime to slander the elderly in the military camp."]},{"number":4481,"title":"Chapter 4481 Meritorious service (27)","paragraphs":["4481 Meritorious service (27)","Furthermore, Huang Yueli and Li Moying had participated in this battle but they didn’t even manage to kill a single member of the alliance army. This was a fact.","Peng Qi’s move could not be said to not be smart.","Hearing that, Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance as they secretly rejoiced in their hearts. Luckily they listened to Jun Sihan’s opinion or else, facing such a situation, they would be in trouble.","Pu Jinchuan furrowed his brows and pondered for a while. His gaze fell on the two of them, and he emphasized,” That’s right. What Peng Qi said makes some sense. Why don’t you explain why you couldn’t even kill a single human in this battle? What are you doing?”","Hearing the obvious threat and displeasure in Pu Jinchuan’s words, the corners of Peng Qi’s mouth curled into a cold smile.","These two rookies had caused him to be in this state. Even if he died, he would definitely drag them down with him!","Now, they were suspected of being spies. Even if Pu Jinchuan did not kill them, they would not be able to sit in the position of deputy general. Moreover, Lord Ruijiang was never soft-hearted. They would die here sooner or later.","Peng Qi stared intently at Huang Yueli and the rest, waiting to see the terrified expressions on their faces.","However, who knew that the two of them were so calm, as if they did not realize how mysterious Park Jinchuan’s question was.","In fact, Huang Yueli even gave a faint smile.","“Sir Piao, you’ve misunderstood us. There is a reason why my husband and I did not kill the enemy.”","“Earlier on the battlefield, we saw a white tiger divine guard from the alliance army appearing and killing the deputy general. We rushed over to save him but we were a step too late. We wanted to kill that white tiger to avenge the deputy general.”","“In the end, I didn’t expect that white tiger to be so crafty. When he saw that there were only two of us, he actually ran away. We chased after him for a distance and fought with him for a while. Just when we were about to kill him, another expert from the Gods Race appeared and saved him...”","“Divine guards of the White Tiger Race?” Pu Jinchuan was stunned for a moment, and Jing Shaoyuan’s face immediately appeared in his mind.","It was normal for young demons who had never been to the front lines to not know Jing Shaoyuan, but Pu Jinchuan was very familiar with Jing Shaoyuan.","This young white tiger expert who had been guarding the vicinity of You An City for many years, his strength had improved by leaps and bounds recently. Even if Lord Rui Jiang obtained that ” treasure “, there were still countless devil experts who suffered great losses under his hands.","He then asked Huang Yueli a few more questions, all of which were related to Jing Shaoyuan’s appearance and fighting style. Seeing Huang Yueli answer them fluently without missing a single word, he gradually relaxed.","” So you’ve been pestered by that jinx, Jing Shaoyuan. It’s no wonder. You guys are quite capable to be able to fight him for so long...”","A young demon like Peng Qi would usually take a detour when he saw Jing Shaoyuan, so how could he dare to chase after him?","This proved Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s abilities from another angle.","Listening to Pu Jinchuan’s words, it seemed that not only did he not intend to punish Huang Yueli and the rest for their crimes, he even had the intention of rewarding them.","He was so anxious that he shouted again,” Lord Piao, please don’t be fooled by their nonsense! What they said was too fake. What kind of strength did Jing Shaoyuan have? The two of them could at most escape from Jing Shaoyuan’s hands, but he said he almost killed him? You’re bragging so ridiculously. Only a ghost would believe you!”"]},{"number":4482,"title":"Chapter 4482 Meritorious service (28)","paragraphs":["4482 Meritorious service (28)","All the demons who had spent some time on the front line knew Jing Shaoyuan’s name.","After all, even Peng Qi was merely a first-rate genius in the Pill Light Region. He was not even ranked in the fiend race’s capital city!","With such strength, how could he dare to challenge Jing Shaoyuan?","Therefore, Peng Qi’s words convinced quite a number of people. In the crowd, there were gradually soft discussions.","Park Jinchuan also frowned and seemed a little hesitant.” This...”","Li Moying and the rest had really given him a huge problem!","It was really wrong to believe them, and it was also wrong not to believe them...","“Captains, since you said that you fought with Jing Shaoyuan for so long, can you tell me more about the details of your fight? Don’t blame me for being paranoid. This matter is really too coincidental. Just based on your empty words, I really can’t tell if what you said is true or false...”","The only way Pu Jinchuan could think of was to continue asking questions to verify.","Everyone thought that in order to win Pu Jinchuan’s trust, Li Moying and his wife would definitely nod their heads immediately and continue to be interrogated.","But who knew that Huang Yueli waved her hand and rejected this suggestion on the spot,” I think it’s better to forget about it. After asking so many questions, when will it end? Even if we answer this question, Captain Peng can still find a new reason to say that we are spies...”","“So, you are refusing to answer?” Pu Jinchuan frowned, and his eyes turned sharp.” Do you know that if you refuse to answer, it’s equivalent to admitting that you’re spies!”","His words were so harsh that the surrounding demon soldiers subconsciously trembled.","Peng Qi, who was lying on the ground and unable to get up, had a trace of wild joy flash across his eyes!","These two newcomers really didn’t know the rules at all. They actually thought that they could challenge Lord Piao just because they had some strength! How dare you refuse to answer the question!","This was really courting death!","This time, he would definitely be able to take revenge!","The atmosphere at the scene was extremely tense but Huang Yueli still appeared extremely calm,” Who said that not answering those stupid questions is admitting to the crime? When have we ever admitted that we are spies? We dared to say that because...We have evidence to prove our innocence!”","“Evidence? What evidence?” Pu Jinchuan asked in surprise.","Didn’t they just fight once and successfully escaped? What evidence did they want to leave behind?","Huang Yueli put her hand into her sleeve and when she took it out again, between her two slender and fair fingers, there was a token!","As the military advisor of the main camp, Pu Jinchuan was no stranger to the things of the alliance army. He recognized it at a glance. It was Jing Shaoyuan’s transfer token!","He was stunned for a few breaths before regaining his senses and immediately shot towards Huang Yueli as he stretched out his hand to take that Commander’s Seal.","“This... This was Jing Shaoyuan’s transfer order! You guys... How did you get it? This was the symbol of his status and the power to mobilize tens of thousands of troops!","He would rather die than leave!”"]},{"number":4483,"title":"Chapter 4483: Meritorious service (29)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4483: Meritorious service (29)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s hand loosened and the commander’s seal landed in Pu Jinchuan’s hands.","Park Jinchuan couldn’t care less about anything else. He raised the commander’s seal and looked at it in the direction of the sunlight. He observed it carefully and even used his hand to slowly feel the patterns on the commander’s seal, not letting go of any detail.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Park Jinchuan and the commander’s seal in his hand. They did not even dare to breathe loudly.","Peng Qi’s entire body stiffened as he looked at Pu Jinchuan without moving.","He kept repeating in his heart, Impossible, this is absolutely impossible! This must have been forged by those two bastards! No matter how strong the two of them were, how could they have gotten their hands on Jing Shaoyuan’s Commander’s Seal? This... This must be fake!","However, no matter how much he prayed, it was useless.","Park Jinchuan spent nearly 15 minutes checking the commander’s seal before he sighed deeply.","“This... This commander’s seal should be real. When I was on the battlefield, I saw the commander transfer talismans hanging on the waists of the alliance army divine guards from afar. Moreover, these Commander Transfer","Talismans were mid-grade artifacts refined by the God Clan’s spiritual artifact masters. A unique mystic force field would form around the artifacts. If the spiritual artifact’s grade was not high enough, it would be easy to sense it. This...","It’s indeed Jing Shaoyuan’s military dispatch token...”","Although the artifact masters of the fiend race were far inferior to those of the god race, with Pu Jinchuan’s status, he had seen many god race spirit artifacts seized on the battlefield.","The Commander’s Seal that Huang Yueli took out...lt was definitely a masterpiece that could only be completed by a master artifact craftsman of the God Clan!","Of course, what Pu Jinchuan didn’t know was that if Huang Yueli really wanted to forge such a thing, it wasn’t that she couldn’t do it, but it was just that there wasn’t any need for it now.","Hearing Pu Jinchuan’s words, all the demons were stunned and could not help but exclaim.","“What is it? It really is Jing Shaoyuan’s Commander’s Seal!”","“Then...That’s the most important thing to Jing Shaoyuan. How could it fall into their hands?”","“Could it be that what they said just now was true? They almost killed Jing Shaoyuan?”","Peng Qi’s face was ashen.","The commander’s seal that damned little girl took out was real!","Then the two of them would be able to step on his head and ascend to the throne of deputy general with the credit of this commander’s seal!","He... There was no chance for him to turn things around.","That was indeed the case.","Pu Jinchuan’s face immediately revealed a satisfied smile.” Young Master Li,","Madam Li, your strength really surprised me! I didn’t expect that our Pill Light Region would actually produce such a genius. With your strength, I’m afraid that you’re not much different from the geniuses of those large factions in the capital...","His tone towards Huang Yueli and Li Moying was even more intimate than before, and there was even a trace of undetectable flattery.","Demons had always been very realistic. It was normal to praise the high and trample the low.","The two youths with such outstanding talent would definitely surpass Pu Jinchuan in terms of strength and status in the future. He naturally did not want to offend them.","Huang Yueli’s expression was indifferent,” Lord Piao is too kind. We have been chasing after Jing Shaoyuan for so long and he even managed to escape. This matter is too embarrassing and I didn’t want to say it but in order to prove my innocence, I can only confess. Compared to the geniuses of the capital, we naturally don’t dare to be ashamed, but we are definitely not spies!”","‘ Of course you’re not spies,” Pu Jinchuan said hastily.” You’re the future pillars of our Pill Light Ridge!” Someone actually dared to slander you! This person is really sinister.. I think the person who said that is the spy of the Shen clan!”"]},{"number":4484,"title":"Chapter 4484: Where is the talisman?(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4484: Where is the talisman?(l)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Peng Qi heard Pu Jinchuan’s words, his head buzzed, and he instantly lost all hope.","He knew that he was completely finished this time. Piao Jinchuan’s words were no different from a death sentence for him.","As expected, Park Jinchuan glanced at him and said coldly,” Men, drag this spy who dared to falsely accuse the two Captains away and lock him up properly.","He will be publicly executed at the entrance of the camp at noon tomorrow. Let everyone see it and learn a lesson! Under Lord Ruijiang’s command, there is no need for such a two-faced villain!”","Park Jinchuan’s personal guards responded and walked forward to drag him away.","Peng Qi was heavily injured and could not resist at all.","Moreover, he knew that he would definitely die, so he no longer had the thought of resisting. He no longer cried out for injustice and was directly dragged away.","After dealing with Peng Qi, Pu Jinchuan turned around and faced Huang Yueli and Li Moying once again.","“The two of you, I didn’t expect you to be able to make such a huge contribution! With this Commander Seal, the position of Deputy General can only be taken by one of the two of you.”","He first praised them, then suddenly stopped and changed the topic.” However, before that, I still want to bring the two of you to meet Lord Ruijiang. Don’t be nervous, Lord Ruijiang has always been thirsty for talents. He likes young people with outstanding talents like you the most. He will definitely be very surprised to see you. Perhaps, he will even reward you a lot!”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying exchanged a glance and both had a feeling that it was as expected.","It was impossible for such an important position to be given to a newcomer without a review.","Therefore, they had to meet Ruijiang.","This was the real test for them.","As a powerhouse at the peak of the late stage of the Heavenly Demon Realm, Rui Jiang was an important lord of the demon race who was a gauge of strength and status. His foresight was definitely not something that a counselor like","Parle Tinohnnn? ? ? ? ? ? rnmnnrp tn","Ordinary people might not be able to see the problem with Huang Yueli and Li Moying but Rui Jiang might be able to see it.","Although the two of them had already fought with Rui Jiang a few months ago and did not reveal any flaws at that time, Rui Jiang was unprepared at that time and did not suspect their identities at all. Today was different. He would definitely investigate the situation of the two of them seriously.","There might be a possibility of being exposed...","Even so, Huang Yueli didn’t feel any fear in her heart. On the contrary, she felt a little excited.","Even if Rui Jiang didn’t summon them, they had to secretly approach him. Their goal was to find out where Rui Jiang had hidden the ancient formation talisman!","Now that they had such an opportunity, it saved them a lot of trouble.","Huang Yueli’s thoughts raced as her lips hung a faint smile,” My husband and I came from a small place so we don’t know the rules of the main camp so I would like Sir Piao to give us some pointers! Since Lord Ruijiang has given the order, let’s go over and pay our respects.”","Pu Jinchuan led the way while Huang Yueli and Li Moying followed behind him at a moderate pace, arriving at the largest tent in the middle of the campsite.","Park Jinchuan stopped in his tracks and turned around.” I’ll go in first to inform them. You guys wait outside for a while.”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying stood at the entrance of the tent without saying a word, not even exchanging glances.","Peak Heavenly Fiend powerhouses indeed lived up to their reputation, not the slightest bit inferior to the Celestials ‘peak Dao Profound Realm. Even across the tent, the two people could clearly sense that kind of powerful pressure on","Rui Jiang’s body.."]},{"number":4485,"title":"Chapter 4485: Where is the talisman?(2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4485: Where is the talisman?(2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two of them did not dare to take any risks and did not dare to do anything unnecessary. They waited quietly at the door.","Not long after, Park Jinchuan walked out again and gestured for the two of them to follow him in.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying followed behind Pu Jinchuan as they walked towards the tent.","The moment the curtain was pulled up, a powerful and sharp demonic qi rushed straight towards the dantian in their chests!","This aura suddenly erupted without any warning and bombarded the two people’s chests. It was menacing. If they did not immediately circulate the strength in their bodies to resist it, they would probably be seriously injured on the spot!","Huang Yueli’s pupils suddenly enlarged.","Pu Jinchuan had clearly said that he wanted to promote them, which was why he brought them to meet Rui Jiang. Who knew that Rui Jiang would release such a killer move the moment he entered the door!","This clearly wanted their lives!","However, after a moment of shock, Huang Yueli immediately reacted.","Her face revealed an obvious look of fear, and her body trembled slightly. Then, she only used 70% of the evil qi in her body to form a shield in front of her chest to block Rui Jiang’s attack.","Just as the two forces were about to collide, Ruijiang’s demonic energy","suddenly stopped in mid-air. Then, it slowly returned to Ruijiang’s body.","“Ke ke, the strength of the two of you is indeed extraordinary. Under my surprise attack, not only were you not immediately stunned by the pressure, you were even able to calmly deal with it. Among the young people, be it in terms of strength or experience in facing enemies, you are considered very good.”","Rui Jiang’s laughter rang out in the empty tent. It was obvious that he was in a good mood.","Huang Yueli secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","It seemed that she had made the right bet just now!","Earlier when Rui Jiang suddenly made a move, it was indeed to test her and Li Moying.","Because Rui Jiang’s attack was too unexpected, the person who was attacked would definitely use his strongest defensive skill to defend at the first moment. Moreover, he would also subconsciously use the cultivation technique he was most familiar with.","If the two of them were disguised dark attributed warriors of the God Clan, they would be exposed on the spot. Moreover, they could use this to assess their strength.","It had to be said that Rui Jiang’s move was very sinister and very smart.","But he had overlooked one point, which was that Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s abilities were much higher than he had imagined!","Therefore, even in the face of his surprise attack, the two of them could still calmly deal with it and even hide their true strength.","Of course, with only seventy percent of the evil aura, even if it was Huang Yueli, she was far from being Rui Jiang’s match. But what she was betting on was that Rui Jiang wouldn’t really want to kill her and Li Moying so this was definitely just a probe!","In fact, she was right.","And Li Moying who was beside her was also connected to her heart and mind. Even if there wasn’t any communication, the two of them used the same method to deal with it.","Rui Jiang had indeed been deceived by them. After this test, he basically had no doubts about the two of them.","Seeing that they were still on guard, he laughed loudly,” You guys don’t have to be so afraid. I’m just testing your strength. After all, Old Park said that you guys can fight against Jing Shaoyuan of the White Tiger Race. If I don’t verify your strength, I really won’t believe it.”","“Oh? So, Mizuki Lord, what’s the result of your verification? Are you satisfied with the strength of this couple?” Li Moying lowered his gaze as he said","respectfully.."]},{"number":4486,"title":"Chapter 4486: Where is the Commander’s Seal?(3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4486: Where is the Commander’s Seal?(3)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang’s line of sight swept across Li Moying’s expressionless handsome face, appearing even more satisfied.","“Not bad, really not bad. You and this little girl are stronger than I imagined!","When did our fiend race produce geniuses like you, I actually didn’t know at all! If I’m not wrong, you should be from the capital, right?”","Li Moying didn’t even raise his eyebrows,” Forgive this subordinate for not having any comment. Since I’ve already left the clan and established my own sect, I won’t bring up the past anymore.”","His answer was very clever.","Although saying this might anger Rui Jiang and make him unhappy, but Li Moying was betting on the fact that the war was imminent and Rui Jiang really needed him and Huang Yueli to charge into the enemy lines for him, so it was impossible for him to punish them just because his attitude wasn’t good.","Moreover, he didn’t know anything about the Demon Race’s Imperial City. If he had to think of a way to make things up, there was a 99% chance that there would be a flaw. It was better to directly refuse.","As expected, Rui Jiang frowned when she heard his words. She looked displeased.","However, after a few breaths, he calmed down and smiled again.” Forget it, it doesn’t matter which family you were from in the past. Since you’ve already become my subordinates, you have to be loyal to me and serve me well! As long as you are loyal, I will not treat you unfairly.”","Rui Jiang had just tested the strength of the two people and did not find any flaws. He believed that they were indeed demons, and their strength was indeed as strong as they described, so he finally put down his doubts.","After Rui Jiang interrogated Li Moying for a few more sentences, he gradually revealed an appreciative expression.","“Not bad, you’re really not bad! Young people with talent like you are crazy. Do you really think that you can do whatever you want just because you have heaven-defying talent? Hehe, little do you know that there are always people better than you. Crazy people who don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth die the fastest!”","“There aren’t many people as steady as you. Brat, you have a bright future ahead of you. You might even become a well-known figure in the demon race in the future!”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she couldn’t help but ridicule in her heart, Her husband would definitely become famous in the Devil Race in the future and after they killed Rui Jiang, it would be hard not to become famous...","However, she didn’t think about this now.","Usually, because of Li Moying’s reticence, when they met outsiders, it would be Huang Yueli who would come out to socialize but today, she had completely handed over the task of greeting Rui Jiang to Li Moying.","Because she had more important things to do-to find the whereabouts of Rui Jiang’s commander seal!","From the moment she stepped into the tent, Huang Yueli had carefully released her spiritual perception as she carefully searched the area within the tent.","Furthermore, when Li Moying was chatting with Rui Jiang, he was extremely cautious as he probed the area around Rui Jiang inch by inch.","According to her and Li Moying’s judgement, since Rui Jiang had obtained such a precious life bound magical treasure, in order to prevent it from being stolen or destroyed, the most likely thing was to keep it by his side, keeping it close to him.","Therefore, there was a 99% chance that the commander’s seal was in this tent.","It might even be hung on Rui Jiang’s personal collection.","But after entering the tent, the situation was out of Huang Yueli’s expectations.","This was because she did not feel any powerful aura emitted by her natal Dharma treasure in this tent!"]},{"number":4487,"title":"Chapter 4487: Where is the Commander’s Seal?(4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4487: Where is the Commander’s Seal?(4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This was too surprising!","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment and quickly made a judgment.","There were only two possibilities for this to happen.","Either that, or Rui Jiang’s actions were different from what they had expected. She had no intention of keeping the talisman close to her, and the item was not in this tent!","The other possibility was that Rui Jiang had another treasure on him that was used to hide the aura of the magic treasure. It could suppress the mystic qi emitted by the array talisman.","However, the second possibility was very low.","This was because the formation talisman in Rui Jiang’s hand was a life-bound magical treasure. It was not easy to hide the aura of such a treasure.","With the level of the fiend race’s refining, the possibility of being able to do this was almost zero.","Therefore, there was a 99% chance that the talisman was not here...","Realizing this point, Huang Yueli’s brows furrowed slightly.","They were in big trouble now!","Rui Jiang had hidden the talisman, so even if they killed him, it would be useless. The more important task was to find out where the talisman was!","Huang Yueli used her divine senses to probe every inch of space in the tent and after confirming that her judgement was correct, she gave Li Moying a look.","Li Moying understood and didn’t continue chatting with Rui Jiang as he gradually led the topic to the conflict that happened earlier.","“Lord Ruijiang, I was impulsive just now and injured your capable subordinate.","However, he was the one who insulted me and my wife first. I can’t help but lose my temper. Please forgive me...”","“Sigh, do you need my forgiveness for this? How big is it?” Rui Jiang waved his hand, looking very casual. It could be seen that he did not take Peng Qi’s life or death to heart at all.","“This kid has always been arrogant and despotic in the army. I’m not surprised at all that he would end up like this today! In my camp, you can be arrogant and domineering, but you have to have the corresponding strength to match it! He was considered the strongest among the younger generation in the camp back then, so I didn’t bother with him. But now, his strength is obviously inferior to yours, and he still dares to clamor in front of you. This is courting death! No strength, no brains, he deserves to die!”","Rui Jiang’s few words determined Peng Qi’s life and death.","Then, she completely forgot about him and changed the topic.","“Oh right, I heard that the deputy general of your brigade died in battle today.","Now that Peng Qi can’t make it, I’ll let you take the position of deputy general. Don’t disappoint me! It would be best if he could kill Jing Shaoyuan in the next battle! If you can do it, I will reward you handsomely!”","Li Moying hurriedly nodded his head in agreement,” Yes, thank you Lord for your high regard. This subordinate will definitely do his best!”","Huang Yueli also cupped her fists in greeting.","“Alright, you guys can leave.”","Rui Jiang was just about to get someone to send him off when Huang Yueli’s mind moved as she stood up and took a step forward.","“My Lord, this subordinate... This subordinate still has one thing that I don’t understand and would like to ask you..","“What is it?” Rui Jiang frowned, somewhat surprised.","Huang Yueli lowered her head as she cautiously said: ” Lord Overlord, when I was fighting today, I had already felt that my strength was lacking and was at a disadvantage. Seeing that my army was about to be defeated, I didn’t expect that a warm current would suddenly surge into my body and my strength had soared by a huge margin! This... What was going on? I... I’ve never practiced such a cultivation technique before..”"]},{"number":4488,"title":"Chapter 4488: Where is the talisman?(5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4488: Where is the talisman?(5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Rui Jiang heard this, he narrowed his eyes and swept his sharp gaze across her.","His gaze carried some invisible pressure. To ordinary demons, it was already completely unbearable.","But Huang Yueli still straightened her back as she stood on the spot without moving.","Although her attitude seemed very respectful, her expression was very calm, perfectly displaying the bearing that a talented young demon genius should have.","Even Ruijiang could not find any flaws in her, so he could only attribute her question to curiosity.","“Of course, this has nothing to do with what cultivation technique you cultivate. Your strength has increased because I recently obtained a treasure from the twelve continents of the God Clan. As long as I activate this treasure, the strength of the demons within a certain range will increase!","“What is it? There was such a treasure! Lord Ruijiang, you are indeed one of the strongest lords of our race. Other than you, who else is worthy of possessing such a powerful treasure?","Huang Yueli’s face was filled with pleasant surprise as she said loudly.","Li Moying who was behind her twitched his lips.","Li ‘eri s act... His acting was really too exaggerated. If he were Ruijiang, he would probably vomit blood on the spot when he heard such unembellished flattery.","Although Rui Jiang was a fiend, he was still a peak late-stage Skyfiend powerhouse! He should still have this bit of knowledge...Right? How could he be fooled by such exaggerated acting skills?","However, reality proved that Li Moying had thought too much.","After Rui Jiang heard Huang Yueli’s exaggerated flattery, his face revealed an extremely comfortable expression. Looking at this little lass Huang Yueli, he felt that she was becoming more and more pleasing to the eye.","“Hmm, not bad. Little girl, you really know how to talk! However, what you said is indeed the truth. I’ve advanced another place on the Heavenly Demon List this year. The old fellows who can block me are really getting fewer and fewer!","Huang Yueli saw that he had taken the bait and naturally followed the bait, further flattering him.","Things like Xuan Jiuling that old scoundrel is no match for Lord Rui Jiang and Lord Rui Jiang will soon flatten You ‘an City were all thrown out as if they were free.","The more Li Moying listened, the more speechless he became, almost unable to hold back his laughter.","Sigh, his wife was so bold and straightforward! He dared to say anything! Super cute!","If these words were to spread back to You An City, would Xuan Jiuling die on the spot?","Fortunately, although these words were infuriating, the effect was surprisingly good.","Under Huang Yueli’s continuous compliments, Rui Jiangs gaze towards her became more and more intimate.","“Good, little girl, you’re not bad! He’s much stronger than you, my little husband! In my opinion, the position of deputy general should not be given to him, but to you! Just let him be your subordinate and train him well!” Hearing this, Huang Yueli almost burst out laughing.","She finally managed to hold it in. She turned her head and glanced at her husband with a faint smile.","She just relied on a few words and snatched Li Moyings Deputy General position away!","Although this Devil Race’s Deputy General didn’t put the two of them in his eyes, but this at least showed that her eloquence was better than Li Moyings!","Huang Yueli gave Li Moying a you understand ‘I look and turned back once again. Her expression was much more serious as she put on a righteous and loyal look,” I’m indebted to Lord Rui Jiangs high regard.. This subordinate will definitely not disappoint you and will serve you with all my might!"]},{"number":4489,"title":"Chapter 4489: Where is the talisman?(6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4489: Where is the talisman?(6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Very good. You’re really not bad, little girl! From now on, you will be the fourth deputy general under this lord! Work hard. As long as we can take down You ‘an City this time, you two will definitely benefit!”","Although Rui Jiang was arrogant, he still had some tricks up his sleeve to be able to sit on the position of Lord.","He was still willing to spend some effort to win over subordinates that he thought were of value.","He was so happy from Huang Yueli i s coaxing that not only did he give her the position of Deputy General, he even gave her and Li Moying a lot of rewards.","“Men, reward Deputy General Li and her husband with five bottles of Earth Grade medicinal pills and two secret techniques...Oh right, there’s also the standardized spiritual weapons that we just seized from the Protoss a few days ago. You guys can also pick two! You’re all the clan’s top geniuses, ordinary gold spirit coins, you also don’t care, these things are still practical.”","When she heard that Rui Jiang was planning to reward her, Huang Yueli i s eyes lit up immediately.","However, when she heard the contents of the reward, she almost couldn’t hold it in. The corners of her mouth twitched a few times before she barely resisted the urge to vomit blood.","Who said she didn’t like gold spirit coins!","She was also very interested in this kind of currency circulated by the demon race, alright? At least he could buy something he needed.","And Rui Jiang refused to give it to her!","What Earth Grade medicinal pills, she had plenty of them, even quite a few Heaven Grade ones.","She couldn’t practice the secret technique of the demon race. Even if she could, she wouldn’t risk going berserk by practicing such a useless technique.","As for the standard spiritual weapon seized from the god race... Haha! She was the one who contracted it!","However, Rui Jiang couldn’t understand her feelings at all. After she finished speaking, she looked at her and Li Moying with a smug expression, waiting for the two young ‘devil geniuses’ to be moved to tears!","Just by looking at the envious eyes of the guards at the side, he knew that he had indeed paid a huge price in order to win over the two of them!","How could the demons be so poor...","Huang Yueli wanted to cry but she could only put on a wild expression on her face,” Lord Rui Jiang, this is too...Too... This subordinate is really flattered. This subordinate has just arrived at the military camp and hasn’t made any contributions yet, but he has already received so many rewards. This is really... 1 1 m ashamed to accept it...l...","Even though she was thick-skinned, she could not continue.","But Rui Jiang was already extremely touched as he looked at Huang Yueli below the stage with satisfaction and nodded his head inwardly, ‘Look at this lass, she’s so happy that her voice was trembling. It seems like she’s already completely won over by him!","How would he know that Huang Yueli’s heart was filled with depression and that trembling voice was all from depression.","After finally dealing with Rui Jiang, Huang Yueli and Li Moying left the Middle Corps tent and returned to their own camp.","Before they could enter the tent, the captains of the various teams of the Fourth Brigade had already gathered together with their subordinates.","As soon as they saw the two of them, they scrambled to flatter them.","“Deputy General Li, I was blind in the past and did not know that you were so strong. If I have offended you in any way, please forgive me...","“Deputy General Li, this subordinate will be your subordinate in the future. If you have any instructions, this subordinate will definitely do his best!”","“Deputy General Li, this subordinate has already tidied up the largest tent. You and Madam will stay here. If you feel uncomfortable, feel free to tell me. Please, Madam, please...","Hearing this, the other captains pounded their chests and stomped their feet in frustration.","This bootlicker actually took the initiative to clean up the Deputy General’s tent. How could they not have thought of this!","The bootlicker proudly shook his head as he bowed towards Li Moying,” Deputy General Li?”","“Hehe, I’m sorry. You’ve got the wrong person. I am your new Deputy General.” Huang Yueli opened her mouth unhurriedly.."]},{"number":4490,"title":"Chapter 4490: Where is the talisman?(7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4490: Where is the talisman?(7)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","What?!”","How is that possible?!”","The mo present all cried out in shock, their jaws almost falling to the ground.","No one had expected that the newly appointed Deputy General wasn’t Li Moying, but Huang Yueli who had always been by his side!","What was going on?","The one who had injured Peng Qi earlier was Li Moying and the one who received Pu Jinchuan’s praise was also Li Moying so why did the title of general fall onto Huang Yueli after the two of them made a trip to Rui Jiangs place?","Even though they couldn’t figure it out, the devils reacted very quickly and immediately surrounded her, changing their target as they flattered Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli didn’t bother with them as she directly pulled Li Moyings hand and went straight into the tent, even chasing out those subordinates who wanted to follow in.","There was no one around, and the tent flap was tightly shut.","Huang Yueli then let go of Li Moyings hand and lifted her chin smugly,” Husband, how is it? Now... You are my subordinate! Shouldn’t you express something?”","The corners of Li Moyings lips curled up slightly as his usually cold eyes flashed with an obvious smile.","“Madam, what do you want me to do?”","Huang Yueli cast a sidelong glance at him,” Didn’t you see how those devils fought to curry favor with me? Learn more. Kneel down and give me a big bow or something...","Before she could finish her sentence, she realised that Li Moying had unknowingly walked in front of her.","The distance between the two of them was too close and Huang Yueli subconsciously took a step back. Didn’t you hear what I said?”","“I heard you.”","“Then why aren’t you doing it quickly? Why are you so close to me? Aiyo!","Li Moying not only didn’t retreat as he was told, but instead pressed on even harder.","Huang Yueli took a few steps back and suddenly she missed a step as she fell backwards with her back facing downwards, falling onto the simple camp bed in the tent.","Li Moying took the opportunity to bend one leg and climbed onto the bed.","His tall and sturdy body pressed down towards Huang Yueli and his strong and powerful muscles rose and fell slightly with his movements. Even through the cloth, one could see the distinct lines.","Huang Yueli’s breathing stagnated as her heart skipped a beat and she almost had a nosebleed.","It was only when she met Li Moyings seemingly smiling eyes that she regained her senses and hurriedly stretched out her hand to press against his chest, stopping him from getting any closer.","“Husband, you..Calm down! I still have something important to tell you!’","“Yes, go ahead.”","Li Moving’s voice sounded extremely calm, just like an upright gentleman who was sitting still.","But only Huang Yueli knew that he had already lowered his head and stuck onto her slender neck, gently caressing it.","Huang Yueli’s voice was a little unsteady,” You like this...What should I say!’","It’s good that you didn’t say it. It seems like we haven’t dual cultivated for a few days. Li ‘er, how can we slack off in cultivation? We should persevere every day. As the saying goes, if you don’t advance, you will fall back...”","“You... You don’t want to cultivate at all...” Huang Yueli silently spat out blood.","Ever since she got the secret manual of dual cultivation, her husband had more and more reasons to pester her. It profoundly explained what a shameless man was!","“Wait a moment, first... Listen to me!”","Huang Yueli’s eyes and hands were quick as she covered the man’s perfectly shaped thin lips in time.. She quickly said: ‘I If I’m not mistaken, I seem to have sensed the position of the talisman!”"]},{"number":4491,"title":"Chapter 4491: Where is the talisman?(8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4491: Where is the talisman?(8)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying was startled for a moment as his dark as ink starry eyes narrowed as all his movements stopped.","“You sensed the location of the talisman? Really? You’re not lying to me, right?” “Why would I lie to you?” Huang Yueli rolled her eyes at him.","Li Moying’s sexy thin lips curled up slightly as he smiled lightly,” Because...”","You don’t want to dual cultivate with me?”","“You also know that you only think about dual cultivation every day? I’m not afraid of overindulging!”","Huang Yueli forcefully pushed the shameless man to the side before sitting up, her small face filled with a solemn expression.","” I’m serious. I didn’t sense the aura of that supreme treasure when I was in Rui Jiang’s tent just now. However, on the way back, this Phoenix Feather Plate sensed it.”","Huang Yueli said as she took out a small and exquisite array disc from the Sky Phoenix Ring.","This array plate was only the size of a palm, but it looked extremely exquisite. Even under the dim yellow oil lamp’s illumination, it was still flowing with colors and emitted a faint red light.","This Phoenix Feather Array Disk was something she had just stolen from the Phoenix clan’s treasure vault a while ago.","Although, in terms of grade, it was merely a top grade treasured weapon and at the start Huang Yueli didn’t really take a fancy to it.","But just as her fingers touched the array disc and before she could even pick it up, Zhao Lin’s face revealed a pained expression which instantly piqued Huang Yueli’s interest as she immediately changed her mind and kept the array disc into her space.","Later on, she took some time to do a rough research and found that the Phoenix Feather Array Disk’s true function was to sense the energy emitted by the supreme treasure. In other words, it was a sharp weapon for treasure hunting.","After experimenting, they found that as long as there was a treasure within a hundred miles, it would react. The closer it was, the more intense the reaction. When it was near the treasure, the needle made of phoenix feathers on the top of the array plate would spin crazily.","Just now, on their way back to the camp, the needle of the Phoenix Feather Array Disk had moved a few times as if it had sensed something.","Li Moying sat a little closer as he turned his head and his gaze landed on the Phoenix Feather Array Plate.","The Phoenix Feather Needle was still vibrating slightly. Although the vibration was very small, there was no wind leaking in from the surroundings of the tent. Therefore, this could only be caused by the imbalance of the surrounding energy.","“Looks like Rui Jiang’s talisman is indeed not with him. Instead, it’s in a secret place not far from here...However, why didn’t Rui Jiang keep the talisman under his nose?” Li Moying frowned slightly.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and said: ” I’ve been thinking about this question earlier. It seems that the only explanation is that Rui Jiang feels that that place is even safer than his side!”","“It’s safer than being by his side...” Li Moying muttered to himself for a moment,” Either the array talisman is in the hands of a devil race powerhouse who is even more powerful than him but I don’t think there would be a devil king level powerhouse in the camp. If there really was such a person, how could he possibly listen to Rui Jiang’s command and have long snatched the commanding rights.”","The demons did not respect the elderly and the wise like the gods.","In the demon territory, whoever was stronger was the boss. It was impossible for the strong to listen to the weak.","“Yes, I think so too.”","Huang Yueli nodded her head vigorously as she continued: ” There’s another possibility. The place where Auspicious River stored the array talisman is extremely dangerous..”"]},{"number":4492,"title":"Chapter 4492: Where is the talisman?(9)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4492: Where is the talisman?(9)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Danger...You mean, are there any dangerous treasure troves nearby?” Li Moying asked.","“Yes!” Huang Yueli smiled,” This is the most likely scenario. There must be some secret hidden in this treasure trove. It was very dangerous, and it might even be more dangerous than Ruijiang himself! However...”","She changed the topic.” However, it might be dangerous for the demons, but not necessarily for us.”","Li Moying looked at Luo Chenxi’s confident little face and was slightly startled before he understood.","Generally, the reason why a place used to hide treasures was dangerous was either because there were all kinds of fatal traps, or there were divine beasts or high-grade spiritual beasts guarding it.","However, the demons were not good at taming spirit beasts, and it was even more impossible for divine beasts to lower their noble heads and listen to the command of a mere Heavenly Demon like Rui Jiang. Therefore, the place where Rui Jiang had placed the treasure of the array talisman was most likely to have a dangerous mechanism.","And to Huang Yueli, this was actually good news.","She was the most talented young spiritual artifact master in the twelve continents of the God Clan. She had a deep understanding of spiritual artifacts and mechanisms.","Especially when she was living in seclusion in Cloudy Qilin Clan, she had even secretly obtained many related ancient books from Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret treasury through Li Moying. Now her vision was totally different from when she had just ascended.","Therefore, she was confident that she could find the talisman.","However, Li Moying frowned slightly,” What you said is indeed correct but you must promise me first that when we reach the treasure trove later, if you encounter any accidents or danger, don’t flaunt your abilities and pay attention to your own safety...”","“I know, I know! Husband, why are you so long-winded now?” Huang Yueli waved her little hand and urged: ” Hurry up, let’s hurry up and get out!” She jumped up from the bed and rushed out of the door.","What a joke, don’t think that she didn’t feel it. The two of them had been discussing serious matters for such a long time but Li Moying’s body temperature didn’t show any signs of dropping!","If they continued to discuss, this man might not be able to hold back his bestial nature and pester her again!","She didn’t like to be surrounded by a group of demons!","“Wait”,","Li Moying hurriedly stood up as he grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist and pulled her back.","In the next second, his large hand reached out to Huang Yueli’s chest...","‘ Li Moying, what do you want...","Just as Huang Yueli was about to question him, she saw that large hand with distinct joints moving agilely, fixing the buckle that she had loosened earlier on the bed.","“I’ll go with you to get the talisman first. This is indeed not a good place for dual cultivation. When we return to You ‘an City, we’ll...”","Li Moying’s low laughter rang out beside her ear, sexy and deep. Huang Yueli’s small face turned red as she couldn’t help but pinch him.","” I’ll be very busy when I get back to You ‘an City. I don’t have time for you!","Hurry up and leave!”","The two of them lifted the tent flap and looked around.","The night was dark, and the demon camp was silent. Only a few teams of patrolling soldiers came and went.","The two of them used their movement mystic skills and easily entered the blind spots of these soldiers ‘line of sight, secretly leaving the camp.."]},{"number":4493,"title":"Chapter 4493: Where is the talisman?(10)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4493: Where is the talisman?(10)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Alright, now head 500 meters east...Then, he turned south...Ah, there’s a small hill ahead? Why don’t we go around first...”","Huang Yueli took out the Phoenix Feather Array Disk from her space and carefully held it in her palm. Looking at the direction the Phoenix Spirit Feather was pointing at, she adjusted the direction the two of them were heading towards.","Li Moying followed behind her with the attitude of a protector as his cold and sharp black eyes narrowed slightly, vigilantly observing the situation around him.","However, they were very lucky.","It was very quiet around the campsite. Not to mention the demons, they had not even encountered a single spirit beast.","The two of them traveled without any obstacles. Soon, they arrived in front of an abandoned straw hut and stopped.","Huang Yueli took a look at the array plate in her hand and said: ” The Phoenix Feather needle keeps spinning and I can’t determine the direction. It seems that we should be very close to our destination...”","Li Moying’s gaze swept past the front of the straw hut as he frowned slightly,”","This straw hut looks rather old and the dust in front of the door is so thick, it should be many years since anyone had stepped foot in it. Are you sure this is the place where Auspicious River hid its treasures?”","The straw hut was a little tattered but this wasn’t too big of a problem. Having been to so many mystic regions, Li Moying naturally knew that many treasures would be hidden in such inconspicuous places.","However, there were so many opportunities at the entrance that it was very problematic.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes,” What you said makes sense. But I feel that there must be some kind of array set up around here to conceal the real situation.","Moreover, the entrance we are seeing now might not be the real entrance!","Husband, retreat ten meters first.”","Hearing Huang Yueli’s order, Li Moying immediately took a few steps back.","However, it was not as far as ten meters.","He was ready at all times. If any danger happened, he had to protect his woman well. Naturally, he could not be too far away.","Huang Yueli guessed his thoughts and felt a little helpless and sweet at the same time. She didn’t say anything more and just held the array plate with one hand while her other hand’s five fingers curled slightly. Facing the direction of the moonlight, she started to calculate rapidly.","Li Moying didn’t say a word, even his breathing became lighter as he waited quietly at the side.","Huang Yueli walked three rounds around the grass hut and changed directions, walking another three rounds.","Finally, it stopped.","“Tsk tsk, if I’m not wrong, this is a huge defensive array formation. Moreover, the design was so ingenious that it made people gasp in amazement! The array perfectly utilized the surrounding environment and perfectly combined with the spirit vein below the grass hut. With the help of the energy in the spirit vein, it could smoothly operate for ten thousand years even without anyone maintaining it. This is definitely not something that Rui Jiang can set up. It should be a cave abode of an ancient expert that he accidentally discovered.”","“This formation not only has the ability to block the eyes, but it also has a very powerful counterattack effect. If you don’t find the entrance and forcefully enter, you will definitely suffer the backlash of the formation and don’t even think about taking a step into the grass hut! Fortunately, we didn’t barge in.” The situation sounded very dangerous.","But Li Moying wasn’t nervous at all and even revealed a smile,” But this won’t trouble my wife right?”"]},{"number":4494,"title":"Chapter 4494: Where is the talisman?(ll)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4494: Where is the talisman?(ll)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s lips curled up slightly,” That’s of course, why don’t you take a look at who I am!”","She spoke very casually, but she was still very cautious in her actions.","He carefully checked the surrounding situation and calculated again to verify it. Finally, he raised his hand and formed a series of spells in the air.","A faint black aura seeped out from her fingers. Evil Qi seeped out of her body and spread in four directions around the grass hut.","When they were less than ten meters away from the straw hut, the energy seemed to have hit something and stopped.","Then, there was a loud bang!","What followed was an intense energy backlash as Huang Yueli’s evil aura was reflected back several times. Black smoke and dust rolled and rolled as they pounced towards the two of them.","Li Moying’s eyes and hands were quick as he grabbed Huang Yueli’s slim waist and brought her back a few hundred meters.","” Alright, there’s no danger anymore. Moying, let go of me first.”","The black smoke had already dispersed but the man behind her still refused to let go. Huang Yueli urged him and at the same time, her small hand pushed her husband’s strong and muscular arm.","“I’m not taking any risks!” Huang Yueli pursed her lips as she tried her best to explain to the overly nervous man,” I already have a way to break this array and I was just testing it out earlier. Although...There was a small accident, but now I understand the rules of the array formation’s operation better. Next time, there will definitely be no problem!”","Li Moying frowned as he looked at her, obviously not believing her.","Huang Yueli stomped her feet anxiously,” I’m serious! If you don’t believe me, look over there!”","She stretched out her arm and pointed in the direction of the straw hut.","Li Moying turned his head to take a look and couldn’t help but be slightly startled.","The surroundings of the straw hut were originally empty except for a few piles ot straw, which were piled up in a mess.","But now, a black wall had appeared out of nowhere around the grass hut, covering the entire hut. The wall seemed to be wrapped in some kind of invisible energy. As the surrounding Heaven and Earth Profound Energy fluctuated, it kept emitting traces of black gas. Under the dim moonlight, it looked dark and cold, which was quite scary.","“This ruin...lt should have been left behind by a demon powerhouse. Even the defensive array formation was driven by demonic qi. No wonder Rui Jiang could store the treasure here without worry. He felt that it was safer than keeping it by his side...”","Li Moying looked at the towering black wall in front of him as he said thoughtfully.","Even though he wasn’t a formidable spirit weapon craftsman like his little fox, but as the young master of Cloudy Qilin Clan, he had read countless ancient records of the clan’s hide-and-seek, so his judgment was still very sharp.","Formation techniques were not exclusive to the gods and humans. The demonic qi of the demons could also be used to drive the formation.","Moreover, the array that was driven by the Demonic Qi could only be broken by the Demonic Qi. If the Shen clan’s experts wanted to use their own Dark Force to forcefully break through, not only would they suffer a backlash, they would only be able to destroy everything inside and outside the array. It was impossible to obtain the treasures inside.","Therefore, this treasure trove was absolutely safe and reliable for Ruijiang.."]},{"number":4495,"title":"Chapter 4495: Unexpected (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4495: Unexpected (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Rui Jiang probably would never have dreamt that there were actually two freaks like Li Moying and Huang Yueli in this world. As peerless geniuses of the ancient god race, they had cultivated the cultivation method of an evil cultivator.","The evil Qi on his body had also been tempered several times, and was not much different from the demonic Qi of the demons.","Not only could they activate the array, but they also had enough strength and vision to break through from the outside world.","Huang Yueli took advantage of the moment when Li Moying was in a daze to give him a push on his chest, leaving his embrace as she walked towards the direction of the grass hut.","With the previous experience of almost suffering a backlash, Huang Yueli’s expression turned even more solemn.","Li Moying watched as she walked a few rounds around the black wall and not knowing what was going on, an ominous premonition suddenly rose in his heart.","He immediately became alert.","As a Divine Grade genius with a strong spiritual awareness, he and Huang Yueli’s premonition towards danger was extremely sharp and it was rare for their judgement to be wrong.","But as he looked left and right, he couldn’t sense any danger in the surroundings and didn’t dare to interrupt Huang Yueli’s calculations. He could only hold the sword hilt tightly in his hand, concentrating even more on his guard.","After almost two hours, Huang Yueli’s rhythmic footsteps suddenly stopped.","Her speed was extremely fast. In just a few breaths, she had changed dozens of hand seals.","A black evil aura lingered between her jade-like fingers, looking mysterious and cold.","The evil Qi seeped into the black outer wall of the array bit by bit. Every time it fused, a dazzling light would be emitted from the outer wall. Clear array marks would appear one after another.","Li Moying had been nervously watching Huang Yueli’s every minute movement, fearing that any accidents would happen during the process of breaking the array.","However, this time, he seemed to have guessed wrong.","Huang Yueli quickly changed over a hundred hand seals and the colour of the grass hut’s outer wall turned from the dark midnight colour to a faint black mist which spread out in all directions.","The entire process was very smooth, and there were no signs of backlash at all.","Finally, Huang Yueli gathered the evil energy in her body and suddenly threw out a palm towards the front of the straw hut.","A violent tremor came, and the ground kept shaking back and forth. When the tremor stopped, the straw hut that had originally stood in front of the two of them disappeared. In its place was a towering tree that reached into the clouds.","In front of the giant tree was a bronze door.","The door was already open, revealing a pitch-black passage that seemed bottomless.","“This... It should be the entrance to the cave abode.” Huang Yueli revealed an excited expression, “That’s great! I didn’t expect it to be so smooth. The first time I came into contact with the array formation set up by a fiend race powerhouse, it was easily settled!”","Before she could finish, she felt a warm touch on her forehead.","Li Moying walked over as he raised his hand to wipe off the sweat on her forehead. The corners of his lips were slightly smiling as he lowered his head to kiss her lips,” Mn, I knew that my wifey’s innate talent is outstanding and there’s nothing that you can’t handle.”","“If you say that, then... That’s too exaggerated...” Huang Yueli’s face turned red as she was secretly kissed and praised again... She hurriedly changed the topic,” That.” I’m going to enter the cave abode next....”"]},{"number":4496,"title":"Chapter 4496: Unexpected (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4496: Unexpected (2)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying nodded his head,” Alright, let’s go down now.”","He took a step forward and was just about to walk together with Huang Yueli when he didn’t expect that Huang Yueli’s feet didn’t move and even stretched out her right hand to block his chest.","“Wait, husband, I just said that ‘I’ entered the cave abode. You... Don’t go in.”","Li Moying immediately frowned,” What?! You want to go in alone? No, it’s not like you don’t know that anything can happen in these ancient ruins. It’s the most dangerous! How can I let you go down alone?”","Huang Yueli looked at him smilingly as she stretched out her hand to pat the man’s shoulder, trying her best to comfort her husband.","“Husband, I understand what you mean. I don’t have to force myself, but...He needed someone to stand guard at the door! Think about it, this cave abode was used by Auspicious River to hide such an important treasure. This also meant that he could come here at any time to take away the array talisman. If he suddenly comes over while we’re inside, we’ll be doomed!”","Hearing this, Li Moying was slightly startled as his eyes narrowed.","He had no choice but to admit that what Huang Yueli said made sense.","Normally, when stealing something, there would definitely be someone watching.","Otherwise, if the master of the cave suddenly returned, he could have caught the two thieves on the spot.","But to let Huang Yueli enter the cave dwelling alone and face so many complicated and dangerous traps...","“Alright, husband, do you not believe in your wife’s strength?” Huang Yueli leaned over and muttered softly beside Li Moying’s ear.","‘ Don’t worry, I’m not a newbie. I’ll definitely do what I can. If I encounter a trap that I can’t crack, I’ll immediately retreat. I won’t force myself, I swear!” Huang Yueli’s big eyes flashed, looking extremely sincere.","However, Li Moying merely shot her a glance as he gave a cold snort,” You still know what’s called acting within your capabilities? Do you think this is the first day I’ve met you?”","No one knew better than him what kind of person his wife was.","This little fox’s guts... He was really fat!","If it weren’t for him watching from the side, she would have caused a huge incident anytime and anywhere!","Of course, Li Moying also knew that as a practitioner, Huang Yueli’s fearless character gave her the possibility of continuously breaking through her limits. The reason why she could have today’s achievements was inseparable from her guts.","However, even though he knew, he still didn’t like his woman to take risks.","Hearing Li Moying’s words, Huang Yueli pouted her lips unhappily,” You you...How can you say that about me? As if you know what it means to act according to your ability! It’s the same for everyone, okay?”","If she really wanted to argue, Li Moying was even more exaggerated than her, he didn’t even blink when he risked his life.","Li Moying took a deep breath as he stared at her,” That was in the past! After we got married, I’ve already tried my best to be as careful as possible. After all, I’m a man with a family. I have to consider the wife at home...”","“Then I’m also a woman with a family! How do you know that I won’t consider my family?” Huang Yueli raised her chin, her face full of unwillingness.."]},{"number":4497,"title":"Chapter 4497: Unexpected (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4497: Unexpected (3)","Translator: Miqtv Cloud Translations Editor: Miqtv Cloud Translations","Li Moying was stumped by the question as he couldn’t answer.","Speaking of which, Huang Yueli was indeed much more cautious than before and would take the initiative to avoid danger many times.","If it weren’t for their extraordinary talent and the fact that they had obtained Saint Xie Ying’s Dual Cultivation Technique, their cultivation would have been affected.","Thinking up to this point, Li Moying’s imposing manner instantly didn’t feel that strong.","“Li ‘er, I’m not saying that you’re wrong...Alright, I admit that I was thinking too much. Your arrangement just now is indeed the most suitable. We’ll do as you say.”","Huang Yueli looked at his tensed face and sighed to herself as she leaned over and kissed him on the cheek.","Husband, don’t worry. I know what to do. Besides, since we’ve been practicing the Wicked Shadow Canon, our minds are connected. If I’m in danger, you’ll be able to sense it immediately.”","“Besides, in comparison, the situation you’re facing is actually more dangerous than mine. If Rui Jiang really appears, you’ll have to face him alone. If we’re talking about worry, I’m more worried than you are...”","Before she could finish her sentence, Li Moying stretched out his index finger and pressed it against her lips,” Don’t worry, even if Rui Jiang comes personally, he won’t be able to do anything to me. You have to have confidence in your man.”","“Alright, I believe you. I’ll be leaving then.”","Li Moying didn’t stop her anymore as he furrowed his brows slightly as he watched her back view slowly disappear into the dark shadows.","After Huang Yueli entered the main door, she quickly realised that their initial speculation wasn’t wrong. This was indeed a cave dwelling left behind by a devil expert.","Although it looked like an ordinary straw hut from the outside, it was a different world inside the cave abode. It was a huge castle.","Long and narrow corridors intersected with each other. On both sides of the corridors were countless rooms. At a glance, one could not see the end.","Huang Yueli walked in for a while before stopping and once again took out the Phoenix Feather Array Disk.","After entering the cave dwelling, the Phoenix Feather Needle no longer spun with all its might.","But even so, the Phoenix Feather Array Disk did not provide her with much help.","Because the entire array plate seemed to be enveloped by a layer of black demonic qi. No matter how Huang Yueli spun it, no matter how much Profound Energy ????????????? injected, the???????? array plate didn’t have any reaction and the array markings around the array plate couldn’t be activated at all.","“Looks like this formation plate has completely failed..","Huang Yueli felt it was a pity as she frowned and muttered a few words before she could only keep the array disc.","This time, she was in a difficult position.","Before she came in, she did not expect that the interior of this fiend race cave dwelling would actually have such a structure.","In the past, she had entered the cave abodes of many Protoss and human experts. Whether it was a courtyard house or a palace, there would definitely be a main room inside, which was used to store the most important treasures. Moreover, since the structure of the cave abode was very similar to that of an ordinary residence, it was easy to judge which room was more important.","However, it was different here.","There were so many corridors and so many rooms. They were octagonal and symmetrical. Moreover, the number of rooms was shocking. Just the rooms she passed by earlier had already numbered dozens, and this was only the first floor!","It was impossible for such a huge cave abode to have only one floor.","The total number of rooms was even more shocking!"]},{"number":4498,"title":"Chapter 4498: Unexpected (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4498: Unexpected (4)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But after Huang Yueli carefully observed for a while, she quickly discovered a trace of abnormality.","The decorative patterns on the doors of every room here were actually the same!","One had to know that these patterns looked like decorations on the surface, but they were actually very exquisite array patterns. There was a powerful defensive array attached to them. Once they were broken, the things in the room would be exposed to outsiders.","If the array patterns were the same, then the method to crack it would be the same. Then what was the point of setting up so many rooms?","Huang Yueli frowned as she pondered for a moment before she took out an exquisite dagger from the Sky Phoenix Ring and carved a cross mark on the door of one of the rooms.","Then, she continued walking forward.","As he walked straight ahead, he drew a cross in front of every door he passed.","Along the way, ????? did not turn ????? head.","The number of rooms that she had marked also gradually increased from one to two, to ten, to twenty...","Not knowing how far she had walked, Huang Yueli’s footsteps suddenly stopped.","This mark was very obvious. She had left it when she passed by just now.","This also meant that although she did not look back just now, she had unknowingly returned to the starting point.","This situation was really too strange.","But Huang Yueli’s face didn’t have a trace of fear. Instead, she muttered to herself: ” It’s indeed like this! Just as I had guessed, these rooms did not really exist. Instead, the owner of the cave abode had set up an illusion array to confuse the people in the array...Therefore, the number of rooms should be limited. However, there should be a large number of Mirror Image Illusory Arrays around...”","Although she had seen through the hidden mystery in the cave dwelling, but Huang Yueli was still secretly shocked.","Because, based on her understanding of array techniques, in order to achieve such an effect, she needed to set up at least 12 illusion arrays. Moreover, these illusion arrays had to be connected to each other and echo each other from afar to ensure that the connection between so many rooms was seamless and did not reveal any flaws.","This was extremely difficult for the array masters of the god race.","There were very few people who could do it.","And the owner of this cave abode was a fiend race powerhouse!","But when she thought about the defensive array that she and Li Moying saw outside the cave dwelling, she couldn’t help but admit defeat. It seemed that this time around, she had met a true array expert from the Devil Race.","“The Demon Clan’s Illusory Formation seems to be different from the God Clan’s. The Illusory Formations that I’ve come into contact with in the past require all kinds of crystals and gemstones to replenish their energy. Therefore, as long as I can find the flaw when the energy fluctuates, I can break the formation accurately. However, the Demon Race’s Illusory","Formation...I’ve been in here for so long, but I haven’t sensed any energy","changes in the surroundings...”","Huang Yueli stopped in her tracks as she propped up her chin with one hand as her gaze fell on those simple array patterns on the door as she silently","pondered."]},{"number":4499,"title":"Chapter 4499: Unexpected (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4499: Unexpected (5)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","If possible, she was willing to stay in the cave abode and carefully study the array formations of these demons. She would definitely learn a lot.","However, they were in a hurry now. If she stayed in the cave dwelling for too long and met Rui Jiang coming to retrieve the array talisman, then it would be troublesome.","Therefore, she could only save as much time as possible and use the fastest speed to crack the array.","Huang Yueli stood by the door and didn’t move at all as she carefully observed for half an hour. After that, she once again walked in the direction of the corridor.","When she returned to her original spot, her eyes were filled with confidence.","“I see...Although this array pattern is more complicated than I imagined, it is not too difficult to crack it...","Devil race’s array was very special and even with Huang Yueli’s innate talent in array techniques, in such a short period of time, it was impossible for her to completely understand it, so she only had a rough understanding of it.","If it was just an illusion array, she would not be able to break it.","However, the array formation in this cave abode was special because it was formed by the overlapping of twelve illusion arrays.","On the surface, it looked like the stacked illusion array was more perfect, enough to fool all practitioners who stepped into the array. But in the eyes of an array genius like Huang Yueli, such an array had its fatal flaw!","Huang Yueli supported her chin as she looked at the ancient and simple array patterns on the door in front of her thoughtfully.","After a while, she walked to the door and stopped. She stretched out her right hand and slowly pressed on the center of the array pattern. At the same time, she circulated the evil qi in her body and poured it into the illusion array.","She was very careful at first, afraid that the influx of external forces would cause the array to move abnormally, so she only dared to output a little bit of evil energy.","The evil aura in Huang Yueli’s body had just come into contact with the door when the array patterns on the door emitted a faint silver light. As her strength gradually poured in, the silver light was like a silver thread, gradually spreading out along the array patterns.","Huang Yueli held her breath as she used all her focus to control the speed and direction of the evil aura.","The silver light slowly flowed over the array patterns. Not long after, all the array patterns were filled with silver light.","Huang Yueli was on full alert as she stared at the door, prepared to welcome any possible changes.","However, a breath later, the already weak silver light suddenly extinguished.","The array pattern on the door returned to its original gray and lifeless appearance, as if nothing had happened just now.","And the evil Qi that Huang Yueli poured in was like a stone sinking into the ocean as it was completely absorbed by this illusion array.","Seeing this scene, Huang Yueli pursed her lips. Although she was a little disappointed, she wasn’t too surprised.","If this formation could be broken so easily, the master of the cave abode would not have spent so much effort and materials to set up the illusion formation here.","“What went wrong? My train of thought should be correct...Could it be that the amount of evil energy I injected just now was too little, and the energy fluctuations produced were unable to break the balance between the illusion formations?”"]},{"number":4500,"title":"Chapter 4500: Unexpected (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4500: Unexpected (6)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli pondered for a moment before placing her hand on the door again.","This time, she increased the speed at which the evil energy circulated in her body and injected energy into the array pattern again.","As the energy increased, the silver light in the array pattern became much brighter than before. However, after the silver light filled all the array patterns, it extinguished again.","Huang Yueli seemed to have expected this as her expression remained extremely calm, not even a frown on her face. The hand that was placed on the door did not move at all as she once again poured in her evil aura into the array pattern.","After two tests, she had more or less verified her guess.","Her idea of breaking the formation should be correct.","If her method of breaking the array was wrong, the cave dwelling would not be so calm now. It would definitely trigger all kinds of unknown mechanisms.","However, everything was calm now. This meant that there was nothing wrong with what she did. It was just that...Perhaps it was because she had not entered enough into the array just now.","After figuring out this point, Huang Yueli started to gradually increase the intensity of the evil energy she poured in as the aura in her body circulated rapidly, sparing no effort to attack the array.","The array patterns on the door gradually lit up and the brightness became stronger and stronger. From the initial weak light, it gradually turned into a dazzling golden light like the sun. Even Huang Yueli herself who was looking at it from a close distance was almost unable to open her eyes.","Huang Yueli’s heart was filled with joy. Looking at this trend, she had obviously made the right bet. The balance of this illusion array had already been destroyed by her and it was only a matter of time before it completely collapsed.","However, before she could get excited, she saw the dazzling golden array pattern suddenly darken a little.","Of course, this change was very weak. If it wasn’t for her sharp senses, she might not have noticed it at all.","But Huang Yueli still managed to capture this point very carefully and her heart instantly turned cold!","The golden light had dimmed, which meant that the energy she had poured in was still not enough!","However, how was this possible?","She had almost injected all the evil energy in her body into this array! One had to know that the evil aura in her body was left behind by Saint Evilshadow before he died. Although she and Li Moying had entered the mystic region together and she had only received a small portion, but Saint Evilshadow was a Late Life Profound Realm practitioner so a small portion of his evil aura was enough to match up to an ordinary peak Heavenly Devil practitioner.","Besides that, her cultivation of the ” Wicked Shadow Scripture ” had already reached a small success and after dual cultivation with Li Moying, her cultivation of the evil path cultivation method was the fastest.","If even she could not activate this array... Then how did Rui Jiang hide the talisman inside?","Just as Huang Yueli was deep in thought, the golden glow on the array pattern had obviously dimmed.","The speed at which it dimmed was the same as when it lit up.","In just a few breaths of time, it was no longer dazzling.","Huang Yueli knew that things were not going well and she could clearly feel that the evil energy that she had injected into her body didn’t return to her body because she failed to break the array but was silently absorbed by the array!","If she could not activate the array, then all the evil energy she had cultivated for so long would disappear...This was a price she could not afford!","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli gritted her teeth as she took out a pill that could stimulate her potential from her space and quickly swallowed it.."]}]);
